antumLogicsLabs/AI-Background-Remover-backend/commits/27d2e7ceeda84f68922b4140ebd30b81c9c98720/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:25:24Z","email":"omershahzad1111@gmail.com","name":"MomerS."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T11:25:24Z","email":"omershahzad1111@gmail.com","name":"MomerS."},"message":"feat(download): add format conversion and quality control to download endpoint\n\nExtend GET /api/download/{filename} with two optional query params:\n  - ?format=png|jpeg|webp  (default: png)\n  - ?quality=1-100         (default: 90, silently ignored for PNG)\n\nImplementation details:\n- Pillow converts in-memory — no extra files written to disk\n- JPEG alpha-channel flattened onto white background automatically\n- WebP uses method=6 for best compression ratio\n- PNG takes a fast path (FileResponse, no Pillow overhead)\n- Quality is clamped server-side [1, 100]\n- Path traversal protection preserved\n- Full Swagger docs via FastAPI Query descriptors\n\nCloses: feature/export-format-quality-slider","tree":{"sha":"b19437d0b23703d5a14d34e352dc94b05a176483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuantumLogicsLabs/AI-Background-Remover-backend/git/trees/b19437d0b23703d5a14d34e352dc94b05a176483"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuantumLogicsLabs/AI-Background-Remover-backend/git/commits/27d2e7ceeda84f68922b4140ebd30b81c9c98720","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119363345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer1216/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer1216/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer1216/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer1216/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer1216","id":119363345,"login":"omer1216","node_id":"U_kgDOBx1XEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.git