t/trees/48fe0549db9cb266ddc10ca069fe9d20b898cfc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/0ec398d059ba4b5957c6f96cc7e518b6d0cfcd85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/0ec398d059ba4b5957c6f96cc7e518b6d0cfcd85","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKDBlYzM5OGQwNTliYTRiNTk1N2M2Zjk2Y2M3ZTUxOGI2ZDBjZmNkODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/6a7b39ff3bdabdefa9306899828212325e8ff518","sha":"6a7b39ff3bdabdefa9306899828212325e8ff518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/6a7b39ff3bdabdefa9306899828212325e8ff518"}],"sha":"0ec398d059ba4b5957c6f96cc7e518b6d0cfcd85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/0ec398d059ba4b5957c6f96cc7e518b6d0cfcd85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/6a7b39ff3bdabdefa9306899828212325e8ff518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:13:09Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:13:09Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"feat: desktop-only mode, unified locator, and the nav/eval context race\n\nThree pieces, all born from a real session driving the Product QA v2 board\nthrough the desktop app with no API token available.\n\nDESKTOP-ONLY MODE. `desktopOnly` runs the server with no token: the API tools\nare simply absent and only the addressing and desktop tools register. It must\nbe asked for explicitly — a mistyped token still fails loudly rather than\nsilently degrading into the tokenless mode. `accountSlug` becomes a config\ninput because without a token there is no me{account{slug}} to read it from,\nand every URL needs it: a slug-less URL is a 404.\n\nUNIFIED LOCATOR (src/locator.ts). One address object every mode consumes. The\nAPI mode works from bare ids, but the browser and desktop modes need URLs, and\na URL cannot carry a group or a column — resolving once lets a caller dispatch\nto any mode without paying for discovery twice. URL shapes per\ndocs/interface-map.md §1.\n\nIN-PACKAGE DESKTOP DRIVER (src/desktop.ts). The twin of scripts/cdp-desktop.mjs.\nDuplicated on purpose: `scripts/` is not in package.json \"files\", so a published\ninstall cannot reach the standalone CLI. Keep the two in step, or delete one.\n\nTHE NAV/EVAL RACE (both drivers). Page.navigate destroys the JS execution\ncontext; an evaluate issued straight after runs against the dead context and\nreturns null — which reads exactly like \"the page loaded but the element is\nmissing\". waitForContext() probes until the new context answers. This is not\nhypothetical: a 40-item status sweep read NONE for 11 rows in a row through\nprecisely this race before it was understood.\n\nThe example account slug in the locator error is neutral (\"mycompany\") — the\nrepo is public and error strings should not name real accounts.\n\ntsc clean, 135 tests pass, dist/ rebuilt and desktop.js verified to load.","tree":{"sha":"3dc329c9f04f9a42d9077d575a0539bcec77be9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/3dc329c9f04f9a42d9077d575a0539bcec77be9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/6a7b39ff3bdabdefa9306899828212325e8ff518","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co