6ddd17a900bb9fef2d7869762f783b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T04:05:44Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T04:05:44Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"docs: harden the desktop debug-port security note\n\nSpell out that an unauthenticated localhost CDP port is reachable by any\nlocal process — browser extensions with native hosts, dev tooling, a\nmalicious npm postinstall — none of which need credentials to act as you.","tree":{"sha":"fb041e4238f7713f7d187200ea6a49cd3ed8b34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/fb041e4238f7713f7d187200ea6a49cd3ed8b34c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/30dd012a86ddd17a900bb9fef2d7869762f783b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/30dd012a86ddd17a900bb9fef2d7869762f783b5","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKDMwZGQwMTJhODZkZGQxN2E5MDBiYjlmZWYyZDc4Njk3NjJmNzgzYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571","sha":"3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571"}],"sha":"30dd012a86ddd17a900bb9fef2d7869762f783b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/30dd012a86ddd17a900bb9fef2d7869762f783b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T04:04:17Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T04:04:17Z","email":"ashley@raiteri.net","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"docs: map three ways to reach monday.com + desktop CDP driver\n\n- docs/interface-map.md: reverse-engineered map of addressing monday.com with\n  zero discovery spend across three transports (API, web app, desktop app),\n  a unified locator schema, routing, and a verbatim list of what could not be\n  resolved. Every claim tagged by how it was verified.\n- scripts/cdp-desktop.mjs: zero-dependency CDP client that drives the native\n  desktop app (Electron webview) over --remote-debugging-port, riding the\n  logged-in session with no API token.\n- README: rewritten as the top-level doc for all three modes; corrected the\n  read-only tool-count wording and added the dependency column type.","tree":{"sha":"67ff727bee19145290c4592976e55710b8ab6b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/67ff727bee19145290c4592976e55710b8ab6b89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/713675?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket","id":713675,"login":"ashrocket","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY3NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/3f2773bc0c2d8c6218fe8797b9e8856b01fc9571","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKDNmMjc3M2JjMGMyZDhjNjIxOGZlODc5N2I5ZTg4NTZiMDFmYzk1NzE"