ttps://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/967d8a32575ed94577232fed41ccf9376c02a774/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:58:56Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:58:56Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"fix: correct 20 defects found in a pre-publication audit\n\nA multi-agent audit reviewed the repo across six dimensions before the\nfirst public push. It raised 43 findings; six were verified adversarially\nand all six held. A completeness pass found the worst one.\n\nCorrectness against the real API:\n- The pinned API version 2024-10 was retired on 2026-02-15. monday.com\n  silently serves a retired version as the maintenance version, so every\n  request ran against an API the code did not target. Now 2026-07.\n- items() defaults to 25 rows. monday_get_items accepts 100 ids, so a\n  40 id request lost 15 items with no error. It now sends an explicit\n  limit and names any id that came back empty.\n- create_labels_if_missing could never work: local validation rejected the\n  new label first, and a status was sent as an index, which cannot create\n  a label. The flag now reaches the value builder and switches to the\n  label form.\n- A location was sent as {address}, which monday.com rejects. It stores\n  coordinates, so the server asks for lat and lng instead of guessing.\n- A country stored the two letter code as the country name.\n- A phone assumed every number was American.\n- The item name was marked unwritable, though monday.com accepts it.\n\nSafety:\n- The read-only guard missed \",mutation {...}\". GraphQL counts a comma as\n  whitespace, so that document ran.\n- monday_create_subitem failed under a board allow list AFTER creating the\n  subitem, because the hidden subitem board can never be in the list.\n- monday_update_item trusted a caller-supplied board_id, which decided both\n  the allow list check and which schema the values translated against.\n- monday_graphql was registered under an allow list but always failed.\n\nSilent wrong answers:\n- A not_any_of filter on the item name was rewritten to contains_text,\n  returning exactly the rows the caller asked to exclude.\n- Two columns sharing a title overwrote each other in a list result.\n- monday_list_users and monday_list_boards searched one page and reported\n  \"not found\" for anything past it.\n- An unanchored date pattern dropped the time from \"2026-08-14 rubbish\".\n\nClient:\n- A timed-out request was never retried: the regex looked for \"timeout\"\n  while the message said \"timed out\".\n- The timeout stopped at the headers, so a stalled body hung forever.\n- A throttle could block one tool call for three minutes, well past any\n  MCP client deadline. Retrying now stops at ~45 s and reports.\n- The 429 branch threw away monday.com''s own reset hint, and the retryable\n  error codes matched nothing the API emits today.\n- The token was redacted after truncation, so a token cut by the 400 char\n  limit survived in the message.\n\nPackaging:\n- chmod in the build script broke npm run build on Windows. CI now covers\n  Windows and macOS as well as Linux.\n- The npm name monday-mcp holds another publisher''s tombstone; the package\n  is now scoped.\n- typecheck skipped test/ entirely, so a broken test file kept CI green.\n- Source maps shipped pointing at a src/ the tarball excludes.\n- No prepare script, so a git install produced a package with a dead bin.\n\nTests go 82 -> 115. test/regressions.test.ts holds one test per defect,\nnamed after the behaviour that was wrong. Adds SECURITY.md and\nCONTRIBUTING.md.","tree":{"sha":"276125021c231121fb76d8b3777df1c8ace102f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/276125021c231121fb76d8b3777df1c8ace102f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/967d8a32575ed94577232fed41ccf9376c02a774","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113934254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/967d8a32575ed94577232fed41ccf9376c02a774","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKDk2N2Q4YTMyNTc1ZWQ5NDU3NzIzMmZlZDQxY2NmOTM3NmMwMmE3NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25","sha":"dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25"}],"sha":"967d8a32575ed94577232fed41ccf9376c02a774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/967d8a32575ed94577232fed41ccf9376c02a774"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113934254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:10:05Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:10:05Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"fix: match two monday.com API contracts exactly\n\nChecked against the published API reference before the first live run.\n\n- change_simple_column_value takes value: String!, not JSON!. The rename\n  path declared the wrong variable type and would have failed at the API.\n- compare_value in a query rule is always an array, the text operators\n  included. The contains_text path sent a bare string.","tree":{"sha":"eecc072e3fd981dbb95d3d583c8969b5afdd0159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/eecc072e3fd981dbb95d3d583c8969b5afdd0159"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113934254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKGRkMWE2NmZmOTQwY2Y1ZGU1OTc3ODE3OTgzNDhhYWJkYTg2N2RkMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359","sha":"6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359"}],"sha":"dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/dd1a66ff940cf5de597781798348aabda867dd25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113934254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T13:39:54Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T13:39:54Z","email":"ashleyraiteri@gmail.com","name":"@ashrocket"},"message":"feat: local MCP server for monday.com\n\nTalks straight to the monday.com GraphQL API over stdio. The token stays\non the machine that runs it.\n\nThe main problem it solves is column values. Every monday.com column type\nstores a different JSON shape, so a plain value such as \"Done\" fails\nsilently. This server translates a plain value into the stored shape, and\nrefuses a bad one before it sends a request.\n\n- 15 tools for boards, items, subitems, updates, users and workspaces\n- Column keys accept a column id or a column title\n- Status filters translate a label to its numeric index\n- Read-only mode and a board allow list\n- Permanent delete needs explicit confirmation\n- Complexity aware retry, plus a one minute board schema cache\n- 79 tests over an in-memory MCP transport and a fake API","tree":{"sha":"ae6a794a4e69c26d338c7b59c47458ba1c748924","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/trees/ae6a794a4e69c26d338c7b59c47458ba1c748924"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/git/commits/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113934254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oppfiashrocket","id":113934254,"login":"oppfiashrocket","node_id":"U_kgDOBsp_rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oppfiashrocket","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commit/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359","node_id":"C_kwDOTs2PwNoAKDY4MzVmZTQ5MDc3MmU1ZjcyNTU5NTNiMzQ5ODc2M2VhMWY4ZjczNTk","parents":[],"sha":"6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits/6835fe490772e5f7255953b3498763ea1f8f7359"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashrocket/monday-mcp/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=31a9087b922369cb75cb19329805d31af499ef05&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A06.899Z"}');
