.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCRlPIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/commits/2b6e97d61c3876aea844eaa8c56cb00515e7aaeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:48:56Z","email":"luisdossantos2001@gmail.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:48:56Z","email":"luisdossantos2001@gmail.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"message":"fix(playground): inline script was blocked by strict CSP — the web demo did nothing\n\nThe page sent Content-Security-Policy ''default-src self'' (no script-src),\nso the browser refused the inline <script>: the form never attached its\nsubmit handler and a native submit reloaded the page — ''I send messages\nand nothing happens''.\n\nVerified with headless Chromium: ''Executing inline script violates the\nfollowing Content Security Policy directive default-src self''.\n\nFix: move the chat logic to GET /playground.js (same origin, allowed by\ndefault-src ''self''; the JS route carries its own ''default-src none'' CSP),\nkeep the page CSP strict, and serve an empty 204 favicon so the console\nstays clean. The esc()-before-innerHTML XSS discipline (FRT-02) is\nunchanged — the tests now assert it against the JS route.\n\nVerified end-to-end in a real browser: EN + JA turns render tool chips,\ncitations, cost/latency status, conversation continuity — zero console\nerrors. Unit: 175 passed · e2e: 21 passed · lint/tsc clean.","tree":{"sha":"24aa2d85e1cc65412dd5e83f500b8972100c0b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/git/trees/24aa2d85e1cc65412dd5e83f500b8972100c0b95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/git/commits/2b6e97d61c3876aea844eaa8c56cb00515e7aaeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCRlPIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/commit/2b6e97d61c3876aea844eaa8c56cb00515e7aaeb","node_id":"C_kwDOTs20mtoAKDJiNmU5N2Q2MWMzODc2YWVhODQ0ZWFhOGM1NmNiMDA1MTVlN2FhZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/commit/d377bd1db15d239dd80355ac8bcc68247a745758","sha":"d377bd1db15d239dd80355ac8bcc68247a745758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/commits/d377bd1db15d239dd80355ac8bcc68247a745758"}],"sha":"2b6e97d61c3876aea844eaa8c56cb00515e7aaeb","url"