(SEC-01), key guard on\nGET /internal/alerts (SEC-02), no committed INTERNAL_KEY default — random in\ndemo, required in live (SEC-03), security headers middleware (SEC-06).\n\nReliability: notifier logs+counter on webhook failure (ERR-02), retry jitter\n(ERR-07), PayBrain circuit breaker (ERR-08), gzip compression (PER-07),\npagination on /internal/alerts (PER-03), request-id propagated to PayBrain\nvia AsyncLocalStorage (MON-05).\n\nQuality: wire llmLatencyMs metric, drop dead @nestjs/axios dep (ARC-04),\ndedupe EN_MONTHS (ARC-06), named constants for magic numbers (STY-08),\nreal terraform ECR (AIP-09), PrometheusRule + Grafana dashboard (MON-04/06),\ndeployment/staging/rollback docs (DEV-07/08), versioning + perf docs.\n\nFrontend: no credentials in playground JS (FRT-08), responsive + a11y\n(FRT-06/07). Tests: 168 unit (87% cov) + 20 e2e, order-independent.","tree":{"sha":"2445634c7751816771a177bae5f619917c4e924a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/git/trees/2445634c7751816771a177bae5f619917c4e924a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paytalk/git/commits/e9e059bdbf872bf5077ee62295354c128fe1093d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCRlPIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co