l.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"message":"feat(demo): double-click visual demo/live launcher + agent mock fixes\n\n- PAYLENS-DEMO.{sh,command,bat}: double-click launchers with a menu:\n  visual demo (offline) / live mode (real LLM) / browser demo\n- scripts/visual-demo.ts + bundled paylens-visual-demo.cjs (self-contained,\n  zero npm install) — 3-step walkthrough running the real core on the real\n  mock dataset: live categorization, monthly insights, agent tool calls\n- scripts/build-visual-demo.sh: rebuilds the bundle via esbuild\n- fix(agent): mock router uses the latest mock month instead of the\n  current calendar month (demo always answers with data)\n- fix(agent): interpolate tool results by call name so detect_anomalies\n  placeholders are filled (the tool returns a plain array)\n- fix(mock): Netflix/Disney+ seeds arrive pre-categorized as subscriptions\n  so the seeded duplicate (day 1, ±15%) is detected\n- fix(insights): duplicate pairs sorted cross-merchant first; narrative\n  amounts without the +/- sign\n- docs: README demo section + test count","tree":{"sha":"59889ff90eeddf899693bbd676da3d7f19475e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paylens/git/trees/59889ff90eeddf899693bbd676da3d7f19475e38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/paylens/git/commits/cff5db17f0f8987772bfd554d7fa5e047e2b424e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"