public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amarnath1810/Amarnath1810/commits/8e87522e70148e1d88d050bae85d865fe0a3ce56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T05:28:02Z","email":"veeramreddyamarnathreddy@gmail.com","name":"Amarnath1810"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T05:28:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update README.md\n\n# 👨‍💻 About Me\r\n\r\nHi there! 👋 I''m **Amarnath Reddy**, a passionate **Frontend Developer** with **3.5+ years of professional experience** specializing in building high-performance, scalable, and user-centric mobile and web applications.\r\n\r\nMy primary expertise lies in **React Native**, where I have developed and maintained enterprise-grade applications for both **Android** and **iOS**. Alongside mobile development, I have strong experience building modern web applications using **React.js** and **Next.js**, focusing on responsive design, performance optimization, and exceptional user experiences.\r\n\r\nThroughout my career, I have worked extensively on HRMS and enterprise applications, implementing modules such as **Attendance Management**, **Leave Requests**, **Employee Self Services**, **Project Management**, **Task Tracking**, **Loan Management**, **Assets**, **Travel Requests**, **Payslips**, **Salary Suspension**, **Notifications**, **Authentication**, and **Dashboard Analytics**.\r\n\r\nI enjoy transforming complex business requirements into clean, maintainable, and reusable code while following modern development practices. My focus is on creating intuitive interfaces, optimizing application performance, and delivering reliable software that provides real value to users.\r\n\r\n### 💼 What I Do\r\n\r\n- 📱 Develop cross-platform mobile applications using **React Native**\r\n- 🌐 Build fast and SEO-friendly web applications with **React.js** and **Next.js**\r\n- 🎨 Create modern, responsive, and accessible user interfaces\r\n- 🔄 Integrate REST APIs and GraphQL services\r\n- 📦 Manage application state using Redux and Redux Toolkit\r\n- 🔔 Implement Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) and push notifications\r\n- 🔐 Build secure authentication and authorization flows\r\n- 📂 Handle file uploads, downloads, PDF generation, and document management\r\n- 🌍 Develop multilingual applications with localization support\r\n- 🌙 Design reusable components with Light/Dark theme support\r\n- ⚡ Optimize application performance and improve user experience\r\n\r\n### 🛠 Technical Expertise\r\n\r\n- **Mobile Development:** React Native\r\n- **Frontend:** React.js, Next.js, JavaScript, TypeScript\r\n- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js\r\n- **Databases:** MongoDB, SQL\r\n- **State Management:** Redux, Redux Toolkit\r\n- **API Integration:** REST APIs, GraphQL\r\n- **Authentication:** JWT, Firebase Authentication\r\n- **Notifications:** Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), Notifee\r\n- **Tools:** Git, GitHub, Postman, Android Studio, Xcode, VS Code\r\n\r\n### 🌱 Currently Learning\r\n\r\n- Advanced Next.js\r\n- Micro Frontend Architecture\r\n- React Native Performance Optimization\r\n- AI Integration in Web & Mobile Applications\r\n- Cloud Deployment and DevOps Fundamentals\r\n\r\n### 🎯 Career Objective\r\n\r\nI am passionate about building impactful digital products and continuously expanding my technical expertise. I enjoy collaborating with teams, solving real-world problems, and creating applications that are scalable, maintainable, and user-friendly. My goal is to contribute to innovative projects while continuously learning new technologies and best practices in modern software development.\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Beyond Coding\r\n\r\nWhen I''m not coding, I enjoy exploring new technologies, experimenting with UI/UX ideas, contributing to personal projects, improving my development workflow, and staying up to date with the latest trends in mobile and web development.\r\n\r\n> **\"Code with purpose, build with passion, and never stop learning.\"**","tree":{"sha":"14db4b4b0