889fa2b76ca942cf57fd8d2f99e2ef5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/commits/131fe877b226df8dd8166341c6d29394770e1e73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:10Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:10Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Runs: start imports/exports from Studio, execute them on a worker, keep history and logs\n\nImports and exports could only be started from the CLI, nothing recorded what ran with\nwhich params and results, and the log of a run was scattered over the Monolog file log.\nThe existing async import dispatched one message per row, so cleaner, finishImport and\nnotifications never ran. Every execution is now a run (Doctrine entities Run/RunLog)\nthat is executed as a whole, synchronously, by the CLI, the request or a worker\nconsuming data_definitions_run (never retried, a failure is recorded as \"failed\").\n\nParams are stored unchanged as JSON and passed through, the Studio start dialog renders\na form from ParamsSchemaProviderInterface / the data_definitions.run.params_schema event\nplus a free JSON editor. Progress, counters and the records of the import_definition and\nexport_definition channels are written per run with DBAL (no flush of the shared entity\nmanager during an import) and pushed to Studio via private Mercure topics.\n\nA stopped import no longer runs the cleaner: its object list is incomplete and a deleter\nwould remove the objects of unprocessed rows. The ObjectsFetcher no longer reuses its\nlisting across runs of a long-running worker. CoreShopStudioFormBundle is registered,\nthe Studio plugins of coreshop/resource-bundle and rule-bundle need its services.\n\nCloses #20","tree":{"sha":"2e6b4fe3f10289b6208e6e102c6085ade3c79a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/git/trees/2e6b4fe3f10289b6208e6e102c6085ade3c79a95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/git/commits/131fe877b226df8dd8166341c6d29394770e1e73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"