:{"date":"2026-09-10T06:06:26Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Studio build: deterministic build id and build archive\n\n- rsbuild.config.ts derives the build id from the Studio sources, package.json, the lock file\n  and the config instead of a random UUID and writes .build-id into the output directory\n- npm run build packages the build with Pimcore''s studio-package-build into\n  src/DataDefinitionsBundle/Resources/build-dist/build-<id>.zip; the archive of an unchanged\n  id is kept untouched\n- the expanded build under Resources/public/studio is gitignored and extracted by Pimcore''s\n  BuildArchiveExtractor at cache warmup: WebpackEntryPointProvider implements\n  BuildArchiveProviderInterface via BuildArchiveExtractionTrait (studio-ui-bundle >= 2026.2)\n- the committed UUID build is removed, Resources/public keeps a .gitkeep\n- @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle 2026.2.5, uuid dropped\n\nCloses #7","tree":{"sha":"1d6b2533c686ee2012e09ef7cf8b5fe1e0182097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/git/trees/1d6b2533c686ee2012e09ef7cf8b5fe1e0182097"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/git/commits/e92a8bb28953f1d9872b66f8b6141e8fdc1bcb6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use