ers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-data-definitions/commits/fec53d47e9b24c4f1eeaa949f4f24054821bfaf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T14:34:46Z","email":"pfaffenbauer@cors.gmbh","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T14:34:46Z","email":"pfaffenbauer@cors.gmbh","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Studio only: drop the remaining classic-admin dependencies\n\n- ImportRuleController no longer extends the classic AdminAbstractController\n  (class does not exist in Pimcore 2026); plain Symfony AbstractController.\n- Studio plugin API service talks to /pimcore-studio/api/data_definitions\n  (the CoreShop resource routes accept both backends) and drops the classic\n  CSRF token round trip via /admin/login/csrf-token.\n- XLSX export/import of import rules ported from the classic panel into\n  ImportRuleConfig (buttons in the rule list, routes under\n  /pimcore-studio/api/data-definitions/import-rules).\n- PimcoreSettingsListener (pimcore.admin.indexAction.settings) and the admin\n  translation catalogue removed; the Studio catalogue gets the new labels.\n- Test app: Studio API firewall instead of the classic admin fi