i.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/722d4594c680938b57851268156b8595784517e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:52:04Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:52:04Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"message":"Kod editörü, çoklu kart çekirdeği ve fizik tabanlı simülasyon\n\nSimülasyon\n- Enerji vermek ile programı çalıştırmak ayrı iki eylem\n- Makine kodu kullanıcının çiziminden derleniyor (SBI/CBI/LDI/DEC/BRNE/RJMP)\n- Pinler yalnız pinMode(OUTPUT) ile sürülüyor; giriş uçları yüksek empedansta\n- Devre fiziği: buton kontağı, PWM parlaklığı, aktif-düşük yük, transistör anahtarlama\n\nKod editörü ve kartlar\n- Monaco paneli, şablonlar, satır bazlı hata işaretleme\n- Uno (avr8js) + ESP32/Pico/Deneyap davranış modeli\n- Çizim yorumlayıcısı: lexer, parser, sanal zamanlı VM\n\nDenetim\n- ERC 12 kural, kod/devre uyum denetimi, parça üstü hata rozetleri\n- Çalıştırma zinciri: elektrik → uyum → kod → çalıştır\n\nDiğer\n- JSON dışa/içe aktarma, dayanıklı yerel depolama\n- Alt istasyon arayüzü, kapanış animasyonu\n- 82 birim + 27 e2e testi\n- Takipten çıkarıldı: test-results artığı, kişisel başlatma betiği","tree":{"sha":"aede573cf3251f141061957b63baf6e6d066e5aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/trees/aede573cf3251f141061957b63baf6e6d066e5aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/commits/722d4594c680938b57851268156b8595784517e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/722d4594c680938b57851268156b8595784517e9","node_id":"C_kwDOTtbObtoAKDcyMmQ0NTk0YzY4MDkzOGI1Nzg1MTI2ODE1NmI4NTk1Nzg0NTE3ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/1195f0f448e48e1d41ad64cf20b9d48c3681def8","sha":"1195f0f448e48e1d41ad64cf20b9d48c3681def8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/1195f0f448e48e1d41ad64cf20b9d48c3681def8"}],"sha":"722d4594c680938b57851268156b8595784517e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/722d4594c680938b57851268156b8595784517e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"