ircuit` çıktısıyla değiştirildi — eski örnek\nartık var olmayan bir şema (iç içe source/target nesneleri) gösteriyordu.\n\nSimülasyonun zaten Web Worker''da çalıştığı düzeltildi; yol haritası\nmaddesi \"worker''a taşı\" yerine \"mesaj protokolünü sürümle\" oldu.","tree":{"sha":"32ec6c84ca05a7dcfc1ed575904c95f6db6d9d59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/trees/32ec6c84ca05a7dcfc1ed575904c95f6db6d9d59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/commits/b02af8c9de75afe64f1092eb15b670abdd7ef73d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/b02af8c9de75afe64f1092eb15b670abdd7ef73d","node_id":"C_kwDOTtbObtoAKGIwMmFmOGM5ZGU3NWFmZTY0ZjEwOTJlYjE1YjY3MGFiZGQ3ZWY3M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3","sha":"e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3"}],"sha":"b02af8c9de75afe64f1092eb15b670abdd7ef73d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/b02af8c9de75afe64f1092eb15b670abdd7ef73d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:19:42Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:19:42Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"message":"Üretim bağımlılıklarındaki güvenlik uyarılarını kapat\n\nnext 16.2.6 → 16.2.12: dokuz Next.js danışmanlığı (middleware bypass,\nServer Actions DoS/SSRF, önbellek karışıklığı, görüntü API DoS) kapanıyor.\n\nGeriye next''in içine sabitlenmiş `postcss@8.4.31` ve opsiyonel\n`sharp@0.34.5` kalıyordu. `npm audit fix --force` bunlar için next@9.3.3\nöneriyor, yani kabul edilemez bir geri alma; bunun yerine `overrides` ile\npostcss ^8.5.18 ve sharp ^0.35.3''e çekildiler.\n\nKilit dosyası da tazelendi: package.json''dan çıkmış olan drizzle-orm ve\ndrizzle-kit artıkları temizlendi.\n\n`npm audit --omit=dev` artık temiz. Dev tarafında kalan uyarılar\nwrangler/@cloudflare/vite-plugin zincirinde ve düzeltmeleri bildirilen\nsürüm aralığının dışına çıkıyor.","tree":{"sha":"64b7f6eee481c14d17ebf60d0e515dd5473ec731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/trees/64b7f6eee481c14d17ebf60d0e515dd5473ec731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/commits/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3","node_id":"C_kwDOTtbObtoAKGUxY2Y2NDhiYjU4ZTc3YzdiNWJhZjljN2E2YTQxMDNkYzg3ZmViZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28","sha":"b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28"}],"sha":"e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/e1cf648bb58e77c7b5baf9c7a6a4103dc87febe3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:18:49Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:18:49Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"message":"Devre editörünü elektriksel kural motoruyla sıkılaştır\n\nBileşenleri ayrı dosyalara çıkar (ComponentLibrary, WirePalette,\nAccessibleConnector) ve devre modeline gerçek elektriksel doğrulama ekle.\n\nDirenç artık net birleştirmesine girmiyor; netler arası \"köprü\" olarak\nmodelleniyor. Böylece düz kablodan ayırt edilebiliyor ve iki soru\nsorulabilir hâle geliyor: yolda akım sınırlayıcı var mı, bu bağlantı kısa\ndevre mi? `findBlinkCircuit` bunun üzerine D13 → LED halkasında en az bir\ndirenç arıyor — dirence paralel dirençsiz bir yol kalırsa da reddediyor.\n\nYeni `analyzeCircuit` altı kural işletiyor: kısa devre, besleme çakışması,\nçıkış çakışması, ters bağlı LED, akım sınırlayıcısız LED ve 3.3V/5V\nuyumsuzluğu. Hata seviyesindeki bulgular simülasyonu kilitliyor.\n\nDevre durumunu yazan tüm yollar tek bir `applyCircuitState` üzerinden\ngeçiyor. Kontrol daha önce yalnız `commit` içindeydi; geri al/ileri al ve\nyerel kayıttan yükleme atladığı için worker durduğu hâlde panel\n\"Çalışıyor\" göstermeye devam edebiliyordu.\n\nBreadboard''un her bloğunda CSS beş sıra delik çiziyor ama model iki sıra\npin tanımlıyordu; aradaki delikler görünüp bağlanamıyordu. Beş sıra da pin\noldu (24 → 60 delik), hedef boyutu ızgara adımına indirildi.\n\nMobil/duyarlı katman kaldırıldı: uygulama masaüstü hedefli tek düzene\nsabitlendi, dar pencerede yatay kaydırma bırakılıyor.","tree":{"sha":"c5b086ed05b0dc2049ae7dcea2b15b556f02f11b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/trees/c5b086ed05b0dc2049ae7dcea2b15b556f02f11b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/commits/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28","node_id":"C_kwDOTtbObtoAKGI2NjBjZjA1N2JkMmZlOTRlNDMwODhhNGMyM2NjZGJmMmNiZWJjMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a","sha":"ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a"}],"sha":"b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/b660cf057bd2fe94e43088a4c23ccdbf2cbebc28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/commits/ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:15:03Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:15:03Z","email":"alimkacaar@gmail.com","name":"Alim Kaçar"},"message":"TypeScript yapılandırmasını testlerle hizala\n\nTestler ve worker `node --experimental-strip-types` altında koştuğu için\niçe alma yolları `.ts` uzantısı taşıyor; `allowImportingTsExtensions`\nolmadan `tsc --noEmit` bunları hata sayıyordu.\n\nArtımlı derleme önbelleği `.vinext/` altına alınıp git dışında bırakılıyor,\n`exclude` listesine üretilen dizinler ekleniyor.","tree":{"sha":"4bd4ec36d005c70575f7a5a03e774ede4bbaba43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/trees/4bd4ec36d005c70575f7a5a03e774ede4bbaba43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimkacar/circuitlab/git/commits/ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152664355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar","id":152664355,"login":"alimkacar","node_id":"U_kgDOCRl5Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alimkacar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alimkacar/circuitlab/commit/ade1bbb0165106eac21ef95482f65c2207e3662a","node_id":"C_kwDOTtbObtoAKGFkZTFiYmIwMTY1MTA2ZWFjM