026-08-04T09:13:07Z","email":"a.shiwanshirajput09@gmail.com","name":"Amritanshu Shiwanshi"},"message":"Initial commit: StyleCare AI conversational-support POC\n\nAn independent, LimeChat-inspired portfolio POC — a WhatsApp-style AI\nsupport agent for a fictional D2C fashion brand. Hero journey is\nreturns (multi-turn slot-filling -> deterministic eligibility ->\nguarded creation), with order tracking as a supporting flow.\n\n- Backend: Node/TS/Express, Gemini function-calling orchestrator,\n  5 Gemini-visible tools, backend-only escalation/summary/reset,\n  Supabase Postgres (7 tables, dynamically seeded).\n- Frontend: React/TS/Vite/Tailwind SPA — /chat, /agent, /admin —\n  with a live Tool Activity panel, agent escalation dashboard, and\n  a Demo Control Panel for live per-prospect rebranding.\n- docs/: architecture diagram source and screenshots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xm41tKJMQhjFhbeemYctnb","tree":{"sha":"ab4d87229dd75cf8ed01ed62819f50dfa5b5edde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amritanshu009/stylecare-ai/git/trees/ab4d87229dd75cf8ed01ed62819f50dfa5b5edde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amritanshu009/stylecare-ai/git/commits/a73cb1e70631b160ffac910710d4dbe335e1df93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128715791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amritanshu009/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amritanshu009/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amritanshu009/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amritanshu009/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amritanshu009","id":128715791,"login":"amritanshu009","node_id":"U_kgDOB6wMDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amritanshu009/orgs","received_events_url":"https