v, runbook, alerts, CI audit\n\n- .env.example documenting every variable (VITE_* + backend demo vars); README env section\n- .dockerignore + Dockerfile no longer swallows install failures (npm ci || true removed)\n- nginx: X-Frame-Options, HSTS and a /health endpoint; k8s readinessProbe points at it\n- k8s/staging: full separate environment (namespace paysuite-staging) via ArgoCD\n- docs/operations.md: rollback (<5min), staging promotion, TLS enablement runbook\n- monitoring/prometheus-alerts.yml: backend-down, 5xx spike, latency, LLM-cost rules\n- CI: npm audit --omit=dev gate; Dependabot config (npm + GitHub Actions)","tree":{"sha":"b52a8906532d665a86b948a1a6eb8cb4f17290fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/trees/b52a8906532d665a86b948a1a6eb8cb4f17290fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/commits/bea94191eb2dcd06c366e46a9eed3431c5be71b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCRlPIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"ht