tos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:16:42Z","email":"luisdossantos2001@gmail.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"message":"fix(suite): resilience, friendly errors and the real search contract\n\nProduction-readiness audit fixes:\n- fetchWithTimeout: AbortController timeouts, exponential-backoff retries, X-Request-ID correlation, typed FetchError (timeout vs network)\n- Circuit breaker in HealthChecker: 6 consecutive failures open a 25s cooldown, half-open probe recovers automatically\n- Views check res.ok and show friendly localized errors (never String(err) or raw body dumps)\n- searchResponseSchema: /transactions/search nests results under data.results with transactionId — the view used to read a bare array and crashed rendering (verified against the live API)\n- probe() distinguishes timeout from network failures (timedOut flag)\n- CSS: visible :focus-visible styles; CSP: allow PayLens dev HMR websockets\n- Removed dead code (launcher.ts BACKEND_TARGETS/waitForHealthy — only used by tests)\n- scripts/verify-user-flows.mjs: end-user smoke that drives the real shell and fails on console errors","tree":{"sha":"f4671968be1311fb96bc803800e23884b1d4ee27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/trees/f4671968be1311fb96bc803800e23884b1d4ee27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/commits/af7dafe354166d7752e58030728e4a7805496b42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-de