om/users/luisdossantos-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/commits/a2ad655ce9d81e0b4f41acff4221275ba4b448de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:05:04Z","email":"luisdossantos2001@gmail.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:05:04Z","email":"luisdossantos2001@gmail.com","name":"Luis Daniel Dos Santos"},"message":"fix(ui): PayLens embed navigation + PayBrain fraud console feedback\n\nBug 1 — the PayLens embed looked broken and trapped the user:\n- PayLens'' sidebar links navigate by PATH (/paylens/insights) while its\n  Vue app routes by HASH (#/insights) — clicking Insights/Chat changed\n  the URL but never the view. The shell now bridges those clicks\n  (capture-phase handler in layout.ts, read-only consumption).\n- The Chat view (React micro-app) never mounted under /paylens: the\n  shell registers it for the embed route #/chat (same lifecycles, same\n  dev/prod URLs).\n- The embed grew the page to 7000px, scrolling the shell sidebar out of\n  view → impossible to navigate back. #pl-root now lives inside the\n  scrollable content area; the embed sidebar mirrors the active section.\n- PayLens'' pl-* shell styles are now imported from the submodule\n  (styles.css) so the embed no longer renders unstyled.\n\nBug 2 — fraud console buttons showed raw JSON with no feedback:\n- fraudDecisionSchema expected a PayLens-style shape; the real PayBrain\n  contract is { ok, data: FraudDecision } with action/reason/scores.\n  Schema rewritten against paybrain-api/src/common/types/fraud.ts.\n- The view now renders an action badge (APPROVE/FLAG/BLOCK), reason and\n  rule/LLM/final scores with severity colors + i18n keys.\n\nRegression tests: +2 E2E (embed Insights/Chat/back; fraud decisions).\n10/10 E2E green, 36/36 unit, typecheck/lint/build clean.","tree":{"sha":"5d534d414b85a52315bc4a7dc5b856b4744a6232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/trees/5d534d414b85a52315bc4a7dc5b856b4744a6232"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/git/commits/a2ad655ce9d81e0b4f41acff4221275ba4b448de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152653602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev","id":152653602,"login":"luisdossantos-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCRlPIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luisdossantos-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/commit/a2ad655ce9d81e0b4f41acff4221275ba4b448de","node_id":"C_kwDOTteSmNoAKGEyYWQ2NTVjZTlkODFlMGI0ZjQxYWNmZjQyMjEyNzViYTRiNDQ4ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/commit/ad40077f8a7edf15c0c45b32ca79b215c5983766","sha":"ad40077f8a7edf15c0c45b32ca79b215c5983766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luisdossantos-dev/PaySuite/commits/ad40077f8a7edf15c0c45b32ca79b215c5983766"}],"sha":"a