nduGunathilaka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0MjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commits/ccf470cae64a1bc20f0da16e0b3d2d66a9a01580/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:20:56Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:20:56Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"message":"test(backend): add concurrency test proving the EXCLUDE constraint works\n\nTwo threads, synchronized via CountDownLatch to release at the same\ninstant, race to book overlapping segments on the same seat. Asserts\nexactly one succeeds and the other fails with SeatConflictException --\nthis is the proof that correctness comes from the DB constraint, not\nfrom timing or application-level locking that could be subtly wrong.\n\nRuns against the existing dev database rather than a dedicated test DB\n(fully self-contained via randomized fixture data + @AfterEach cleanup)\n-- documented as a deliberate scope trade-off in the README.","tree":{"sha":"96bbbe1177c7f1132d82cdef6ae30a76febf9be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/trees/96bbbe1177c7f1132d82cdef6ae30a76febf9be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/commits/ccf470cae64a1bc20f0da16e0b3d2d66a9a01580","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"