com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"message":"feat(backend): add API request/response DTOs\n\nJava records rather than classes -- these are pure immutable data shapes\nfor JSON serialization with no JPA/Lombok involvement, so records (no\nboilerplate getters, built-in equals/hashCode/toString) are the natural\nfit, unlike the entity classes which need mutability and a no-arg\nconstructor for Hibernate.","tree":{"sha":"d5f19607e1a670efe3ae02b24fa8638cfe12f05a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/trees/d5f19607e1a670efe3ae02b24fa8638cfe12f05a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/commits/dda04b01d8fe119ce9bd0d0e42d41b84a41ca126","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka","id":73194227,"login":"DininduGunathilaka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0MjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commit/dda04b01d8fe119ce9bd0d0e42d41b84a41c