ndu Gunathilaka"},"message":"feat(backend): seed Colombo Fort-Badulla reference data\n\n21 real stations with coordinates, the single seeded route, its\nroute_stations (approximate published rail distances), two trips sharing\nthat route in opposite directions (proves direction-on-Trip design),\ntrip_stops covering every station, and 3 reserved + 5 unreserved coaches\nper trip with seats generated for the reserved ones only.\n\nIDs are resolved by natural key (station code, route name) via SQL joins\nrather than hardcoded, since every table uses gen_random_uuid().","tree":{"sha":"de7cbd87b24c4422dc24d646dd8dbb1b8a3686a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/trees/de7cbd87b24c4422dc24d646dd8dbb1b8a3686a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/commits/8cd5b08f36c091542d4d07f9b1fc0c0fb0b24181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka","id":73194227,"login":"DininduGunathilaka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0MjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com