0c77ac63f8d4f21fc1940aded9b480b75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:33:40Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:33:40Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"message":"feat(backend): add JPA domain entities\n\nOne @Entity class per table, mapped 1:1 onto the V1 schema. Text columns\nthat represent a fixed set of values (distance_source, coord_source,\ncoach type, trip direction, booking status) are mapped to Java enums via\n@Enumerated(STRING) for compile-time safety while still storing readable\ntext in the database. Lombok''s @Getter/@Setter keep these classes free of\nboilerplate.","tree":{"sha":"2a514088c5f067021a05c50d72e7a09399616892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/trees/2a514088c5f067021a05c50d72e7a09399616892"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/commits/cba63080c77ac63f8d4f21fc1940aded9b480b75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka","id":73194227,"login":"DininduGunathilaka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0MjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commit/cba63080c77ac63f8d4f21fc1940aded9b480b75","node_id":"C_kwDOTtgRJ9oAKGNiYTYzMDgwYzc3YWM2M2Y4ZDRmMjFmYzE5NDBhZGVkOWI0ODBiNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commit/6ef44701e200949c9513b6c6ad4dfbe4443e63d4","sha":"6ef44701e200949c9513b6c6ad4dfbe4443e63d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commits/6ef44701e200949c9513b6c6ad4dfbe4443e63d4"}],"sha":"cba63080c77ac63f8d4f21fc1940aded9b480b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commits/cba63080c77ac63f8d4f21fc1940aded9b480b75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DininduGunathilaka","id":73194227,"login":"DininduGunathilaka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0MjI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/commits/6ef44701e200949c9513b6c6ad4dfbe4443e63d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:28:17Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:28:17Z","email":"dinindugunathilaka@gmail.com","name":"Dinindu Gunathilaka"},"message":"feat(backend): add core schema migration with concurrency-safe booking\n\nDefines all 8 tables. The key design choice is the EXCLUDE constraint on\nbookings: two CONFIRMED bookings for the same seat+trip can never have\noverlapping [from_order, to_order) ranges, enforced by Postgres itself via\na GiST index (seat_id, trip_id, int4range). This is correctness-by-\nconstruction rather than relying solely on app-level locking.\n\nroute_stations is a join table (not columns on Station) so a station can\nappear on multiple routes with different position/distance on each --\nlets the line be extended or a second route added without a schema\nchange. trip_stops is likewise separate from route_stations so an express\ntrip can skip stations without touching the distance/fare data.","tree":{"sha":"8bd94c285d397935d2e377523f01f9e9b6703c2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/trees/8bd94c285d397935d2e377523f01f9e9b6703c2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DininduGunathilaka/lankarail-booking/git/commits/6ef44701e200949c9513b6c6ad4dfbe4443e63d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DininduGunathilaka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com