"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/466c9c25121772afb5ba6dc1bb3095dc1879abf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:11:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T14:11:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Mentions @collegue dans les commentaires\n\nMenu de selection a la frappe d''un @, navigable au clavier. La mention est\nstockee comme un span portant l''identifiant Keycloak : c''est lui que le\nserveur relit pour notifier, le nom affiche pouvant changer.\n\nLe nettoyeur conserve desormais data-mention sur les span, mais impose la\nclasse plutot que de la reprendre telle quelle : le HTML stocke peut avoir\nete forge et ne doit pas choisir son propre style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"136ec34b164d6453c89c3a0614ba0a4f2f728d5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/136ec34b164d6453c89c3a0614ba0a4f2f728d5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/466c9c25121772afb5ba6dc1bb3095dc1879abf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/466c9c25121772afb5ba6dc1bb3095dc1879abf8","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDQ2NmM5YzI1MTIxNzcyYWZiNWJhNmRjMWJiMzA5NWRjMTg3OWFiZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b","sha":"c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b"}],"sha":"466c9c25121772afb5ba6dc1bb3095dc1879abf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/466c9c25121772afb5ba6dc1bb3095dc1879abf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:02:51Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:02:51Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Envoi groupe : choisir l''adresse d''expedition\n\nLe bloc rejoint « Options communes », qui est sa place : l''adresse vaut\npour tout le lot, comme le service et le format d''etiquette.\n\nMeme motif que la page Etiquettes — selecteur du carnet, saisie libre,\npreremplissage avec l''adresse courante. Les champs obligatoires sont\nverifies avant l''envoi, sans quoi la moitie du lot serait facturee avant\nle refus d''UPS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"980cbbf646bf79ee472f37c9de0fe89b45351620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/980cbbf646bf79ee472f37c9de0fe89b45351620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGM4MzFmZjUwOWQyYmU5MGU0ODk4YTM1ZjgwMGM2ODU1ODI5MWM4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5","sha":"793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5"}],"sha":"c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/c831ff509d2be90e4898a35f800c68558291c85b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:51:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:51:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Expediteur : choisir dans le carnet ou saisir a la main\n\n- Bouton « Changer » sur la page Etiquettes : selecteur du carnet et\n  formulaire complet, preremplis avec l''adresse courante. On corrige une\n  ville plutot que de tout ressaisir\n- Le carnet est partage avec le destinataire : une antenne d''ou l''on\n  expedie n''a pas a etre saisie deux fois\n- Bouton « depart par defaut » dans le carnet, distinct de l''etoile\n  destinataire — une adresse peut etre l''un sans etre l''autre\n- L''origine de l''adresse est annoncee : carnet ou configuration serveur,\n  sans quoi on ne saurait pas ou la corriger\n\nL''expediteur saisi est soumis aux memes champs obligatoires que le\ndestinataire : refuse avant l''appel plutot qu''apres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"403c9b63e5938b1394207dd7567684af806e2eb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/403c9b63e5938b1394207dd7567684af806e2eb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDc5MzA2NWJlN2Y3ODRiNWE0NjUyYTIwOWY0ZjI2NDVhZmRiYTZmZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e","sha":"e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e"}],"sha":"793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/793065be7f784b5a4652a209f4f2645afdba6fd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:28:37Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:28:37Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Afficher l''expediteur dans la liste et le detail\n\n- Liste : le trajet sur une ligne, « expediteur (ville) → destinataire »\n- Detail : bloc Expediteur avant Destinataire, dans le sens du colis\n\nL''adresse vient de l''envoi lui-meme, pas de la configuration courante :\nun demenagement ne reecrira pas l''historique. Les envois anterieurs a\nson enregistrement n''en ont pas — rien n''est alors affiche, plutot qu''un\n« expediteur inconnu » qui n''apprendrait rien.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00604120e747ed91df56e17c1e2d23ff3a51442a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/00604120e747ed91df56e17c1e2d23ff3a51442a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e9fb8a1993e9d3fc87625538399ed6d330b4ab4e","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGU5ZmI4YTE5OTNlOWQzZmM4NzYyNTUzODM5OWVkNmQzMzBiNGFiNGU","parent