ed-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39474c4ea9bc83a50b9731610ac7839618a1d4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/39474c4ea9bc83a50b9731610ac7839618a1d4e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/7a79cfae61dd3b1108a4081e33cf94c61f9bb0e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/7a79cfae61dd3b1108a4081e33cf94c61f9bb0e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDdhNzljZmFlNjFkZDNiMTEwOGE0MDgxZTMzY2Y5NGM2MWY5YmIwZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d","sha":"ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d"}],"sha":"7a79cfae61dd3b1108a4081e33cf94c61f9bb0e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/7a79cfae61dd3b1108a4081e33cf94c61f9bb0e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:55:34Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:55:34Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Detail d''un envoi : lien vers la fiche antenne\n\nL''identifiant du contact etait deja enregistre, il ne manquait que le\nlien. Un envoi cree depuis /shipping?antenne= renvoie desormais vers sa\nfiche dans Antennes.\n\nL''URL passe par VITE_ANTENNES_APP_URL plutot que d''etre codee en dur :\nsans elle, aucun lien n''est fabrique — mieux vaut rien qu''un lien mort.\nDistincte d''ANTENNES_API_URL cote backend : l''une est l''interface web,\nl''autre le service de donnees.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e116835b0f7c11b481710cc52efa904698366342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/e116835b0f7c11b481710cc52efa904698366342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGFiM2QxYmZjMTJlMDE0ZDhkODUzZGI0ZDZkOTdkZWU4MmNmNWEwNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200","sha":"e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200"}],"sha":"ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/ab3d1bfc12e014d8d853db4d6d97dee82cf5a06d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:55:31Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:55:31Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Menu fede : un vrai lien glisse dans le libelle\n\nLe hub rend chaque entree en <button onClick>. Aucun JavaScript ne\nsimule Ctrl+clic, clic du milieu ni le menu contextuel du navigateur :\nces gestes sont reserves aux <a href>. Il fallait donc une vraie ancre.\n\n`label` etant rendu tel quel par le hub, on y place un lien transparent\nqui recouvre la ligne — motif « stretched link ». Aucune ligne du hub\nn''est modifiee.\n\nTrois pieges, verifies dans le bundle du hub :\n- stopPropagation, sans quoi le clic remonte au onClick du bouton\n- lien inerte quand la barre est repliee : le libelle vit alors dans une\n  infobulle positionnee, ou le lien se calerait\n- le truncate du span ne rogne pas le lien, son bloc conteneur etant le\n  <button> qui porte `relative`\n\nL''ancienne interception est conservee pour la barre repliee.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f63580a5307e072aa8029e9c103c4ed109f3821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/3f63580a5307e072aa8029e9c103c4ed109f3821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGU1ZTVkNGExZWMwOTUwZjJmNTkyYzJiOTc0MzRhMTE5YTBhODMyMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/c84ad4445a758b0a124106e7fcb49f8969f34135","sha":"c84ad4445a758b0a124106e7fcb49f8969f34135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/c84ad4445a758b0a124106e7fcb49f8969f34135"}],"sha":"e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e5e5d4a1ec0950f2f592c2b97434a119a0a83200"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/c84ad4445a758b0a124106e7fcb49f8969f34135/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:39:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:39:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Detail d''un envoi : deux moities egales, une seule carte\n\n- La grille passe en lg:grid-cols-2 : informations et carte occupent la\n  meme largeur, la carte ne flottant plus dans une colonne trop large\n- Le bloc « Points relais » du bas est supprime ; ses points relais\n  passent sur la carte de l''en-tete. Une seule carte a laquelle on\n  demande les deux choses, plutot que deux vues de la meme adresse\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"102a1e96e6aa939ddd326e129136f4094d1bc8b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/102a1e96e6aa939ddd326e129136f4094d1bc8b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/c84ad4445a758b0a124106e7fcb49f8969f34135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avat