:"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e3a5de72264ebb42e4246b7c877b6e1f41a535db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:33:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:33:36Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Detail d''un envoi : carte dans l''en-tete, informations resserrees\n\nLa grille sur deux colonnes alternait les champs, etirant le bloc sur\ntoute la largeur pour quelques lignes de texte. Les informations passent\na gauche, la carte occupe la colonne de droite.\n\n- L''adresse du destinataire est mise en forme sur plusieurs lignes : sur\n  une seule, la ville se noyait entre le nom et le pays\n- Le bloc du bas devient « Points relais a proximite » : il repond a une\n  autre question que « ou est-ce », d''ou deux cartes distinctes\n- La legende ne s''affiche plus quand la carte ne porte qu''un marqueur\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a315968fb4adcf1b70af052b2a4ff5b6b43a5f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/5a315968fb4adcf1b70af052b2a4ff5b6b43a5f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/e3a5de72264ebb42e4246b7c877b6e1f41a535db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e3a5de72264ebb42e4246b7c877b6e1f41a535db","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGUzYTVkZTcyMjY0ZWJiNDJlNDI0NmI3Yzg3N2I2ZTFmNDFhNTM1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab","sha":"56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab"}],"sha":"e3a5de72264ebb42e4246b7c877b6e1f41a535db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e3a5de72264ebb42e4246b7c877b6e1f41a535db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:19:40Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:19:40Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Menu fede : interception en DOM natif plutot que via React\n\nLa premiere version passait par onClickCapture et cherchait l''entree\navec closest(''button''). Deux fragilites : React delegue ses evenements a\nla racine, donc un ecouteur natif pose par le hub s''executait avant, et\nrien ne garantit que l''entree soit un <button>.\n\n- Ecouteur natif en phase de capture sur le conteneur, donc avant tout\n  ce que le hub attache\n- L''entree est retrouvee en remontant les ancetres par leur texte, sans\n  presupposer la structure du hub\n- click, auxclick et mousedown couverts, avec une garde temporelle : les\n  trois se suivent sur un meme geste et ouvriraient trois onglets\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b78044d82e6812427e082849fe314e093dc4c81f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/b78044d82e6812427e082849fe314e093dc4c81f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDU2YzkwYjg4NjM1MGQ4YWI0YzNkY2ZiMzU2MWRkZmQwMTI5ZWM1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38","sha":"b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38"}],"sha":"56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/56c90b886350d8ab4c3dcfb3561ddfd0129ec5ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:00:08Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:00:08Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Etiquettes : lire ?antenne= et preremplir le destinataire\n\nL''adresse est chargee depuis le backend, qui detient le jeton. Un\nbandeau annonce la provenance et rappelle qu''elle reste modifiable —\nsans lui, rien ne dirait d''ou vient une adresse deja remplie.\n\nLe remplissage n''a lieu qu''une fois : sans ce garde, une rehydratation\ndu cache ecraserait une correction en cours de saisie.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c85d89324852c47dc1065072a9e3ed9ad68942ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/c85d89324852c47dc1065072a9e3ed9ad68942ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGI1OTgxN2Q5NDk0NGFjNDYzNGM1YWY2YzE5OWM1NzM2NTI5NTJhMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2","sha":"4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2"}],"sha":"b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b59817d94944ac4634c5af6c199c573652952a38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T17:33:01Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T17:33:01Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Imprimer : toutes les etiquettes de l''expedition\n\nLe bouton ne sortait que celle du premier colis. Il utilise desormais la\nroute /labels et passe par printImages : une seule boite de dialogue,\nune etiquette par page.\n\nLe compte est affiche des qu''il y a plus d''un colis — « Imprimer (2) » —\nsans quoi rien ne dirait ce que le bouton va sortir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6db4f0d2c4c33acaf61e15efb716e9595c7dadf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/6db4f0d2c4c33acaf61e15efb716e9595c7dadf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDRjN2NmNGJjMjEwOWQ1NDBkMTMyYjk1NmU1ZGIxMWFlOWE3NzliZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177","sha":"36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177"}],"sha":"4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/4c7cf4bc2109d540d132b956e5db11ae9a779bf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T17:11:19Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T17:11:19Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Menu fede : retablir Ctrl+clic malgre l''absence de href\n\nLe menu affiche vient du hub via Module Federation, et son contrat est\nun callback onNavigate : ses entrees sont des <button> sans href. Le\nnavigateur n''a donc rien a ouvrir dans un nouvel onglet, et le clic droit\nne propose pas l''option.\n\nLe clic modifie est intercepte en phase de capture, avant que le hub ne\nle traite, et l''onglet ouvert depuis le libelle de l''entree.\n\nContournement assume : la vraie correction est que le hub rende des\n<a href>. Elle appartient a son depot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"892e76dfd70771a84512a72d55ca00cba50add77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/892e76dfd70771a84512a72d55ca00cba50add77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDM2OTYzNDQzMzIzYjVmYmNjYjhmNTVjNmNmNGVkMjc1N2U4YjUxNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54","sha":"b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54"}],"sha":"36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/36963443323b5fbccb8f55c6cf4ed2757e8b5177"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:00:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:00:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Carte du detail : marqueur rouge et points relais proches\n\n- Le destinataire passe en goutte rouge ; les points relais sont des\n  pastilles numerotees indigo. Formes differentes autant que couleurs :\n  la distinction tient en niveaux de gris\n- Les 10 points relais dans un rayon de 25 km, cliquables pour leur\n  adresse et leur distance\n- La recherche passe par le cache react-query : elle appelle l''API UPS,\n  revenir sur la page ne doit pas la rappeler\n- Legende sous la carte, qui dit aussi quand aucun relais n''est trouve\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6e2144641280c7c3892627286c24569ec187013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/a6e2144641280c7c3892627286c24569ec187013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGI0M2FlYzlkNDA5ZTRmNWZkZGUxZTA4NTAwM2VmZDVlNGVhMmZmNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a","sha":"e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a"}],"sha":"b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/b43aec9d409e4f5fdde1e085003efd5e4ea2ff54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:51:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:51:13Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Commentaires en editeur enrichi, liens par identifiant local\n\nRichTextEditor : gras, italique, listes et liens via contentEditable.\nPas de bibliotheque ajoutee — execCommand est obsolete mais implemente\npartout, et suffit pour ce besoin.\n\nLe HTML est assaini par liste blanche a la saisie, au collage ET a\nl''affichage : une entree creee hors de l''application ne doit pas pouvoir\ninjecter de script. Seul href en https survit comme attribut.\n\nshipmentKey utilise localShipmentId : l''identifiant UPS ne distingue pas\nles envois en CIE.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e25741ff1e5c3e890a78effa1f01b07f562d603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/5e25741ff1e5c3e890a78effa1f01b07f562d603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGUzZDA3MmM2NDg3NWVmYTUyYjY2ZDgwY2EyZDJkYzFjZWU0ZmU3OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/e97254ed0544ffa769feea457c12b63562c2dd26","sha":"e97254ed0544ffa769feea457c12b63562c2dd26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/e97254ed0544ffa769feea457c12b63562c2dd26"}],"sha":"e3d072c64875efa52b66d80ca2d2dc1cee4fe79a","url":"h