hub.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a5db80887b58c959460c9f7ce91e07709b706e83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:18:32Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:18:32Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Detail d''un envoi : carte, colis et avatars\n\n- AddressMap : situe le destinataire, geocode a l''affichage puisque\n  l''envoi enregistre ne porte pas de coordonnees. Adresse introuvable ou\n  cle absente : le composant l''annonce au lieu d''un cadre vide\n- Section Colis : une expedition multi-colis les montre tous, avec un\n  lien vers chacun et un rappel que le montant couvre l''ensemble\n- Avatar : initiales sur pastille coloree par hachage du nom, reutilise\n  par la Timeline. Un auteur inconnu reste gris, lui donner une couleur\n  laisserait croire qu''on sait de qui il s''agit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f493c48f5332dc844ad59eae07e956cee2d4ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/6f493c48f5332dc844ad59eae07e956cee2d4ab4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/a5db80887b58c959460c9f7ce91e07709b706e83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url