ns_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/2a79579250f6b4830d258b21367b0abedf300fab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:00:54Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:00:54Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Page dediee a un envoi : detail, journal et commentaires\n\n/shipments/:trackingNumber rassemble ce qui etait disperse : etat et\ncouts, auteur de la creation, journal des actions et fil de discussion.\n\n- Le numero de suivi et un bouton Detail y menent depuis la liste, qui\n  affiche aussi l''auteur et le nombre de commentaires\n- ACTION_META sort de Timeline vers utils/actionMeta : deux ecrans qui\n  nommeraient differemment la meme action semeraient le doute\n- Les actions package_type.* y sont ajoutees ; elles s''affichaient sous\n  le libelle generique « Action »\n- Le lien « Voir l''envoi » de la Timeline pointait vers la liste entiere,\n  il mene desormais a l''envoi concerne\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"425584bdcc3cbeb0d8ed16dcb6b8eb88c723514d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/425584bdcc3cbeb0d8ed16dcb6b8eb88c723514d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/2a79579250f6b4830d258b21367b0abedf300fab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ma