tps://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/0702a89fff4e288c925240a81edde95b71645b82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:08:48Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:08:48Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Carnet et types de colis : formulaires en fenetre modale\n\nLe formulaire occupait la colonne de droite : il ecrasait la liste et,\nsur le carnet vide, poussait l''invitation a creer une premiere adresse\nhors du regard. Il passe en fenetre modale centree.\n\n- Modal reutilisable (portail, Echap, defilement bloque, focus initial)\n- Panneaux Groupes et aide desormais visibles en permanence, alors\n  qu''ils disparaissaient des l''ouverture du formulaire\n- Champs regroupes en deux colonnes : moins de defilement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"493e230339cd46bc373be42a1b151b2218671678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/493e230339cd46bc373be42a1b151b2218671678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/0702a89fff4e288c925240a81edde95b71645b82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/0702a89fff4e288c925240a81edde95b71645b82","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDA3MDJhODlmZmY0ZTI4OGM5MjUyNDBhODFlZGRlOTViNzE2NDViODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f","sha":"a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f"}],"sha":"0702a89fff4e288c925240a81edde95b71645b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/0702a89fff4e288c925240a81edde95b71645b82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:30:05Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:30:05Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Points relais : repere de l''adresse recherchee sur la carte\n\nOn ne savait pas ou on se situait par rapport aux points relais affiches.\nL''adresse recherchee apparait desormais en disque rouge, distinct des\nepingles indigo numerotees -- forme ET couleur differentes, pour que la\ndistinction tienne aussi en niveaux de gris ou pour un daltonien.\n\n- Le repere est inclus dans le cadrage : une recherche a large rayon ne peut\n  pas le laisser hors ecran.\n- zIndex eleve : un point relais tout proche ne doit pas le masquer.\n- Une legende en bas de carte le nomme, sinon un point rouge se lirait comme\n  un incident ou un point indisponible.\n\nLes coordonnees viennent de l''autocompletion quand une suggestion est\nchoisie : parsePlace les renvoyait deja, Locator les jetait. Sinon, une ville\nou un code postal saisis a la main sont geocodes au moment de la recherche\n(google.maps.Geocoder, deja disponible, aucune librairie supplementaire).\n\nLe geocodage est restreint au pays saisi, sans quoi \"Paris\" pourrait renvoyer\nParis au Texas.\n\nToute modification manuelle d''un champ perime les coordonnees de la\nsuggestion : corriger la ville apres avoir choisi une adresse ne doit pas\nlaisser le repere a l''ancien endroit.\n\nUn echec de localisation ne bloque rien : seul le repere manque, les points\nrelais s''affichent normalement.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"685874ff2e76887ef16c8e79d8668ce9ae805c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/685874ff2e76887ef16c8e79d8668ce9ae805c2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGE3ZTEzNmI4NTZkNTU2NzAyNjA2NDlmMWNlZTM5NDVhMzZiMTdmNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7","sha":"9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7"}],"sha":"a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a7e136b856d55670260649f1cee3945a36b17f6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:22:17Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:22:17Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Tableau de bord chiffre sur les envois\n\n- Tableau de bord : chiffres cles des 30 derniers jours (depense,\n  expeditions, cout moyen, envois en cours), avec lien vers le detail.\n- Envois en cours : panneau \"Indicateurs\", replie par defaut car la page sert\n  d''abord a retrouver un colis. Ouvert, il donne sur 7/30/90 jours ou depuis\n  le debut : couts total et moyen, colis, delai moyen de livraison,\n  repartition par service en barres, cout quotidien en histogramme.\n\nUn envoi multi-colis compte pour une expedition : le cout n''est pas multiplie\npar le nombre de colis, ce que donnerait une somme naive des lignes en base.\nLes expeditions annulees sont exclues des couts. Ces deux regles sont\nrappelees sous les indicateurs, pour eviter une lecture erronee.\n\nAucune librairie de graphiques : les barres et l''histogramme sont en CSS.\nDeux visualisations simples ne justifient pas une dependance de plus, dans un\nprojet qui en compte six.\n\nSans base de donnees, les blocs disparaissent au lieu d''afficher des zeros\ntrompeurs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f76b0f3e2de469b4c3d50d2fd749457459f29665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/f76b0f3e2de469b4c3d50d2fd749457459f29665"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDlmN2RkYmNjNmIwNmQ2MmM5NjcxZWE0MjVjNTg0ZTRmM2ViZDY5Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222","sha":"bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222"}],"sha":"9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/9f7ddbcc6b06d62c9671ea425c584e4f3ebd69b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:03:50Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T07:03:50Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Enlevement depuis une etiquette, et saisie des numeros de suivi\n\n- Page Enlevement : section \"Colis concernes\", qui manquait entierement.\n  Saisie manuelle d''un numero, ou recherche dans les etiquettes creees avec\n  destinataire et date affiches pour ne pas confondre deux envois proches.\n- Page Etiquettes : bouton \"Prevoir un enlevement\" apres creation, qui ouvre\n  la page avec les numeros deja rattaches (passes par l''URL, puis retires\n  pour qu''un rechargement ne les reinjecte pas).\n- La confirmation liste les colis reellement rattaches : les doublons ayant\n  ete retires cote backend, le compte peut differer de la saisie.\n\nL''adresse d''enlevement n''est deliberement PAS pre-remplie depuis l''etiquette :\nc''est celle de l''expediteur, d''ou part le chauffeur, pas celle du\ndestinataire. La pre-remplir depuis shipTo enverrait un chauffeur a la\nmauvaise adresse.\n\nSans base de donnees, la recherche est indisponible mais la saisie manuelle\nreste utilisable : le composant le dit plutot que d''afficher une erreur.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65b291467266cf9a23276687dd77062d5b75c549","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/65b291467266cf9a23276687dd77062d5b75c549"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGJmMzg3ZTBjMzc3Y2M0NWRlZmNjZTY0OTE0OWQ3ODhkOTFkZTYyMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e","sha":"de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e"}],"sha":"bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/bf387e0c377cc45defcce649149d788d91de6222"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:47:51Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:47:51Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Impression des etiquettes, comme sur le site UPS\n\nLa boite de dialogue s''ouvre desormais des l''etiquette creee, sans passer par\nle telechargement puis l''ouverture du fichier.\n\n- Impression automatique a la creation, desactivable par une case retenue\n  d''une session a l''autre (localStorage, avec repli si le stockage est bloque).\n- Bouton Imprimer sur chaque etiquette creee et sur chaque ligne des envois\n  en cours, pour reimprimer plus tard.\n- Envoi groupe : un seul dialogue pour tout le lot, une etiquette par page.\n  Enchainer vingt dialogues n''aurait eu aucun interet.\n\nDeux details qui ne se voient pas :\n\nZPL, EPL et SPL sont des langages de commande pour imprimantes thermiques :\nles envoyer a une imprimante bureautique produirait des pages de charabia.\nLe bouton n''apparait donc pas pour ces formats, et la reimpression depuis\nl''historique retombe sur le telechargement plutot que de ne rien faire.\n\nLe rendu passe par une iframe masquee, pas un onglet : rien a autoriser ni a\nrefermer. Le retrait de l''iframe est differe car Safari annule l''impression\nsi elle disparait pendant que le dialogue est ouvert. Sur un lot, les images\nsont attendues avant l''impression, sinon les cadres sortiraient vides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10bafc2d4feaa7aafc1d2af4aba5c36c7975fc46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/10bafc2d4feaa7aafc1d2af4aba5c36c7975fc46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKGRlNzlmMzE1NzY2MmFmYWQwMGY1NTdiYjM0NDU0Y2FmYmQyY2M3OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8","sha":"6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8"}],"sha":"de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/de79f3157662afad00f557bb34454cafbd2cc78e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:38:03Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:38:03Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Page Types de colis et selecteur dans l''editeur de colis\n\nRepond au besoin de pre-enregistrer DS620, QW410, Magnets, borne Spherik et\nimprimante avec le poids correspondant.\n\n- Page /package-types : creation, modification, archivage, type par defaut,\n  choix de l''emballage UPS. Catalogue vide, elle propose directement les\n  cinq materiels cites.\n- PackageTypePicker pose dans PackagesEditor, donc actif d''un coup sur\n  Etiquettes et Tarifs qui le partagent. Un champ quantite ajoute plusieurs\n  colis identiques : trois bornes, une seule action.\n- Le premier colis est remplace s''il est encore vierge, plutot que de laisser\n  un colis vide de 1 kg en tete de liste.\n- Envoi groupe : colonne \"type\" dans le CSV. Une ligne avec un type n''a plus\n  besoin de poids, et le champ affiche sa provenance.\n- Catalogue vide ou base absente : le selecteur disparait au lieu d''afficher\n  une erreur sur des pages qui fonctionnent sans lui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e5bb690f1314c8b80a484673fa9453b4b8a57ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/5e5bb690f1314c8b80a484673fa9453b4b8a57ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDY5NDFkYjc3OGU3MjJiM2QxOWI1OTAzZDZmYmFiODQ1YmM1ODFkYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662","sha":"493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662"}],"sha":"6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/6941db778e722b3d19b5903d6fbab845bc581dc8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:21:38Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T06:21:38Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Pages Timeline et Commandes\n\nRepond au besoin d''une fenetre recapitulative de nos actions, et d''un\nhistorique des commandes distinct de celui des envois.\n\n- Timeline (/activity) : journal des actions de l''equipe, groupe par jour\n  (Aujourd''hui, Hier, puis la date). Auteur, heure, lien vers l''objet\n  concerne et repli Details. Filtres par auteur, famille d''action, periode\n  et texte. L''auteur vient du jeton Keycloak verifie cote backend.\n- Commandes (/batches) : lots d''envoi groupe, avec barre d''avancement par\n  statut, cout total et detail des colis. Le badge Lot de la page Envois\n  devient cliquable, et l''envoi groupe propose de suivre sa commande.\n\nLa page Envois en cours reste l''historique UPS : elle repond a \"ou en est\nce colis\", la timeline a \"qui a fait quoi\". Les trois pages sont\ndocumentees cote a cote dans le README pour eviter la confusion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45d679d877d223a4a2169995907e09ebc8b90711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/trees/45d679d877d223a4a2169995907e09ebc8b90711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/git/commits/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662","node_id":"C_kwDOTtkFCtoAKDQ5M2RiMWNkMjI4ODY5ODE3YzI1M2Q1NTNhOWNiNjdlY2IzMDg2NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devmanoa/ups-front/commit/a9c291b9f9e33b35b0429cd8bc39bb8ab5e0810d","sha":"a9c291b9f9e33b35b0429cd8bc39bb8ab5e0810d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a9c291b9f9e33b35b0429cd8bc39bb8ab5e0810d"}],"sha":"493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/493db1cd228869817c253d553a9cb67ecb308662"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32033938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manoam","id":32033938,"login":"manoam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDMzOTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manoam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-front/commits/a9c291b9f9e33b35b0429cd8bc39bb8ab5e0810d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T05:40:55Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T05:40:55Z","email":"manoarazafindrabe@gmail.com","name":"Manoa Fanantenana"},"message":"Carnet d''adresses : page de gestion et selecteur sur les formulaires\n\nRepond au besoin de pre-enregistrer les adresses des antennes pour que les\nchamps se remplissent automatiquement, avec des groupes par usage.\n\n- Page /addresses : creation, modification, archivage, groupes, import CSV.\n  L''autocompletion Google sert aussi a la saisie dans le carnet.\n- AddressPicker pose sur les cinq pages de saisie d''adresse : Etiquettes,\n  Tarifs, Delais, Enlevement, et chaque ligne de l''envoi groupe. Il remplit\n  les champs sans les verrouiller, comme l''autocompletion.\n- Adresse par defaut pre-chargee sur Etiquettes ; tri par frequence d''usage.\n- SaveToBook apres un envoi reussi : le carnet se remplit au moment ou UPS\n  vient de valider l''adresse, plutot que par une saisie initiale en bloc.\n- Carnet vide ou base absente : le selecteur disparait au lieu d''afficher\n  une erreur sur des pages qui fonctionnent sans lui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f57389bd35265e3be8f9870986d5c9737aaef9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devmanoa/ups-