/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/29bbe920f18203b8125e6044106d7eb09b15a5d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:55:49Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:55:49Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(structured-extraction): extract NOTE claims for commitments/risks/next actions\n\nCompletes the GAP 1 spec: EXTRACTABLE_PERSON_FIELDS previously only covered\njobTitle, missing the charter''s other three extractable categories. NOTE\nclaims (COMMITMENT, RISK, NEXT_ACTION) are now parsed, verbatim-verified\nagainst source content, recorded as evidence with assertedBy: ''MODEL'' (never\nSERVER, so they can never reach AUTO strength), and proposed as CREATE_RECORD\nNote items for human review rather than written as Person facts.\n\nFixed a test fixture bug: the NOTE-claims describe block asserted against a\nNOTE_SNIPPET that was never present in the mocked message body, so every\ncase would fail verbatim verification regardless of implementation. Added a\nbeforeEach in that block so the message content actually contains the\nsnippet under test.","tree":{"sha":"8e3ad09046d68095c5a1097e05413140cfce0dfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/8e3ad09046d68095c5a1097e05413140cfce0dfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/29bbe920f18203b8125e6044106d7eb09b15a5d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"commit