uthStrategy verifying they\ndelegate all validation to SSOService and never authenticate without its affirmative\nresult: identity-provider lookup throwing/returning null rejects (fail closed), a\nrejecting underlying passport strategy rejects, and a resolved principal succeeds\n(positive path). Mutation-proved: temporarily forcing SamlAuthGuard.canActivate to\nalways return true made all 5 negative/positive assertions fail red, confirming the\ntests actually catch a bypass; original code restored with zero residual diff.","tree":{"sha":"2d005bdd241be573fbb127c6f2cc56f3f0a01473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/2d005bdd241be573fbb127c6f2cc56f3f0a01473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/042cad8937720d83d48b88476c2ba6af9fa15bc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/042cad8937720d83d48b88476c2ba6af9fa15bc1","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDA0MmNhZDg5Mzc3MjBkODNkNDhiODg0NzZjMmJhNmFmOWZh