s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/3ccb59c96b69572c4604070be0d0562c5fdc2b58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T22:01:40Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T22:01:40Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"RLP clean-room rewrite: twenty-orm/utils fixups + 4 flat type files\n\nFixes real call-site regressions surfaced by a full typecheck pass:\n- export name validateRLSPredicatesForRecords (was Rls casing), plus the\n  shouldBypassPermissionChecks/errorMessage params the insert/update query\n  builders actually pass\n- buildRowLevelPermissionRecordFilter/renderPredicateToFilter thread an\n  optional workspaceMember through, for \"assigned to me\"-style predicates;\n  no workspaceMember in context renders an always-false condition rather\n  than dropping the restriction (deny-by-default)\n- isRecordMatchingRLSRowLevelPermissionPredicate takes a plain object\n  (not a strict ObjectRecord) plus shouldIgnoreSoftDeleteDefaultFilter, to\n  match the subscription publisher call site\n- and/or filter groups now always wrap in their own parens (even a\n  single-item group), matching TypeORM Brackets and fixing a safe-spec\n  failure; the \"field does not exist\" error message now matches the spec''s\n  expected substring\n\nAdds the 4 flat-row-level-permission-predicate/group(-maps) type files\nunder row-level-permission-predicate/types/, reverse-derived from the\nalready-AGPL mapper utils and workspace-internal-context.interface.ts\nusage (never read from the Enterprise originals).\n\nVerified: all 5 safe specs pass (apply/build/is-matching/render/\ngraphql-api-exception-handler). RLP-related typecheck errors: 0 (confirmed\nvia git stash that the remaining tsgo errors - SSO/auth, front-component-\nrenderer, workspace-migration validator generics - predate this change).","tree":{"sha":"bab12dfe329113f47a6f7819a9a451750b73a749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/bab12dfe329113f47a6f7819a9a451750b73a749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/3ccb59c96b69572c4604070be0d0562c5fdc2b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/3ccb59c96b69572c4604070be0d0562c5fdc2b58","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDNjY2I1OWM5NmI2OTU3MmM0NjA0MDcwYmUwZDA1NjJjNWZkYzJiNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7","sha":"e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7"}],"sha":"3ccb59c96b69572c4604070be0d0562c5fdc2b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/3ccb59c96b69572c4604070be0d0562c5fdc2b58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:59:29Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:59:29Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"test(clean-room): add RLP predicate validator spec, fix field-lookup bug found by it\n\nWriting the spec caught a real bug: the creation validator unconditionally\nlooked up fieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier even when the predicate was\ngroup-only (field id absent), producing a false \"field metadata not found\"\nrejection for a legitimately valid group-only predicate. Fixed by only doing\nthe lookup when a field id was actually provided.\n\nMutation-proofed the deny-by-default check (predicate referencing neither a\nfield nor a group must fail validation, never silently pass as a no-op that\ngrants unrestricted access): disabling the check line reproduces\n1 failed / 6 passed (RED), restoring it reproduces 7 passed (GREEN).","tree":{"sha":"379ea596e03c46d205d9d734fbfa3a62581036a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/379ea596e03c46d205d9d734fbfa3a62581036a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKGUzNmZmZTUzZWYzOWZlYWYyNDRmNWI1NjM5ZGE0MDhlNTEyZWJhYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/da0458bff17adcaf44296c67b66536908d2f54d1","sha":"da0458bff17adcaf44296c67b66536908d2f54d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/da0458bff17adcaf44296c67b66536908d2f54d1"}],"sha":"e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/e36ffe53ef39feaf244f5b5639da408e512ebaa7"},{"author":