users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/f0af333e3a904beabd59db32bd3bfe55c7363e22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:52:43Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:52:43Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Clean-room rewrite: SAML/OIDC SSO auth guards, strategy, controller, DTOs\n\nRewrites the 6 Enterprise-licensed auth/ SSO files from scratch, based only on\nAGPL call sites (auth.resolver.ts, user-workspace.service.ts, google-oauth\nguard/strategy/controller as structural patterns, oidc-auth.spec.ts) and public\nSAML 2.0 Core / OIDC Core specs. None of the original Enterprise files were read.\n\nAll SAML/OIDC security-critical validation (signature, audience/issuer,\nNotBefore/NotOnOrAfter, InResponseTo replay, state/nonce) is delegated to\nSSOService per the coordinated interface contract published in\n.superpowers/sdd/enterprise-rewrite/sso-spec.md; the guards/strategy fail\nclosed on any missing identity provider or thrown validation error.\n\nWidens AuthService.signInUpWithSocialSSO (AGPL, not one of the 6) to accept\nAuthProviderEnum.SSO so the new controller reuses existing sign-in/up/token\nlogic instead of duplicating it.","tree":{"sha":"2270273e7a52c25674adeb3884fc5f1f916a2a44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/2270273e7a52c25674adeb3884fc5f1f916a2a44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/f0af333e3a904beabd59db32bd3bfe55c7363e22","verification":{"payload":nul