om/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/123e8f0b1ec7449e2c872ac045ad5e59d311c291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:51:03Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:51:03Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(usage): bind the analytics input as a named GraphQL arg\n\nUsageAnalyticsInput is an @InputType(), but the resolver took it as a bare\n@Args(). Nest''s GraphQL layer could not resolve it and the whole schema build\ndied at boot:\n\n  CannotDetermineArgTypeError: \"UsageAnalyticsInput\" cannot be found in the\n  registry (UsageResolver#getUsageAnalytics)\n\nBare @Args() is correct for @ArgsType() DTOs and is used widely here; this\none needed @Args(''input''). Introduced by the clean-room usage rewrite in\nb6ac65d973 and invisible to typecheck and unit tests - it only surfaces when\nthe server actually boots.","tree":{"sha":"eabaa1c038d63f8e4cf841b10987843679efa599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/eabaa1c038d63f8e4cf841b10987843679efa599"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/123e8f0b1ec7449e2c872ac045ad5e59d311c291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/