,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/2ce31247be4cb82f6213a66d5e21fca355489597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:50:40Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:50:40Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(clean-room): rewrite RLP predicate/group action-handler services under AGPL\n\nOverwrites the six remaining Enterprise-headered files in place. Derived from\nthe sibling view-filter / view-filter-group create/update/delete action\nhandlers (AGPL): predicates and predicate groups are metadata rows (like view\nfilters), not workspace-schema columns, so create/update/delete are plain\nrepository operations with no DDL step.\n\nThis is the last of the 12 Enterprise-headered files under\nworkspace-manager/workspace-migration; grep -rl \"@license Enterprise\" over\nthat directory now returns nothing. Typecheck\n(npx tsgo -p tsconfig.json --noEmit) shows zero errors in this directory; the\n60 errors currently on the branch are all in files owned by other concurrent\nagents (auth/sso DTO rename, twenty-orm RLS predicate rewrite).","tree":{"sha":"65061f370d1e07d3d93690512f4d6d38d17e672b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/65061f370d1e07d3d93690512f4d6d38d17e672b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/2ce31247be4cb82f6213a66d5e21fca355489597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users