500f2205eeb7bd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:48:48Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:48:48Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"RLP clean-room rewrite: twenty-orm/utils (6 files)\n\nPhase 1 of the AGPL relicensing rewrite for row-level-permission-predicate\ncall sites. Writes the 6 Enterprise-headered twenty-orm/utils files fresh,\nalongside the originals (not yet deleted - that''s Phase 2).\n\n- apply-row-level-permission-predicates.util.ts: main-alias predicate\n  application, deny-by-default (empty/unresolvable filter = no widening,\n  never a bypass)\n- render-row-level-permission-filter-to-sql.util.ts: RecordGqlOperationFilter\n  -> raw SQL + params, verified against the safe spec\n- build-row-level-permission-record-filter.util.ts: role predicates/groups ->\n  RecordGqlOperationFilter, verified against the safe spec\n- is-record-matching-rls-row-level-permission-predicate.util.ts: in-memory\n  filter evaluation, verified against the safe spec\n- resolve-row-level-permission-record-filter.util.ts: role resolution +\n  filter building composition for the joined-relation loop\n- validate-rls-predicates-for-records.util.ts: post-write guard, throws on\n  violation rather than silently dropping/allowing","tree":{"sha":"9b694c6a6bffadac656b9fbfe3fdbaabf7f04fa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/9b694c6a6bffadac656b9fbfe3fdbaabf7f04fa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/9805b2c945706edfe63542a05500f2205eeb7bd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/fol