ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/37dfc29cd68cd92d549270a61570d82ac38c5b0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:46:47Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:46:47Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(clean-room): rewrite RLP predicate/group flat-entity validators under AGPL\n\nOverwrites the two Enterprise-headered validator files in place (path is\nunchanged, content is a fresh clean-room implementation). Derived from the\nsibling flat-view-filter / flat-view-filter-group validators (AGPL) for\nstructure and the circular-dependency check, and from the AGPL\nflat-row-level-permission-predicate mappers for field shape. Defines local\nexception code enums since the upstream RowLevelPermissionPredicateException\nenums live in Enterprise-headered files we cannot depend on.\n\nAdds a deny-by-default rule: a predicate that references neither a field nor\na parent group fails validation instead of being silently accepted as a\nno-op that would grant unrestricted row access.","tree":{"sha":"1993715eb29852343071feab5d04ab853b9b53a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/1993715eb29852343071feab5d04ab853b9b53a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/37dfc29cd68cd92d549270a61570d82ac38c5b0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a