@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"docs(enterprise-rewrite): persist RLP recon and clean-room disclosures\n\nThree RLP agent cycles produced identical recon and no code. Writing it to\ndisk so a fourth cycle cannot happen and the next run opens with file writes.\n\nRecords both disclosed clean-room slips and one binding consequence: the\nevent-logs rewrite must go to an agent with no exposure to the usage agent''s\ncontext.","tree":{"sha":"a2f7959ad632b77a6fe7f6b057cd14e3e0568120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/a2f7959ad632b77a6fe7f6b057cd14e3e0568120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/4fa9386853d08ddd41cc81c64f7d497f33532bc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/4fa9386853d08ddd41cc81c64f7d497f33532bc7","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDRmYTkzODY4NTNkMDhkZGQ0MWNjODFjNjRmN2Q0OTdmMzM1MzJiYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0","sha":"76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0"}],"sha":"4fa9386853d08ddd41cc81c64f7d497f33532bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/4fa9386853d08ddd41cc81c64f7d497f33532bc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:26:21Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:26:21Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(ai-write-approval): close both gate bypasses; make an unknown kind fail closed\n\nB1: buildGateInput fell through to ''return null'' for logic_function, and\nevaluate() reads null as ALLOW. A logic function returned ALLOW under a\nFORBID-everything policy with the policy never read, while an identical\nupdate_one correctly returned FORBID. 21 shipped app functions declare\ntoolTriggerSettings, incl. enrich-person which overwrites Person fields.\n\nbuildGateInput is now an exhaustive switch. The default arm carries a\n''const _exhaustiveCheck: never'' so a future ToolExecutionRef kind added\nwithout a case is a COMPILE error, and at runtime an unclassified ref\nbecomes FORBID (UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION). null can no longer mean ALLOW.\n\nB2: a workflow AI-agent step''s output reached UpdateRecordService directly -\nthe gate sits above ToolExecutorService, not above UpdateRecordService. The\ncharter forbids this by name: raw agent output can never write CRM fields.\n\nProvenance is detected on the RAW pre-resolveInput template, since after\nresolution an AI string is indistinguishable from a typed one. The trigger\npayload is whitelisted; a reference to an unknown step id fails closed and\nis gated rather than assumed safe. Human-authored static steps are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"239e622b35f906441937b7f3ff78e72d75189351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/239e622b35f906441937b7f3ff78e72d75189351"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDc2ZDViYWRkZjg4NzRlMWU2NjczOGI0ZDFlNTU5OGNhNjA5M2NiYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc","sha":"0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc"}],"sha":"76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76d5baddf8874e1e66738b4d1e5598ca6093cba0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:25:32Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:25:32Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Rewrite the usage ledger clean-room under AGPL\n\nThe 15 files under core-modules/usage carried @license Enterprise. We do not\nhold that copyright, so relicensing by header edit is not available: the only\nlawful options were delete or clean-room rewrite. SeaRM needs the spend ledger\n(agent-task-run.job.ts imports UsageOperationType; the AgentRun GraphQL type\nsurfaces per-run token and credit cost), so it was rewritten from AGPL call\nsites and the existing ClickHouse schema.\n\nNo paid tiers: the ledger records consumption for visibility and cost\nceilings. It does not meter against a plan or enforce quotas.\n\nSchema unchanged - reuses the existing ClickHouse usageEvent table.","tree":{"sha":"5313358c7ec3d4ff2f4f2005e17aa1ac0d186b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/5313358c7ec3d4ff2f4f2005e17aa1ac0d186b3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDBiY2I1OGMzYWI3OTQ3Y2Q4MTRlMGU2OTE4YjdmZGU4NWE0ZjUxYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e","sha":"5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e"}],"sha":"0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/0bcb58c3ab7947cd814e0e6918b7fde85a4f51bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:19:00Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T21:19:00Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"test: drop the last billing mocks and the entitlement-gating assertion\n\nsign-in-up passed a billing-credit and an isBillingEnabled mock to a\nconstructor that no longer takes them. The event-log registry test asserted\nrequiresEntitlement, a field removed with billing — the feature is gone, so\nthe test goes with it rather than being neutered. Also deduped a doubled\nWorkspaceCacheService import.\n\nServer typecheck is now EXIT=0 with zero errors.","tree":{"sha":"1a7e7ebddbc6ba0580e1ac44d85395054c7a0291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/1a7e7ebddbc6ba0580e1ac44d85395054c7a0291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/5feacbab15548aa7f10d15469eb4ae2f89a7002e","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDVmZWFjYmFiMTU1NDhhYTdmMTBkMTU0NjllYjRhZTJmODlhNzAwMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/b895364d56b0b544a9900bc64fb9c47fbace1cc5","sha":"b895364d56b0b544a9900bc64f