ture the [rows, rowCount] tuple so the claim loop can terminate\n\nPostgresQueryRunner.query() returns [rows, rowCount] for UPDATE ... RETURNING.\nclaimRowChunk assigned the tuple straight to a rows array, so rows.length was\nalways 2 and both executeBatch exits (rows.length === 0, !progressed) were\nunreachable — the lease-claim loop could never terminate.\n\nThe spec mocked the bare-array shape the buggy code assumed, under a comment\nwarning against exactly that mistake, which is why the suite stayed green.\nMock now returns the real driver shape, plus two termination tests.","tree":{"sha":"a498e09abbec374c690fd7a5ca09591be5b450ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/a498e09abbec374c690fd7a5ca09591be5b450ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/21f140b93e0522534540bc9625cbcfcf4a49023f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/21f140b93e0522534540bc9625cbcfcf4a49023f","node_id":"C_kwD