mmitter":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:44:48Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Replace enterprise license gate with always-on AGPL shim\n\nEnterprisePlanService and EnterpriseFeaturesEnabledGuard now always\nreport the feature set as enabled instead of validating ENTERPRISE_KEY\nagainst a signed JWT. This un-gates event logs, JWT signing-key\nrotation, SSO, and emailing-domain group access without touching any\nof those clusters, since every one of them asks this shim the same\nyes/no question. Removes the ENTERPRISE_KEY config variable, its\n.env.example entry, and the daily cron-validation command/job.\n\nKept: EnterpriseModule/EnterprisePlanService/EnterpriseFeaturesEnabledGuard\nsymbol and file paths, so none of the 15 existing call sites needed edits.\nDropped: the resolver, DTOs, exception filter, and cron plumbing that\nonly existed to validate a license key that no longer exists.","tree":{"sha":"c45a4347e036bd96f4b1d8063e0b725c079f0cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/c45a4347e036bd96f4b1d8063e0b725c079f0cd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/11ee7927f1e4de25638ed6546af807c1a301d130","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/11ee7927f1e4de25638ed6546af807c1a301d130","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDExZWU3OTI3ZjFlNGRlMjU2MzhlZDY1NDZhZjgwN2MxYTMwMWQxMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05","sha":"8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05"}],"sha":"11ee7927f1e4de25638ed6546af807c1a301d130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/11ee7927f1e4de25638ed6546af807c1a301d130"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:36:07Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:36:07Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Add relationship matching lane to participant identity resolution\n\nPerson identity resolution previously matched on email, then\ncompany-domain+name, leaving the charter''s third signal\n(\"relationship\") unimplemented. Add a deterministic relationship\nlane: resolvePerson() now accepts relatedCompanyIds, and returns\nCANDIDATE when a name matches an existing person at one of those\ncompanies even though the incoming email''s own domain didn''t match.\n\nParticipantIdentityProposalService computes relatedCompanyIds by\nlooking at co-participants on the same message/calendar-event who\nare already linked to a person, and reading that person''s company —\na fact a reviewer can verify in one glance from the proposal''s\nexplanation text. calendar-event-participant.service.ts and\nmessaging-message-participant.service.ts now pass messageId/\ncalendarEventId through so this lookup has something to key on.","tree":{"sha":"0fa09cf0d4358a462dbf655176952d8dc68eddfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/0fa09cf0d4358a462dbf655176952d8dc68eddfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDhlZDM2NGQ5YjlhYmI2MTQ3NGI2YjI0YjcxMTczNjY0MmM2NzhjMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d","sha":"9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d"}],"sha":"8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/8ed364d9b9abb61474b6b24b711736642c678c05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:34:25Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:34:25Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Enforce agent task cost ceiling: halt when budget exceeded\n\nMake recorded spend actually bind: a task that exceeds its budget now stops and\nrecords why, rather than running to completion and reporting success. Budget\nexhaustion marks the run as FAILED and calls failTask with a clear message.\n\n- Check exhaustedBudget condition after execution\n- Mark task as FAILED if stepCount >= effectiveBudget (was SUCCEEDED)\n- Call failTask instead of completeTask when budget is exceeded\n- Update tests to verify budget exhaustion halts tasks\n\nTest: all 9 tests pass, including new verification that over-budget tasks fail","tree":{"sha":"fe1114192752221eb6dd3e8ff23a48b53112fdaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/fe1114192752221eb6dd3e8ff23a48b53112fdaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDllYTVjZDFmODYwMDdjZDVkY2ViZDY0ZDAyZDNmY2Y0YmRkYzM1MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7","sha":"2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7"}],"sha":"9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/9ea5cd1f86007cd5dcebd64d02d3fcf4bddc352d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:26:45Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:26:45Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"Add front-end surface for agent tasks (settings > AI agent runs)\n\nServer persisted AgentTask/AgentRun status, outcome, and elapsed/token\ndata with no front consumer (grep for AgentRun/AgentTask in\ntwenty-front returned nothing). Adds a settings page and nav item that\nlists agentTasks via the existing AgentTaskResolver, with a colored\nstatus tag so FAILED is visually distinct from PENDING/CANCELLED.\n\nNote: AgentTaskDTO exposes status/attempts/outcome/createdAt only.\nThere is no agentRuns GraphQL query, so per-run model id, elapsed\ntime, and token/credit usage cannot be shown without a server change,\nwhich is out of scope here (front only).","tree":{"sha":"c867399af931264124ab5bbbe2fc3eeeccba74db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/c867399af931264124ab5bbbe2fc3eeeccba74db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDI3NjI5NDBiOTA0YjAzZjc5OTE4MDkxMGEyMmFjOGRlNDVmNDNiYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3","sha":"6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3"}],"sha":"2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/2762940b904b03f799180910a22ac8de45f43ba7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:26:02Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:26:02Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(workflow-templates): bind shipped templates to a real agent, refuse to install unbound AI_AGENT steps\n\nThe three core workflow templates ran AI_AGENT steps with no agentId, so\nAgentAsyncExecutorService''s registry-tool block (gated on `if (agent)`)\nnever ran — a bare LLM call with zero tools that still reported success.\n\ninstall() now resolves each template''s agentName (STANDARD_AGENT\n\"researcher\") to a real, workspace-scoped agent via\nAgentService.findOneAgentByName before storing the workflow, and\nvalidateWorkflowTemplateDefinition now refuses to install any AI_AGENT step\nwith no agentId — a silent no-op can no longer be installed at all, whether\nfrom a built-in template or an app-supplied definition.","tree":{"sha":"92f88b497210c09a6ae8e9ceb2affcc3216c2ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/92f88b497210c09a6ae8e9ceb2affcc3216c2ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDZiMGMzODc4M2Q4NDA0ODAxYWE0N2JlMjhkNzBlODg1OWUyMTJkYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5","sha":"117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5"}],"sha":"6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/6b0c38783d8404801aa47be28d70e8859e212dc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:16:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:16:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"test(record-scope): pin that bypass is reachable only from a system context\n\nNo production code. Enumerates every WorkspaceAuthContext variant against\nresolveRolePermissionConfig, and asserts that an object-level read-all grant\nis not a scope exemption and that an api key gets denyAll on an object whose\nrole rules name a person. All pass against unmodified code; the point is that\na later refactor widening bypass goes red here.\n\nAlso fixes the FORBID branch to return a ToolFailure, matching the gate''s\nGateDecision shape.","tree":{"sha":"bb4aaf44824bd0b3a95a00841071c070672b0c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/bb4aaf44824bd0b3a95a00841071c070672b0c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDExNzM3OWJkZGRiNGIxNWViYzEzOTk5ZjNkYzVlNzhmOTNiNmI3YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02","sha":"90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02"}],"sha":"117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/117379bdddb4b15ebc13999f3dc5e78f93b6b7a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:08:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:08:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(ai-write-approval): read the proposal baseline as the proposing principal\n\nThe gate read the baseline under a system auth context with the agent''s role\nconfig. That is correct for field permissions, which come from the role\nconfig, and wrong for record scope, which is enforced against the principal -\nand a system context carries none.\n\nThe failure was silent rather than loud. An unreadable row produced baseline\n{}, hasBaselineConflict short-circuits to false on an empty baseline, and so\nconflict detection switched itself off for exactly the proposals that most\nneeded it: a human edit between proposal and approval would be overwritten\nwith no warning.\n\nreadBaseline now returns visible alongside baseline, and the gate FORBIDs an\nitem targeting a record the proposing principal cannot read. An agent must\nnot be able to launder a blind write through the approval queue, and a\nreviewer shown a change to a record the agent never saw cannot judge it.","tree":{"sha":"529ba4b5f6cdf885ff838f9525a0e6c4e8b3a2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/529ba4b5f6cdf885ff838f9525a0e6c4e8b3a2fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDkwMTAwY2E4ZmM0ZDc4ZTQwODA1MTYxMjk0MmExODdhZGI5NWFjMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c","sha":"07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c"}],"sha":"90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/90100ca8fc4d78e408051612942a187adb95ac02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:04:29Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:04:29Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(ai-write-approval): refuse an approval touching a row outside the approver scope\n\nApproval already executes as the approving user, so object and field\npermissions are enforced by the ordinary ORM path. Record scope is the third\naxis of that same check and was the one with no answer.\n\nA scope pre-flight now runs before conflict detection and marks blocked items\nOUT_OF_SCOPE, aborting the batch and returning the proposal to PENDING. It\nruns first on purpose: hasBaselineConflict reports an empty read as a\nconflict, and under record scope an empty read now also means \"you may not\nsee this row\" - which would tell the reviewer to re-read a record they are\nnot allowed to open.\n\nTelling the two apart needs a bypass probe, so the probe converts it to a\nsingle boolean and lets no field value cross back. A test pins that no apply\never runs with a bypass config, and a second pins that the automation\nblocklist waiver (isHumanApproved) still carries the approver principal - the\ntwo exemptions sit four lines apart and read as one.","tree":{"sha":"b5d4d5b6271afe6853dc24fd0d94540d04869aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/b5d4d5b6271afe6853dc24fd0d94540d04869aab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDA3MDMwYjg0MmIzM2MxMzg0NDIzM2FmZjYzZmNjN2RlOTAwMzNmN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef","sha":"76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef"}],"sha":"07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/07030b842b33c13844233aff63fcc7de90033f7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:59:17Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:59:17Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(ingestion-noise-filter): import PermissionsModule so the app can boot\n\nIngestionSuppressionResolver is decorated with\nSettingsPermissionGuard(PermissionFlagType.WORKSPACE), which injects\nPermissionsService, but the module imported only KeyValuePairModule. Nest\ntherefore failed to resolve the guard and the whole application aborted:\n\n  Nest can''t resolve dependencies of the 388b5602042d8859d0750 (?).\n  Please make sure that the argument PermissionsService at index [0] is\n  available in the IngestionNoiseFilterModule module.\n\nSame defect, same fix as 94be1e2b6c did for the guided-import resolver.\n\nVerified by running the real thing: before this change\n`node dist/command/command.js run-instance-commands` aborted on the DI error\nabove; after it, 182 legacy TypeORM migrations plus all 2-28 instance\ncommands complete with exit 0, and the integration harness boots the full\nAppModule on port 4000.","tree":{"sha":"25c9c1d397a47c28b1be9699b5a6c90b1d060f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/25c9c1d397a47c28b1be9699b5a6c90b1d060f73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDc2YjY5MzcwMzRkZWIwZGY5MzQ4MDI3NTk5MDdhZTc2NTNkYzE2ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a","sha":"c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a"}],"sha":"76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/76b6937034deb0df934802759907ae7653dc16ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:57:09Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:57:09Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(record-scope): render a scope to SQL and evaluate it in memory, proven equal\n\nThe query builders evaluate a scope in Postgres and the write-side guard\nevaluates the same scope in JavaScript. A shared case table asserts both.\n\nThe parity harness earned itself immediately: eq and in rendered to plain\n= and = ANY, which are NULL rather than FALSE against a NULL column, and a\nNULL under a NOT stays NULL. Three cases diverged. Comparisons are now\ntwo-valued throughout (IS NOT DISTINCT FROM, IS DISTINCT FROM, an explicit\nIS NOT NULL guard on in), so a user cannot write a row they cannot read.","tree":{"sha":"4b7cf506ed2fd4ab06b860de1bdeee1179cdbf25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/4b7cf506ed2fd4ab06b860de1bdeee1179cdbf25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKGM1YWY2MzA1NDc0NTMzZjBiOWQxYTBmNTI2ZGE5NzI0OWEyYzI0N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3","sha":"272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3"}],"sha":"c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/c5af6305474533f0b9d1a0f526da97249a2c247a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:52:47Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:52:47Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(record-scope): compile rules to a scope and compose scopes across roles\n\nRules within one (role, object) are grants and union. Roles union or\nintersect according to the RolePermissionConfig arm. A rule referencing a\nprincipal attribute the caller lacks is dropped whole, not node by node, so\na negated reference cannot invert a missing principal into a grant.\n\nReplaces computePermissionIntersection''s row-level behaviour, which filtered\none role''s predicates down to fields every other role also constrained and\ntherefore dropped everything when two roles scoped disjoint fields - ending\nup strictly wider than either role alone.","tree":{"sha":"b14862ba911c3f83ce6bb4144f4113b1dbfaad65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/b14862ba911c3f83ce6bb4144f4113b1dbfaad65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDI3MmE4MzFjYjJlM2VjNTdhMzYzODJmNmQ1NTMwOTI3ZmU3ODI0ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/8b7731514b0eedbde8a50ba1f6c21ae3f5e47afe","sha":"8b7731514b0eedbde8a50ba1f6c21ae3f5e47afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/8b7731514b0eedbde8a50ba1f6c21ae3f5e47afe"}],"sha":"272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/272a831cb2e3ec57a36382f6d5530927fe7824e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/8b7731514b0eedbde8a50ba1f6c21ae3f5e47afe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:50:50Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:50:50Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"feat(record-scope): resolve the request principal from the auth context alone\n\nOnly a user context carries all three attributes. A pending activation user\nhas no workspace member row; api keys, applications and system contexts have\nno human identity at all, so they get an empty principal and every\nprincipal-parameterised rule on their role will fail closed.","tree":{"sha":"2615eeb530ec1b44af2d70c51706ef0a12bc2853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/2615eeb530ec1b44af2d70c51706ef0a12bc28