https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f","sha":"ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f"}],"sha":"fa07f8d4c4509fef497d7f96132ba964e2eaaccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/fa07f8d4c4509fef497d7f96132ba964e2eaaccd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:15:16Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:15:16Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(ai-write-approval): close four Stage 3 carried defects\n\n3.1: partial unique index IDX_PROPOSAL_THREAD_PENDING_UNIQUE on\nproposal (workspaceId, threadId) WHERE status=''PENDING'', registered\nin INSTANCE_COMMANDS (unlike a prior command that shipped unregistered\nand never ran). getOrCreatePendingProposal now catches the unique\nviolation and joins the concurrent winner instead of propagating.\n\n3.2: was already shipped (IDX_PROPOSAL_SOURCE_KEY_UNIQUE,\n2-28-...-1786200000000) and already registered — verified, no change\nneeded.\n\n3.4: an unclassified CRUD op used to gate as STATIC_TOOL with a null\ntoolId, which applyStaticTool can never replay. The item reached\nFAILED on the first approval attempt and, since reject() only clears\na PENDING proposal, stayed permanently stuck. ProposalGateService now\nFORBIDs it before any proposal or item is created.\n\n3.6: AiWritePolicyService.resolveMode indexed policy.overrides (a\nplain object literal) directly by object/field/tool name, so a name\nmatching an Object.prototype member (constructor, toString,\nhasOwnProperty) resolved through the prototype chain instead of\nfalling through to the workspace default. Added a hasOwnProperty-\nguarded getOverride() helper.\n\nVerified each fix by mutation (revert -> red -> restore -> green).","tree":{"sha":"7472edce07cbf4777242b7578530699132547660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/7472edce07cbf4777242b7578530699132547660"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKGVlMjFlMWViMWYyODNkNDMwYWZiMDVlYTA1ZGZmN2UwYWFlMjAzOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/a2a23e7bed9e847d84360eca22f3da790fc8e89c","sha":"a2a23e7bed9e847d84360eca22f3da790fc8e89c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/a2a23e7bed9e847d84360eca22f3da790fc8e89c"}],"sha":"ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/ee21e1eb1f283d430afb05ea05dff7e0aae2039f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/a2a23e7bed9e847d84360eca22f3da790fc8e89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:06:54Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:06:54Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(ai-approvals): explain CONFLICTED status honestly, add route-guard drift test\n\n- ProposalDiffTable no longer claims a CONFLICTED item \"changed since it was\n  proposed\" when the server (hasBaselineConflict) also marks records\n  CONFLICTED for a deleted or now-unreadable record, with no way for the\n  front to tell which. Message now names all three possibilities so\n  reviewers aren''t misled about the cause.\n- Add SettingsRoutesApprovalGuard test: reads SettingsRoutes.tsx and\n  proposal.resolver.ts and asserts the front route''s PermissionFlagType\n  matches the server resolver''s guard, so a future edit to either side\n  fails the suite instead of silently locking reviewers out of (or exposing)\n  the approval inbox. Verified by mutation: reverting the AI_SETTINGS fix\n  turns this test red.\n\nStage 3 items 3.5 and 3.8. Item 3.7 (generated GraphQL types) needs a\nrunning server and was not attempted; server boot is owned by another\nin-flight agent per project rules.","tree":{"sha":"c6fbbb28e9fdb3927105d9d019b17d5a397ff768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/c6fbbb28e9fdb3927105d9d019b17d5a397ff768"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/a2a23e7bed9e847d84360eca22f3da790fc8e89c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizatio