07f79041f0bb5e69a47f75cf66dfc989f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:55:06Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:55:06Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"fix(settings): make workflow templates reachable and give it real states\n\nPhase-4 review I2. The route was only reachable by typing the URL and sat\nunder AI_SETTINGS while both resolvers guard on WORKFLOWS, so entitled\nusers were locked out and unentitled users got a page whose query and\nmutation both failed. Move the route to WORKFLOWS and register it in the\nsettings navigation under the same flag.\n\nThe page had loading and nothing else: add error, empty, installing and\ninstalled states, and surface install success/failure through snack bars\ninstead of leaving a rejected mutation as an unhandled rejection.","tree":{"sha":"203d6743d49ac417b8f5f8714519d6c6016bdff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/203d6743d49ac417b8f5f8714519d6c6016bdff9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/1e12b4607f79041f0bb5e69a47f75cf66dfc989f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/1e12b4607f79041f0bb5e69a47f75cf66dfc989f","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDFlMTJiNDYwN2Y3OTA0MWYwYmI1ZTY5YTQ3Zjc1Y2Y2NmRmYzk4OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4","sha":"7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4"}],"sha":"1e12b4607f79041f0bb5e69a47f75cf66dfc989f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/1e12b4607f79041f0bb5e69a47f75cf66dfc989f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:51:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:51:04Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"test(ai-write-approval): make the delete confirmation gate killable\n\nPhase-4 review C3. Disabling the token comparison entirely turned no\nrunnable test red. Add five gate-level tests (missing token, correct\ntoken, record A''s token against record B, narrow token against a widened\ndelete_many, key-order stability) and one executor test proving\nCONFIRMATION_REQUIRED short-circuits before DeleteRecordService.\n\nAlso I4''s key-order note: the delete_many basis now canonicalizes the\nfilter (buildDeleteFilterBasis) so a model that reorders keys on the\nretry does not loop against its own token.\n\nVerified by mutation: ''if (false && ...)'' on the comparison fails 3 of\nthe 5 gate tests; deleting the executor''s CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED branch\nfails the executor test. Both reverted and re-run green.","tree":{"sha":"eb4316df993627e63dd2bad075730047f0633023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/eb4316df993627e63dd2bad075730047f0633023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4","node_id":"C_kwDOTtosW9oAKDdlZTM3YzUwYmRmMDc1Mzk1NGY0YjZjMDYzNGQ0MmYyMTY2ZWI4YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10/Harbour/commit/d66df4cde36dc2b096be09bfea8b80ae10bc7112","sha":"d66df4cde36dc2b096be09bfea8b80ae10bc7112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/d66df4cde36dc2b096be09bfea8b80ae10bc7112"}],"sha":"7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/7ee37c50bdf0753954f4b6c0634d42f2166eb8a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/commits/d66df4cde36dc2b096be09bfea8b80ae10bc7112/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:48:08Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:48:08Z","email":"vatsajoshi2@gmail.com","name":"Vatsa Joshi"},"message":"test(tool-provider): revive the denylist regression guard\n\nPhase-4 review C2. The suite had been red since dd066b4311: the gate''s\nretry-dedupe lookup calls proposalItemRepository.find, which the stub did\nnot have, so the unenumerated-write guard died as a TypeError instead of\nasserting. Task 2 also changed the FORBID envelope''s allowedActions and\nerror text without updating the assertions. Stub .find, stub the new\nProposalSupersessionService dependency, and align both assertions.\n\nVerified by mutation: adding obliterate_workspace to\nUNGATED_STATIC_TOOL_IDS makes the guard fail (executeStaticTool called).","tree":{"sha":"9c38c2d15c70d9a12cf41d4c27484f741d60f8e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/trees/9c38c2d15c70d9a12cf41d4c27484f741d60f8e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vatsa10/Harbour/git/commits/d66df4cde36dc2b096be09bfea8b80ae10bc7112","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123623531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vatsa10","id":123623531,"login":"Vatsa10","node_id":"U_kgDOB15Yaw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vatsa10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://git