cfassula","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DNACod3/ai-coder-template/commits/462f8a28df2e06ac7d19802ba62e66805cbefbb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T12:42:01Z","email":"cfassula@gmail.com","name":"Nei Fassula"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T12:42:01Z","email":"cfassula@gmail.com","name":"Nei Fassula"},"message":"Anonimiza nomes de projeto, empresa e cliente nas skills\n\nTroca os nomes reais por placeholders a substituir na adocao do template:\n{PROJECT_NAME}, {PROJECT_SLUG}, {ORG_NAME}, {ORG_SLUG}, {REPO_PATH} — mesmo\nestilo que github-project-assistant ja usava com {CLOUD_ID}/{PROJECT_KEY}.\n\nNo catalogo de must-nots por vertical, a procedencia dos itens vira rotulo\nanonimo estavel (Projeto A..E), preservando o agrupamento por projeto de\norigem sem nomear cliente.\n\nDocumenta a tabela de placeholders no README e adiciona a substituicao ao\npasso 4 do fluxo de desenvolvimento.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c635cdebe45fda229ec63f0a1511a823152ef1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DNACod3/ai-coder-template/git/trees/5c635cdebe45fda229ec63f0a1511a823152ef1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DNACod3/ai-coder-template/git/commits/462f8a28df2e06ac7d19802ba62e66805cbefbb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3585311?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cfassula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cfassula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cfassula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cfassula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cfassula","id":3585311,"login":"cfassula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODUzMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cfassula/orgs","received_e