o","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjM0OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecrespo/skills/commits/70aad97577dc54162eb2eb3a781aa95c4c3ec0a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:19:55Z","email":"ecrespo@gmail.com","name":"Ernesto Crespo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:19:55Z","email":"ecrespo@gmail.com","name":"Ernesto Crespo"},"message":"Add arch-patterns skill and wire it into docs and CI\n\nNew skill `arch-patterns`: catalog, decision guide and implementation kit\nfor 19 software architectures. Five modes (Explain, Compare, Recommend,\nScaffold, Check) backed by a decision tree over six inputs, a\nquality-attribute matrix, Mermaid diagram templates, an ADR template,\n`scaffold.py` (8 runnable Python/FastAPI/Reflex skeletons with tests and\nimport rules) and `check_boundaries.py` (AST import checker).\n\nDocumentation:\n- README: six skills, new arch-patterns section, execution order step 5,\n  both scripts added to the bundled-scripts table.\n- AGENTS.md and the plugin/marketplace manifests list the new skill.\n\nCI:\n- New \"Check every skill is documented\" step fails when a skills/<name>/\n  folder is missing from README.md, AGENTS.md or marketplace.json.\n\nThe skill was authored in Spanish; translated to English (SKILL.md,\nreferences, assets, script strings and generated identifiers) to satisfy\nthe repo''s English-only validation rule. SKILL.md still instructs the\nagent to answer in the user''s language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c29c05c20dd4c5960d381b43077c5c87aefcdd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecrespo/skills/git/trees/9c29c05c20dd4c5960d381b43077c5c87aefcdd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecrespo/skills/git/commits/70aad97577dc54162eb2eb3a781aa95c4c3ec0a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ecrespo","id":236349,"login":"ecrespo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjM0OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ecrespo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ecrespo/skills/commit/70aad97577dc54162eb2eb3a781aa95c4c3ec0a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTtpbp9oAKDcwYWFkOTc1NzdkYzU0MTYyZWIyZWIzYTc4MWFhOTVjNGMzZWMwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ecrespo/skills/commit/c16cb960ee5681391ecc26266cfeb017720c529c","sha":"c16cb960ee5681391ecc26266cfeb017720c529c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecrespo/skills/commits/c16cb960ee5681391ecc26266cfeb017720c529c"}],"sha":"70aad97577dc54162eb2eb3a781aa95c4c3ec0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecrespo/skills/commits/70aad97577dc54162eb2eb3a781aa95c4c3ec0a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith