"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:15:07Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:15:07Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix(bff): pin https-proxy-agent to v7 (CJS) to fix CI and ESM require crash\n\nv9 is ESM-only; the CommonJS BFF can neither resolve its exports-only\ntypes (TS2307 in CI''s isolated bff/ install) nor require() it at runtime\n(ERR_REQUIRE_ESM whenever a proxy is configured). v7.0.6 is the last CJS\nline with classic root types and is API-compatible.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6838bbe6e8d15603f3112c636b8f166e1e709894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/quickstarts-manager/git/trees/6838bbe6e8d15603f3112c636b8f166e1e709894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/quickstarts-manager/git/commits/1d738ab18c71404147a6a5ea71d59cb190530096","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions