mou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat: in-modal project selector for catalog install + shared selector state\n\nReplace the fixed ''Install to {namespace}'' button in the catalog detail\nmodal with an inline ProjectSelector, so users can retarget (or create) a\nproject while reviewing a quickstart without closing the modal. Hoist the\ndetail modal to the page so it survives the catalog/status content swap on\nproject change, and gate install live (protected/deployed/RBAC/loading).\n\nMake useProjects and useFavoriteProjects module-level stores via\nuseSyncExternalStore so the page selector and the modal selector share one\nproject list, one favorites list, and a single /projects fetch. Newly\ncreated projects and toggled favorites now stay in sync across both.\n\nAdd tests for the hoisted modal surviving a project change with live\ngating, and expose resetProjectsStore() for shared-store test isolation.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2d1d21c0dc86bd60896a0d430ae7a45ffd5093c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/quickstarts-manager/git/trees/a2d1d21c0dc86bd60896a0d430ae7a45ffd5093c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/quickstarts-manager/git/commits/655ab3f1eb5ec48ef44db7a301c69bd227849709","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url"