97731dcb51768f672fd0644337476fb60a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T03:35:26Z","email":"jkmatagi@hotmail.com","name":"Jakobimatagi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T03:35:26Z","email":"jkmatagi@hotmail.com","name":"Jakobimatagi"},"message":"Add per-browser boards (board_id scoping across shell + both MFEs)\n\nEach visitor now gets their own isolated Kanban instead of one global\nshared board — no auth.\n\n- The shell owns a random board_id (localStorage) and passes it to both\n  MFEs: to React via the mount(el, { boardId }) contract, to the Angular\n  iframe via a ?board= URL param (cross-origin, so the URL is the only\n  channel).\n- Reads, writes, and both Realtime subscriptions are scoped by board_id,\n  so one visitor''s edits never reach another''s board — while the React\n  board and Angular dashboard still live-sync within a board.\n- A brand-new board is seeded with demo tickets exactly once, guarded by\n  a jira_seeded_boards claim table (race-safe) via POST /tasks/seed.\n\nAngular hash-router note: withHashLocation() rewrites the URL on\nbootstrap and drops the pre-hash query string, so ?board= is captured at\nfirst script evaluation (app/board-id.ts, imported first in main.ts)\nbefore the router runs.\n\nDB: jira_tasks.board_id (existing rows -> ''demo''), (board_id,status,\nposition) index, jira_seeded_boards table. Verified end-to-end: seeding\nidempotency, GET + realtime isolation across boards, and shell->both-MFE\nid propagation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80e2475cc4e78509fd3efbf4c6037fe794e1bcde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jakobimatagi/kobi-ai-pf/git/trees/80e2475cc4e78509fd3efbf4c6037fe794e1bcde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jakobimatagi/kobi-ai-pf/git/commits/e6ca1697731dcb51768f672fd0644337476fb60a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git