te":"2026-08-05T01:58:09Z","email":"jkmatagi@hotmail.com","name":"Jakobimatagi"},"message":"Fix Angular Wordle: valid words rejected + backspace key overflow\n\nGuesses were validated against the 397-word answer pool (WORDS), so common\nwords like \"slate\"/\"about\" — and even the day''s Supabase answer when it\nwasn''t in that list — were wrongly rejected as \"Not in word list\".\n\n- Add dictionary.ts: an 8.5k-word accepted-guess set (system word list ∪\n  the answer pool, so every possible answer is always a valid guess).\n- Validate isValidGuess against GUESS_DICTIONARY instead of WORDS.\n- Keyboard: the backspace key used <mat-icon>, but the Material Icons font\n  is never loaded, so it rendered the literal word \"backspace\" and\n  overflowed the key. Replace with a dependency-free \"⌫\" glyph and drop the\n  now-unused MatIconModule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b203cb18a803af240d715bdfda35b9ca5032d0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jakobimatagi/kobi-ai-pf/git/trees/b203cb18a803af240d715bdfda35b9ca5032d0b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jakobimatagi/kobi-ai-pf/git/commits/f036cb1f5d0ef3bdfb8734facd5cb0b3086f1e34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72160375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jakobimatagi","id":72160375,"login":"Jakobimatagi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTYwMzc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jakobimatagi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c