os/PurvaTonde28/SecureOps-Vault/commits/c52ce0f60f82de0978e92f35497e23f376d75eb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:59:45Z","email":"purvasuniltonde@gmail.com","name":"PurvaTonde28"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:59:45Z","email":"purvasuniltonde@gmail.com","name":"PurvaTonde28"},"message":"feat: add formal pytest isolation test suite\n\n- tests/test_isolation.py: 5 tests proving tenant boundaries AND role clearance are enforced at the database layer via RLS\n\n- tests retrieval directly (not just through the API) to prove the guarantee comes from Postgres, not incidental filtering elsewhere\n\n- includes positive-access tests, not just negative/leak tests\n\n- assertions check tenant_id/required_role on returned rows rather than result count, since vector search returns nearest-neighbor matches even for off-topic queries — RLS filters before ranking, so a same-tenant closest match is expected behavior, not a leak\n\n- all 5 tests passing (5/5)","tree":{"sha":"2a7d5fa49972cc972e67fc301452c7f781e877c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurvaTonde28/SecureOps-Vault/git/trees/2a7d5fa49972cc972e67fc301452c7f781e877c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurvaTonde28/SecureOps-Vault/git/commits/c52ce0f60f82de0978e92f35497e23f376d75eb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137887614?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurvaTonde28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurvaTonde28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurvaTonde28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurvaTonde28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PurvaTonde28","id":137887614,"login":"PurvaTonde28","node_id":"U_kgDOCDf_fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurvaTonde28/orgs","received_events_url":"htt