ma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/c4fb974ebdafbeddea7ac776ad94ee942762f591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:50:12Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:50:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"List the Rules check''s plugins in evals.json (#29)\n\nThe Rules check is about to stop reading the plugins from the agents''\nsettings: which Rules a team is graded on becomes its own decision, named\nin `plugins`, a required key of evals.json. Listing frontend-skills there\nnow keeps this repository''s check running once the harness requires it.\nThe harness in use today accepts the key and keeps reading the settings,\nwhich enable the same plugin, so nothing changes until then.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b9afd93510b2752632ff3b20b23b9da22134bd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/0b9afd93510b2752632ff3b20b23b9da22134bd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/c4fb974ebdafbeddea7ac776ad94ee942762f591","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b9afd93510b2752632ff3b20b23b9da22134bd7\nparent 855f9f1c6fa6fbfa4f11ad3f996d0f67c36b21e0\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1790941812 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790941812 +0200\n\nList the Rules check''s plugins in evals.json (#29)\n\nThe Rules check is about to stop reading the plugins from the agents''\nsettings: which Rules a team is graded on becomes its own decision, named\nin `plugins`, a required key of evals.json. Listing frontend-skills there\nnow keeps this repository''s check running once the harness requires it.\nThe harness in use today accepts the key and keeps reading the settings,\nwhich enable the same plugin, so nothing changes until then.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv5p0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVOYQAAC/w104YiIs6cNYXxg3CGqz\nahX9H4ZaHGeX6MKWIad7gJejTXn6oG/meMoRqhv0zLY4ZhzGnfZIIh0lP0SLFBuX\n/aVwA5wFdYrMFZZqoyKlgtf4jYyP7UTZpVhgzZbes2+oNoObPmc/ao12RXkGds7W\n3DSUSX1lDwBDWM6g7HvByaPt2aZ3sbAhTI6jaG/Lxwb+jicTVxnSDl2m96omQ884\n+dHlq1Yn8+gNNFBJIK35GZKQJmK9Kj6Avj8ZEZ5/+7/WGXiSCGu0xhfR2ByN10N8\nfm3DOwWUkLjhhgMERTDTvDro33yz6pGtWg+UIHQyf/FVNibNryOYO713Vx21Uwk+\nf0JZ6J9KG7jHxoaFDH7ss72FO00wpKsRzc0VOqjqdGgp7UpGSwnyTYHbYVO9odGd\nlQ7VJogExSo+6d82Hx49MLK97Nhv2CzPVucg8WVBHph8PX9AEJKcpx3KEqrcY9Zk\nO+PfV446dc1kJq1WJQEMYTP0DPkVCEyUw2+uNOOzfSKQ5jL40WQRSVSeWPl5FTmn\nGzwB0scwcip7MfPUvERzdBpVjxL2E7O+T1/LeWcFYGJ0ps7oVr5Dt6YJjsw9oG5U\njVBWAhLil7iogmVK4TLq9+mG6TvRu6Y3cmNajx1lQ1tFfVoaLCMf8u1JD4uvpYPd\n0vVTITiX41cxfa2ieW37\n=4Jzn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T11:50:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists