:"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122"}],"sha":"8d3301bf9a8ee3300e418781769d16b86c78033b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/8d3301bf9a8ee3300e418781769d16b86c78033b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305502597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:53:49Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:53:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Move the eval harness out, and run the Rules check from the plugin repository (#26)\n\n* Move the eval harness out, and run the Rules check from the plugin repository\n\nThe harness that measured the Skills lived here, and so did its Tasks: a\nTrial''s worktree was a checkout of this repository, so the answer key sat in\nfront of the agent being measured. It now lives beside the Skills, in the\nplugin repository, and this repository is only a codebase the agent works in.\n\nRemoved: `evals/`, `evals.config.ts`, the Benchmark workflow, the `evals*`\nscripts and the Langfuse and OpenTelemetry packages only they used, the\n\"Skills\" section of AGENTS.md, and the eval docs (moved to the plugin\nrepository).\n\nThe Rules check stays, as `rules-check.yml`: it clones the plugin repository\nwith the token it already had for reading it, and runs its check on this\ncheckout. `rules-check.json` declares the source paths and keeps the judge on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Name the Rules check''s files evals.json and evals.yml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Run the Rules check on this pull request\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"773be36551a342215306a99fb715d36455aeac95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/773be36551a342215306a99fb715d36455aeac95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122","verification":{"payload":"tree 773be36551a342215306a99fb715d36455aeac95\nparent a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1790866429 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790866429 +0200\n\nMove the eval harness out, and run the Rules check from the plugin repository (#26)\n\n* Move the eval harness out, and run the Rules check from the plugin repository\n\nThe harness that measured the Skills lived here, and so did its Tasks: a\nTrial''s worktree was a checkout of this repository, so the answer key sat in\nfront of the agent being measured. It now lives beside the Skills, in the\nplugin repository, and this repository is only a codebase the agent works in.\n\nRemoved: `evals/`, `evals.config.ts`, the Benchmark workflow, the `evals*`\nscripts and the Langfuse and OpenTelemetry packages only they used, the\n\"Skills\" section of AGENTS.md, and the eval docs (moved to the plugin\nrepository).\n\nThe Rules check stays, as `rules-check.yml`: it clones the plugin repository\nwith the token it already had for reading it, and runs its check on this\ncheckout. `rules-check.json` declares the source paths and keeps the judge on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Name the Rules check''s files evals.json and evals.yml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Run the Rules check on this pull request\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvnP9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7nsQAKhugnSjWosCBgEbIaUb8IDy\nQUjJHAzk5j2M6+3txczb7wIP+iWl58P2IeIPj7g8GYAGbVbh2VCZYG5GGM41dYdT\nG8TkPwg+PSF6Lj7PpwFpnC8xxNrrv3q2tctBG+FtVZNXadnmLihIPuaUuOEgDTHX\ny9iPLXFwpWJpOtA9YNtf4J/ooleOYPZ9QEpP7GB1e6AVacfoAF+Lbf0o5llt+RA0\nY+55dqdC2ys027WRwlyPAbOSD9kuyJWL4RqpUmMoiEZkc1BbEPqTyE/cf2cHvwWO\nCq3OgCbE7gBrsIrkTcs2NO6ha1bawEtLaE58vbhhSseeHfg5OW2KkTEeqXOQxnRE\n9z7rxQ013JygbJ0Be5f/rfn1DyhqxPI4+72g0xrvMnxSk+zL7DVaP6vURKl+fkWm\nO2zn1qAgeuFhWRl+mMRSSUr9h8xgZYr0KrLuEJk0YoKh1ZVnMdKY2zGi3qEZ1gwV\nlxgeZU2IuIf56MMTuTCqoaNyu084PxmoWzxYWLnrQQcoXPSey27HHLhrM6RQ8Q+6\nmwTkr4PzWP1XazkoEKUmWwMzQosQwJcHC2kLoXUh1oDtcdvVtWzQAsbkfOrA85xi\n682vQdwpOn2dN+/xFM9dsBinmdG8fdf38WZjSjnFLXu3Kt9thcxdMfhOQtSuxzDl\n/31be7RN6HQ4hyMD7bNh\n=Vhm7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T14:53:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122","node_id":"C_kwDOTtvMrdoAKGU3MmNjNmQ5MTZiZDVhODNjNWRlNTM1Zjc4N2NmODMzNDE4MWExMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173","sha":"a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173"}],"sha":"e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/e72cc6d916bd5a83c5de535f787cf8334181a122"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305502597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:31:41Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:31:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Profile the mobile app, and give each screen a mount span (#20)\n\n* Profile the mobile app, and give each screen a mount span\n\nA mobile trace held three spans where the web''s holds dozens: the React\nNative SDK creates child spans for fetch and XHR and nothing else, so a\nnavigation said how long a screen took and never why.\n\n`profilesSampleRate: 1` attaches a Hermes profile to every sampled\ntransaction - the mobile twin of the web''s `browserProfilingIntegration`.\nThe per-transaction rate rather than `_experiments.profilingOptions`,\nwhich is still experimental in 8.x.\n\nThe three screens are exported through `Sentry.withProfiler`, which adds\nthe screen''s mount and render to the navigation transaction. Without a\nclient it records nothing, so it needs no `sentryEnabled` check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Rename the shell''s Sentry project to demo-web-frontend\n\nIt is the project every build reports into until a remote is given its\nown, so it names the web app rather than the shell. The project id, and\ntherefore the DSN, is unchanged; only the slug the build uploads source\nmaps to is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"941572f304c027f3a35aea5f758084f03d66816f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/941572f304c027f3a35aea5f758084f03d66816f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/a4b2622850ac8bff200ab475d72058b2d1b57173","verification":{"payload":"tree 941572f304c027f3a35aea5f758084f03d66816f\nparent 951b2cac67a0ffdb3b7251ebbee756e22ecdeab9\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1790346701 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790346701 +0200\n\nProfile the mobile app, and give each screen a mount span (#20)\n\n* Profile the mobile app, and give each screen a mount span\n\nA mobile trace held three spans where the web''s holds dozens: the React\nNative SDK creates child spans for fetch and XHR and nothing else, so a\nnavigation said how long a screen took and never why.\n\n`profilesSampleRate: 1` attaches a Hermes profile to every sampled\ntransaction - the mobile twin of the web''s `browserProfilingIntegration`.\nThe per-transaction rate rather than `_experiments.profilingOptions`,\nwhich is still experimental in 8.x.\n\nThe three screens are exported through `Sentry.withProfiler`, which adds\nthe screen''s mount and render to the navigation transaction. Without a\nclient it records nothing, so it needs no `sentryEnabled` check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Rename the shell''s Sentry project to demo-web-frontend\n\nIt is the project every build reports into until a remote is given its\nown, so it names the web app rather than the shell. The project id, and\ntherefore the DSN, is unchanged; only the slug the build uploads source\nmaps to is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtoXNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuxoQADZuji+2/aBKYoazhyjKtU0t\nqZqdQhNHb/s8/rXMv7meVfJZrpY9OSJWz7oy+oncjgY52qsGj6dFhdLBKZ9uR3AE\n/rasSvW1/nYnGPtNGuFKTqW3Smuy9GvD+lzP5CVwKCAEIrZ0rP1oWRuDqafXGGcy\npZhQWSKGrVfuEv4tU6VublK9+XbPwY2mA9cgBjqyhWIKPOW3DbW5Ty6v5U78XGDb\n6tSU7fP6I2LlyAjqe5LxAHqu7XSEOiesWLLiJ+cEwqaIuaWxarNM0KPxYH3R8gJ8\nQaItkg2Y5BtxXB8JFSvbjZslynI9tY1fvLZjOWpv2R8IJZfuLtoH+VUNsscP1Exq\ndhhz+AlR7CJHrFcvMgK81I3Mq3pA/Y3cKkhZOdqkBHiRciiXr5oXrlExbjoogGHx\n6WWra9bv0+3aK88JpA4Zmvg1bDb9I2Za972ALEtUAlel/v833eeJdFMPwGmu2NrS\nUAq31Q87qDeuFN8FH6yCmCk0DjYblfZ/uBTRfOyeMIciEwHDcgjKqAxnuSegEsIz\nDwLLEMqF4nFboPydEB3L/eY07h0uvHp3cskUaxAKhHcyoXnad//1n140QfAMO0Ab\nT7iSDVRWqoUySHm4EG02FfBylp7xho4MAcZ8vAZclZfQMwEFvg54Xb7s9fsumG8R\nUyf2meYgN0l+PPEiFtLg\n=sa+R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:31:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us