46047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be"}],"sha":"951b2cac67a0ffdb3b7251ebbee756e22ecdeab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/951b2cac67a0ffdb3b7251ebbee756e22ecdeab9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305502597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/5946047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:13:23Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:13:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Give each web page a mount span, and read the DSN in vite dev (#21)\n\nA web navigation said how long a page took and never whether rendering was\nthe reason: the browser SDK sees the remote''s chunk load and the page''s\nrequests, and nothing of React.\n\nEach remote''s pages.ts now hands its pages to the shell through\n`withProfiler`, which adds the page''s mount, and how long it stayed\nrendered, to the open navigation span - the web twin of the mobile\nscreens''. In pages.ts rather than the shell''s routes, because the remote\nsays what a page is; and rather than in each page''s file, so the\nintegration tests still mount the plain component. `name` is written out\nbecause the minified build would otherwise report a single letter.\n\nThe shell''s Vite config also sets `envDir` to the repository root. Since\nthe split into apps/, `vite dev` looked for .env in apps/shell/, read no\nDSN, and left Sentry off without a word; `vite build` never noticed\nbecause its scripts pass the variables through `process.env`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afca55d539e9d1d5fa6a99ba4a6551f7c68b80e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/afca55d539e9d1d5fa6a99ba4a6551f7c68b80e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/5946047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be","verification":{"payload":"tree afca55d539e9d1d5fa6a99ba4a6551f7c68b80e5\nparent af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1790345603 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790345603 +0200\n\nGive each web page a mount span, and read the DSN in vite dev (#21)\n\nA web navigation said how long a page took and never whether rendering was\nthe reason: the browser SDK sees the remote''s chunk load and the page''s\nrequests, and nothing of React.\n\nEach remote''s pages.ts now hands its pages to the shell through\n`withProfiler`, which adds the page''s mount, and how long it stayed\nrendered, to the open navigation span - the web twin of the mobile\nscreens''. In pages.ts rather than the shell''s routes, because the remote\nsays what a page is; and rather than in each page''s file, so the\nintegration tests still mount the plain component. `name` is written out\nbecause the minified build would otherwise report a single letter.\n\nThe shell''s Vite config also sets `envDir` to the repository root. Since\nthe split into apps/, `vite dev` looked for .env in apps/shell/, read no\nDSN, and left Sentry off without a word; `vite build` never noticed\nbecause its scripts pass the variables through `process.env`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtoGDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATUYQAIXedc8Z9Nia5L7LcpX5w0rh\nQfRfZM4PwjFHKp7SUCBEY+mj+ZM6x5LAhO1T/DmGFK6Y+0gh4ruAQ2oVBO5hj+ui\nPXEpzJiBKIy8VJuvFqWrxkuAFZSGaLz6waWvBIXEmJsbvmKeqBFPMyRmIjmgi+27\nN2kjdDilDq8YsNSdUWs48K/hbn08AVErnpAXQvKfCOrwYNBVcxww3cggYNcoQIbL\noVCXmxh/11nb8HsvJPqaMsY9lftee2tFjLQFUuc23MInLEsPb0+UDf0/+kJ7PEEd\ndx3rS5a1Cd3ipwTXIRCmEyc2DKB4zWPzLmxugq0DbYSb59dhGt7Xg75eUXpgs99g\nH5Jo4tuERL6YmWMP7AZlEDrU/lkRZeaDCvEwt4t//zj3UZI4VC4jY+vybKUJNBe/\ncIhs0LAOBLHclqNQKOnHSeBrLc88QDoorFZUmsgbq6z+ZRLg2oc966/vRHIwosZ2\n1NWb4V/Cl24BPXriTlykgTuqX0ITEdatcwR9E9ZlgHUMDQXEjm0amqr+s/UNe05r\no00XYp0HgnI0O6un3GYn2Gb3cudftSfo4q6ui9002t9pZt8likm2LchvNUSy4xYx\nNV4Sp5UBprfCKCwMzpHqWzWggV19DafS6xKn4PxMgX4s9YkVp6IgyOfrHbYdUrTi\nUUeafJ60IfSSIgqUbrPS\n=aTNZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:13:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/5946047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be","node_id":"C_kwDOTtvMrdoAKDU5NDYwNDdmMzRjODliYzFmMmE4MjQ0M2ZlNWVjZmEwOTVmODEwYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a","sha":"af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a"}],"sha":"5946047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/5946047f34c89bc1f2a82443fe5ecfa095f810be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305502597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:29:03Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:29:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upload the Lighthouse artifact from .lighthouseci/, which is hidden (#19)\n\nupload-artifact skips dot-directories unless `include-hidden-files` is set,\nand it did so silently: a warning and an artifact with nothing in it, so\n`yarn lhci:start` had no runs to pull. `if-no-files-found: error` makes the\nnext such surprise fail the step instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44898a8f09f968ce9b4067b813e10af706a8276e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/44898a8f09f968ce9b4067b813e10af706a8276e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/af2b4085cc08e02d048af1c5bf10dfa78852949a","verification":{"payload":"tree 44898a8f09f968ce9b4067b813e10af706a8276e\nparent b9b5c26e1a0d6287bd7fbdcd27430b4da6782fd9\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1790332143 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790332143 +0200\n\nUpload the Lighthouse artifact from .lighthouseci/, which is hidden (#19)\n\nupload-artifact skips dot-directories unless `include-hidden-files` is set,\nand it did so silently: a warning and an artifact with nothing in it, so\n`yarn lhci:start` had no runs to pull. `if-no-files-found: error` makes the\nnext such surprise fail the step instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SI