gnaud-newforma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma","id":305502597,"login":"aregnaud-newforma","node_id":"U_kgDOEjWZhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aregnaud-newforma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/b2c8025754e1a5a23faf1730d2f70afa0a24cc62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:27:55Z","email":"aregnaud@newforma.com","name":"aregnaud-newforma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:27:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: run verify, test and e2e on every PR (#7)\n\n* ci: run verify, test and e2e on every PR and on main\n\nThree GitHub Actions jobs mirror the gate README.md and AGENTS.md already\nask for by hand: `yarn verify`, `yarn test` and `yarn e2e`. Split so a lint\nfailure reports in seconds, before any Chromium install.\n\n`.nvmrc` pins Node 22: `server/api.ts` runs on --experimental-strip-types,\nwhich Node 20 rejects outright, and setup-node reads the pin so CI and\nlocal agree on one version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: keep oxfmt off the skill prose so `yarn verify` passes\n\n`oxfmt --check` failed on 110 files under `.claude/skills/`: hand-aligned\nmarkdown tables it wanted to re-pad. They are prose the agents read, not\ncode, so ignore them rather than churn every skill edit through the\nformatter. `docs/course/` is the generated /teach workspace, same call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: cap every job at 15 minutes\n\n`playwright install --with-deps chromium` hung for 12 minutes on one runner\nwhile the identical step in the neighbouring job took under one. Each job\nfinishes in a minute or two when healthy, so a stuck one should fail fast\ninstead of holding the runner for the six hour default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7d2bda3463f2551f321a56a63b16d036c4f1b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/c7d2bda3463f2551f321a56a63b16d036c4f1b86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/b2c8025754e1a5a23faf1730d2f70afa0a24cc62","verification":{"payload":"tree c7d2bda3463f2551f321a56a63b16d036c4f1b86\nparent 42ef6f5026809586832b64cf8bd23c1222d7f7b0\nauthor aregnaud-newforma <aregnaud@newforma.com> 1788359275 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788359275 +0200\n\nci: run verify, test and e2e on every PR (#7)\n\n* ci: run verify, test and e2e on every PR and on main\n\nThree GitHub Actions jobs mirror the gate README.md and AGENTS.md already\nask for by hand: `yarn verify`, `yarn test` and `yarn e2e`. Split so a lint\nfailure reports in seconds, before any Chromium install.\n\n`.nvmrc` pins Node 22: `server/api.ts` runs on --experimental-strip-types,\nwhich Node 20 rejects outright, and setup-node reads the pin so CI and\nlocal agree on one version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: keep oxfmt off the skill prose so `yarn verify` passes\n\n`oxfmt --check` failed on 110 files under `.claude/skills/`: hand-aligned\nmarkdown tables it wanted to re-pad. They are prose the agents read, not\ncode, so ignore them rather than churn every skill edit through the\nformatter. `docs/course/` is the generated /teach workspace, same call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: cap every job at 15 minutes\n\n`playwright install --with-deps chromium` hung for 12 minutes on one runner\nwhile the identical step in the neighbouring job took under one. Each job\nfinishes in a minute or two when healthy, so a stuck one should fail fast\ninstead of holding the runner for the six hour default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexis Regnaud <alexis.regnaud@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmDJrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5wAQADkaeu7+SOCgGpmW5vGSsnzy\noX+rHUef+z/UgUF5EbGyI4sgvvMsDoQeuuut43T9bkyr/jIzBJ+yhYt3Vo8rWA37\nDnfAt0fTecxLTbLSrEkLuHx3EpHqZcxPu9Khxm+f/74W9r4XHQ9dzcWdPQuNN6Iv\nQBwuN6REb1sBHl7XFXO3kStW+wGhwfAu1V7duMkUMsUm9kx2Fh/HT3rIe2oQtnvl\neZVB6XMW5ueHWXgsXYQ6Sjf9gSjs2i7AHBrGPmPIpxzl3jBa1gZTChnXFmzHoj7q\nEQEwcxvsRqIri0qBgmI7rxKq5qIr1ntaEtL85ZLSfWY/2cLrsetq+XRMORUL7hPi\nF7hSrcwZCKwfDaZmRtrmv3mxD/9I1uf087V1t0UmhgqjkvWSypnz6HIADmOd590R\n7DyygL4jq4LGJM6giWexSRF2wJgtu1DOStwqNLDGfmVTfs4Wioiv2E4ldGe2h2Zy\nk4Yi5O7i14btTic/2udln4VTObMkQQYsjlN7iRJwXW7zmisxDN/2NrL+XcQpFDFb\n7pdODjz7C2wPmn/LMHMmh0TfxyhqzXuBTW1qTA2dBcGhn8LMsXXA6wKxKn35ByJJ\nArxlCaPz5T/f6QyCDl0mYmhFMuOV7N+6z6lWa2lqeg/nTjBMGRdhSU+AzApWRCba\nOYctRT/+1t3kqsyQi9sY\n=67DZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T14:27:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"ht