"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexis-regnaud","id":15250423,"login":"alexis-regnaud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjUwNDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/7ab5b850a9b92c11920fbe5c621d43816cafec60","node_id":"C_kwDOTtvMrdoAKDdhYjViODUwYTliOTJjMTE5MjBmYmU1YzYyMWQ0MzgxNmNhZmVjNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692","sha":"f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692"}],"sha":"7ab5b850a9b92c11920fbe5c621d43816cafec60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/7ab5b850a9b92c11920fbe5c621d43816cafec60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15250423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexis-regnaud","id":15250423,"login":"alexis-regnaud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjUwNDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:57:12Z","email":"alexis.regnaud@gmail.com","name":"Alexis Regnaud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:57:12Z","email":"alexis.regnaud@gmail.com","name":"Alexis Regnaud"},"message":"revert(server): drop Langfuse tracing from the account API\n\nLangfuse is LLM observability - traces of generations, prompts, token\ncost, evals. This repo has no LLM anywhere, so the integration was using\nit as a plain OpenTelemetry span viewer for a CRUD account API. Every\nfeature that justifies the dependency was unused, and the four packages\nit pulled in (plus gRPC and protobuf transitively) paid for nothing.\n\nReverts server/api.ts to its pre-tracing shape: routes call sendJson\ndirectly again rather than returning { status, body }, since that split\nexisted only to give the trace one place to record what was answered.\nThe persist-account span, the SIGTERM flush and the masking processor go\nwith it.\n\nIf an LLM call ever lands here, Langfuse is the right tool and this is\nworth restoring (see 8c79426). For plain HTTP spans, an OTEL-native\nbackend fits better.","tree":{"sha":"1d61fea3484ec9e4992a2ca2c161f6feae34d711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/1d61fea3484ec9e4992a2ca2c161f6feae34d711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15250423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexis-regnaud","id":15250423,"login":"alexis-regnaud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjUwNDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692","node_id":"C_kwDOTtvMrdoAKGY2ODNlNWQ0ZWJhNjgzMDU1ZTU3MDVlY2Q1NTJjZGQxYjE1Nzc2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commit/8c7942654a339bcdfe9886bdf9ff510503988bcb","sha":"8c7942654a339bcdfe9886bdf9ff510503988bcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/8c7942654a339bcdfe9886bdf9ff510503988bcb"}],"sha":"f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/f683e5d4eba683055e5705ecd552cdd1b1577692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15250423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexis-regnaud","id":15250423,"login":"alexis-regnaud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjUwNDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/commits/8c7942654a339bcdfe9886bdf9ff510503988bcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:34:55Z","email":"alexis.regnaud@gmail.com","name":"Alexis Regnaud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:34:55Z","email":"alexis.regnaud@gmail.com","name":"Alexis Regnaud"},"message":"feat(server): trace the account API with Langfuse\n\nOne trace per request against server/api.ts: get-account, update-account,\nseed-account and the two rejections, with the store write nested under the\nPUT that made it. Traces carry the session id the E2E specs already put in\na cookie, so a spec''s round trips read back as one session, and the account\nid as the user id. Non-2xx answers are levelled (4xx WARNING, 5xx ERROR) so\nfailures are a filter rather than a read-through.\n\nRouting now returns { status, body } and handle() sends it. That is what\nlets the trace record what was answered in one place instead of asking each\nof six sendJson call sites to remember.\n\nNothing personal is traced. Spans record the route, the status, the account\nid and which fields a request touched - never the values behind them - and\nthe span processor masks emails and phone numbers on the way out as a second\nlock on that.\n\nOff unless LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY and LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY are present, so a\nfresh clone and CI run exactly as before. See .env.example.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b08fac4421610e79e75c877b2a99561f1718abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/trees/2b08fac4421610e79e75c877b2a99561f1718abc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aregnaud-newforma/frontend-demo-app/git/commits/8c7942654a339bcdfe9886bdf9ff510503988bcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15250423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexis-regnaud","id":15250423,"login":"alexis-regnaud","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjUwNDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexis-regnaud","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aregnaud-newforma/fron