ll,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/cebe8a494469028574ade0b6ea9271b012a1b4fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:13:39Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:13:39Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Fix code-review findings: stale docs, dead code, and comment sprawl\n\n- README.md: correct the stale \"./register module\" claim in the load-path\n  walkthrough, fix the unit test count (36 -> 46, verified by running both\n  suites), and link the new IIS-SPA-INTEGRATION-PLAN.md from scope/deviations.\n- HANDSHAKE.md: same test-count correction.\n- shared-core.ts: remove the unused PageModule type.\n- package.json/package-lock.json: fix the scaffold-generated package name.\n- nx.json: drop a cache-input glob pointing at a directory that doesn''t exist.\n- provider-descriptors.mjs: stop exporting descriptorPath, which is only\n  ever used internally.\n- publish-artifact.mjs, promote-manifest.mjs, provider-descriptors.mjs,\n  verify-bundle.mjs, host-simulator/server.js, shell/main.ts, shell/bootstrap.ts,\n  create-federated-feature.ts: consolidate comments that were scattered\n  between statements into function- or file-level docblocks, removing\n  duplication and letting the code read as a clean sequence. A few\n  single-line comments were kept in place where they pin an exact,\n  easy-to-get-wrong line (a commit-point boundary, a synchronous-set\n  ordering requirement, an intentionally empty catch) rather than a general\n  explanation that belongs at the top.\n\nNo executable-line changes in any of the tools/*.mjs or shell TS files;\nverified via `git diff` filtered to non-comment lines. Full suite re-run\nafter every step: 46/46 unit tests, 11/11 project lint, all 4 production\nartifacts build, and the federation sharing gate all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a50ddea6de5e51e978ef4ae5cda39ae19c5da3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/a50ddea6de5e51e978ef4ae5cda39ae19c5da3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/cebe8a494469028574ade0b6ea9271b012a1b4fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/cebe8a494469028574ade0b6ea9271b012a1b4fa","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKGNlYmU4YTQ5NDQ2OTAyODU3NGFkZTBiNmVhOTI3MWIwMTJhMWI0ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/ac77d4cc20fbf719c0738866163c0647908600fc","sha":"ac77d4cc20fbf719c0738866163c0647908600fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/ac77d4cc20fbf719c0738866163c0647908600fc"}],"sha":"cebe8a494469028574ade0b6ea9271b012a1b4fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/cebe8a494469028574ade0b6ea9271b012a1b4fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30438502?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548","id":30438502,"login":"SrikanthP0548","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDM4NTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SrikanthP0548/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/