al","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:19:10Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Republish all artifacts at 1.3.0 after the release-helpers refactor\n\nConfirms the extracted release-helpers.mjs functions preserve exact\npublish/promote behavior end to end, not just in isolated unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"100a5dee5f57bc2eacda2afb05c906bc0643e323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/100a5dee5f57bc2eacda2afb05c906bc0643e323"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/0a82619fb7b76b304aa9c13314279d4ea36387d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/0a82619fb7b76b304aa9c13314279d4ea36387d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDBhODI2MTlmYjdiNzZiMzA0YWE5YzEzMzE0Mjc5ZDRlYTM2Mzg3ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6","sha":"03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6"}],"sha":"0a82619fb7b76b304aa9c13314279d4ea36387d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0a82619fb7b76b304aa9c13314279d4ea36387d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:18:05Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:18:05Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add regression tests for the six release-integrity fixes\n\nNon-blocking follow-up from review: the release-integrity fixes were\nverified manually but had no dedicated automated coverage, so a future\nrefactor could silently reopen any of them.\n\npublish-artifact.mjs and promote-manifest.mjs were CLI scripts with the\nrelevant logic inline and no test seam. Extracted five pure(r) functions\ninto tools/release-helpers.mjs (filterReleaseOutputPaths/checkWorkingTree,\nverifyChecksums, syncShellVersion, activateShellCurrent) — behavior-\npreserving, both scripts now import these instead of reimplementing the\nlogic. Re-ran lint, shared-core tests, and a shell production build after\nthe refactor to confirm no behavior changed.\n\nAlso extracted resolveShellBaseUrl (the fix for the Vite dev-server bug)\nout of main.ts into its own file, parametrized on `document` so it''s\ntestable with jsdom (already a devDependency) instead of only ever being\nexercised via a real browser.\n\n36 tests total (was 24): checksum tampering is tested against the exact\nattack described in the review (redirecting a feature''s exposedModule);\nthe dirty-tree/manifest.json-exclusion interaction bug from the previous\ncommit gets a dedicated real-git-repo regression test rather than relying\non this repo''s own ambient clean/dirty state, which the first version of\nthat test mistakenly depended on and had to be corrected before it passed\nreliably; the atomic shell/current swap is tested for first-activation,\nreplacement, tolerance of stale leftovers from a different crashed pid,\nand the structural atomicity property (current is never touched until the\nreplacement is fully staged); the dev-server base-URL bug is tested\ndirectly for the exact broken shape plus the production module-shim path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69646cce52b9d596a4bf2961b9a686059d52fb46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/69646cce52b9d596a4bf2961b9a686059d52fb46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDAzYTUzMjE4YTMwZTczODExYTQ0YjQxYTQxMDQxMTNlZjg1MDNkYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e","sha":"cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e"}],"sha":"03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/03a53218a30e73811a44b41a4104113ef8503dc6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:00:08Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:00:08Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Republish all artifacts at 1.2.0 with correct commit attribution\n\nThe tracked manifest now points at artifacts published from a clean tree\nat commit 24c6f00, with shell.version genuinely synced to what was\npublished rather than left stale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2265ff90eb2ef25440c760ee8e87396ff9d3643b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/2265ff90eb2ef25440c760ee8e87396ff9d3643b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKGNiYmEzNWI0MDkzMWIzOGY2NzdiY2EzZGZlNzhmMGYwNzRjOTRlNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801","sha":"24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801"}],"sha":"cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/cbba35b40931b38f677bca3dfe78f0f074c94e5e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:58:43Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:58:43Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Fix clean-tree gate rejecting later artifacts in the same release run\n\npublish/ui/manifest.json is tracked but is release output, not a build\ninput: publishing the shell writes shell.version there, and promotion\nwrites feature routing there. Neither is ever read by a build, so neither\nbears on whether dist/ faithfully reflects git HEAD''s source.\n\nMissed in the prior commit because the dirty-tree gate was tested with a\nsingle artifact in isolation. Running `npm run release` for real (4\nartifacts, one invocation) surfaced the actual bug: publishing the shell\nfirst wrote shell.version into manifest.json, and the next artifact''s\npublish then saw that write as a dirty tree and rejected — regardless of\nwhether ALLOW_DIRTY_PUBLISH was needed for anything else.\n\nAlso switched the exclusion match from a fixed-column slice to an endsWith\nsuffix match — `git status --porcelain`''s status-prefix width isn''t\nconstant (a staged-only change reports narrower than a staged-and-modified\none), confirmed by inspecting the raw output directly rather than assuming\nthe documented format held in practice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e378ba61fc9188be74e4a7b49523b186c3337e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/0e378ba61fc9188be74e4a7b49523b186c3337e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDI0YzZmMDA4ZGNhOTc0Zjk2YjVmNTY3ZjkyNGE2MDE0N2RmYTY4MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760","sha":"73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760"}],"sha":"24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/24c6f008dca974f96b5f567f924a60147dfa6801"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:55:01Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:55:01Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add release-integrity gates, fix dev workflow, and a shell dev-serve bug\n\nAddresses a review of commit e74e5e0 with four confirmed, reproducible\nfindings plus two release-hygiene improvements.\n\nChecksum verification skipped build-metadata.json alongside the\nself-referential checksums.json — the one file promotion actually trusts\nfor served pages, element names and exposed modules was never checked.\nReproduced the described attack (redirect pricing-search''s exposedModule to\npricing-details) and confirmed promotion now rejects it by checksum\nmismatch before reaching any other check.\n\nPublishing had no source-provenance gate: the existing build-run marker\nproves *when* dist/ was produced but not *what tree* it came from. Found by\ninspecting the currently-published pricing/1.1.0 artifact directly — its\nmetadata recorded commit 1be5cc0, but that artifact contains the per-page\nexposes work actually committed in e74e5e0, because it was built and\npublished before that commit was made. publish-artifact.mjs now requires a\nclean working tree by default (checked live: rejects on the current dirty\ntree, succeeds once committed), with an explicit ALLOW_DIRTY_PUBLISH=1\nescape hatch that honestly records `dirty: true` in build-metadata.json\nrather than silently misattributing to a stale clean commit.\n\nmanifest.dev.json still referenced the pre-refactor shape (feature key\n\"pricing\", exposedModule \"./register\", element \"ca-pricing-page\") against\na shell dev page that requests \"pricing-search\" — the dev workflow could\nnever have worked. Fixing the manifest surfaced a second, deeper bug:\nmain.ts computed its own base URL from import.meta.url, which Angular''s\nVite-based dev server virtualizes to an internal @fs/.../vite-root/ path\nwith no trailing slash, producing a malformed remoteEntry.json request and\nbreaking federation before Angular ever loaded — confirmed via the actual\nnetwork request and browser console. Fixed by reading the resolved\n<script src> from the DOM instead, which is reliable in both dev and the\nproduction module-shim path (verified against both). `nx serve shell` now\ngenuinely renders a federated page end to end for the first time.\n\nDev-serve ports were re-verified empirically (started each provider and\nread its actual bound port) rather than trusted from config — they were\nalready correct; that part of the original finding didn''t reproduce.\n\nTwo release-hygiene additions beyond the reported findings: shell/current\nactivation was delete-then-recursive-copy, leaving a real window where a\nconcurrent request could see missing or partial files — replaced with\nbuild-in-a-temp-dir plus two atomic renames, verified to leave no\nleftover temp/old directories and to match the source version file-for-file.\nmanifest.json''s shell.version was static regardless of what was actually\npublished, silently making shell startup telemetry lie — publishing the\nshell now updates it atomically alongside the current pointer. Global\nprovider uniqueness (featureKey, elementName, and now artifact/remoteName)\npreviously only ran via `npm test`; publish-artifact.mjs now enforces it\ndirectly so a manual release can''t skip it, tested against a real temporary\ncolliding provider directory rather than an injected override.\n\nThe reported esbuild \"goroutines are asleep\" deadlock did not reproduce\nhere across many clean rebuilds; esbuild wrapper/binary versions and\narchitecture both matched. Documented as a known class of Go-runtime issue\nin some sandboxed environments rather than claiming a fix that couldn''t be\nverified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6c1f2fd315ce004bb6af547b47bd9b465a0197c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/c6c1f2fd315ce004bb6af547b47bd9b465a0197c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDczYjUyNmU1ZTJmYjZlZTY3ZThmN2E4NWI3MmYwZGZlNzQ4ZTE3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a","sha":"e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a"}],"sha":"73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/73b526e5e2fb6ee67e8f7a85b72f0dfe748e1760"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:58:28Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:58:28Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Split provider exposes into per-page keys for readable, addressable filenames\n\npricing-provider previously exposed one ./register key with internal\nelementName-keyed dispatch, so every published file was named generically\n(register-<hash>.js) regardless of which page it served.\n\nVerified from @softarc/native-federation source, not assumed: the exposes\nKEY drives the output filename stem, not the source file''s name\n(bundle-exposed-and-mappings.js: outName = key + ''.js''). pricing-provider\nnow exposes ./pricing-search and ./pricing-details, each a thin entry\ncalling the existing createFederatedFeature() with a single-entry map, so\nall ten already-tested lifecycle guarantees carry over with zero new logic.\nfeature-two/three-provider get the same key rename; their register.ts +\npage-registry.ts indirection is left untouched, since the exposes key is\nwhat matters, not the file structure behind it.\n\nAlso verified from source: all exposes entries for one provider build in a\nsingle esbuild invocation with splitting enabled, so this does not\nduplicate the shared data-access chunk into each exposed entry. Re-proven\nagainst the rebuilt artifact, not trusted from the mechanism: both pricing\npages fetch the exact same data-access chunk URL, and each fetches a\ndifferent, self-descriptive exposed entry file\n(pricing-search-YHCQTVME.js / pricing-details-JBXPLBMM.js on the current\nbuild) rather than funneling through one generic file.\n\npages.json''s exposedModule moves from provider-level to per-page; schema\nbumped 1.0 -> 1.1 since this is a real shape change, not additive.\nprovider-descriptors.mjs is substantially rewritten: readRegistryKeys()\n(which assumed a single page-registry.ts) is replaced by readExposesMap()\n(regex over federation.config.mjs, not a dynamic import — that would run\nthe full withNativeFederation() normalization pipeline for no reason) and\nreadRegisteredElementNames(), which handles both the inline-object pattern\nand the registry-indirection pattern uniformly. publish-artifact.mjs and\npromote-manifest.mjs move from a single top-level exposedModule check to\nper-page checks against the artifact''s actual built remoteEntry.json.\n\n11 new/rewritten descriptor tests include deliberate-failure cases: wrong\nexposedModule, unclaimed exposed key, elementName not matching what the\nfile actually registers (via real file swaps, not mocks), duplicate\nexposedModule, and the old top-level schema shape. Two new E2E specs\nre-verify the esbuild-splitting and addressability claims against the\nproduction build rather than the source-level mechanism alone.\n\nREADME''s claim that moving a page to another provider is \"one line in\npage-registry.ts\" is corrected — that file no longer exists for\nmulti-page providers, and the real cost (exposes entry, entry file,\ndescriptor entry, manifest fields) is now stated honestly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5da88e474a6a13c69c4493ca0298929073bf2679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/5da88e474a6a13c69c4493ca0298929073bf2679"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKGU3NGU1ZTA0OTdmZTlmMzlhNDBlZThhMTcyMGMyMjU4NDEwZTA5MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b","sha":"1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b"}],"sha":"e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/e74e5e0497fe9f39a40ee8a1720c2258410e091a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:51:01Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:51:01Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add shell-only landing page proving deferred feature loading\n\nThe shell used to treat \"no data-angular-feature element\" as an error,\nwhich meant any page without a migrated feature would show the fallback\npanel. That''s backwards: pages with nothing to host are the ordinary case\nfor an unmigrated page in the real application, and the shell loader lives\nin the shared host template, so it runs on every page regardless. It now\nlogs shell.idle and returns before ever fetching the manifest.\n\nThe host simulator''s / route serves a landing page built from that idle\npath: it loads the shell exactly as every feature page does, but hosts\nnothing. A panel lists every JS file the page actually downloaded, grouped\nby which published artifact served it, so the deferral is visible without\nopening DevTools.\n\nMeasured: the landing page downloads 3 shell files (105.6 kB) and no\nmanifest request. Clicking a menu item adds exactly that provider''s files\n(4 files, 6.7 kB for pricing) and no other provider''s — verified by\nclicking through in the browser before writing the assertions.\n\nFive new E2E specs assert this against the network, not the panel''s own\nreport of itself: no manifest fetch, no provider request, and no tracer\nstring from any of the four pages appears until that page is requested.\nOne pre-existing XSS-encoding test caught a real defect in the new code\nalong the way — the download-readout script tag had no type attribute,\nwhich the test flags as suspicious regardless of intent; given an explicit\ntype=\"text/javascript\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13acf4b36de1bed25eeabb6be3ef5c7498679c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/13acf4b36de1bed25eeabb6be3ef5c7498679c87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDFiZTVjYzA4ZWQwMGRkZjU5OTQ1YThlMjFhM2I4ZmY4YmUzZDAxMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267","sha":"b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267"}],"sha":"1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1be5cc08ed00ddf59945a8e21a3b8ff8be3d012b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:34:26Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:34:26Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Replace E2E scaffold with architecture specs, document the POC\n\nThe generated shell-e2e tested a \"Welcome\" heading against a dev server —\nthe wrong fixture entirely. host-e2e runs against the host simulator serving\npublished artifacts, because the dev build is chunked and served differently\nand would prove something other than what ships.\n\n20 specs: four host pages, one runtime with a cold cache (asserted per\nframework file, since Angular ships several secondary entry points), lazy\nper-page loading by response body rather than filename, and six failure\npaths that must each produce the fallback with a trace ID rather than a\nblank page.\n\nPinned to installed Chrome and Edge channels rather than bundled Chromium.\nEdge is not installed here, so the default e2e target runs Chrome and\ne2e-all runs both; falling back to Chromium would report a pass for a\nbrowser never exercised.\n\nOne test bug found and fixed: the collision spec read console output straight\nafter goto(), racing the shell''s asynchronous startup and reading an empty\narray. The implementation was correct.\n\nDemonstrated end to end: publishing pricing 1.1.0 and promoting only\npricing-search left pricing-details on 1.0.0, each page fetching solely from\nits own version path; rolling back restored it.\n\nCI no longer caches dist/ between jobs, runs the bundle gate, and exercises\npublish and promote so the provenance check is on the critical path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0f902d55b39f66e1ba98460670c204cd488661c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/e0f902d55b39f66e1ba98460670c204cd488661c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKGI4NDQ5ZDFhZGE4ZThlNzM1ODkwZjIzYzExZDU5M2E2Mzg3YTEyNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139","sha":"849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139"}],"sha":"b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/b8449d1ada8e8e735890f23c11d593a6387a1267"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:25:33Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:25:33Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add role-based boundaries, bundle gate and registration tests\n\nDependency boundaries are by role, not domain: no scope:* tags, since pages\nhave no settled grouping and a scope tag would be wrong the moment a page\nmoved. Two rules carry the weight — type:page cannot depend on type:page, so\nregrouping breaks nothing, and type:shell cannot depend on type:page, so the\nshell stays free of page logic. Both verified to fire, then reverted.\n\nverify-bundle now checks allowlist symmetry in both directions across all\nfour artifacts, and that every bare specifier resolves through the import\nmap. That third check exists because the earlier runtime failures were\ninvisible at build time; a provider''s specifiers are checked against the\ncombined map, since the shell loads first and supplies most entries.\n\nVerifying the gate exposed a stale-artifact trap: a broken config made the\nbuild fail, the old dist survived, and the gate passed against it. Re-run\nwith real rebuilds, it fails correctly in both directions.\n\n10 lifecycle tests cover the registry lookup, concurrency, retry eviction,\nforeign-element collision, injector teardown on the pre-commit path only,\nand survival of a logger that throws after define(). Each was confirmed to\nfail when its rule is removed from the implementation.\n\nDeletes the superseded apps/pricing-remote.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95039a08fcb6ef9bd2b5adca7ff8595708766288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/95039a08fcb6ef9bd2b5adca7ff8595708766288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDg0OWEzZjMxMGU0NDIyZWM5NWEwNmJjZmM0Y2ZlZGI1MzZhNTUxMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2","sha":"89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2"}],"sha":"849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/849a3f310e4422ec95a06bcfc4cfedb536a55139"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:16:20Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:16:20Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add descriptors, provenance-gated publishing and host simulator\n\npages.json per provider is the machine-readable provider contract, validated\nfor unique keys and element names, valid custom-element syntax, agreement\nwith remoteEntry, registry/descriptor equality in both directions, and\nuniqueness across providers.\n\nPublishing is an Nx target depending on build, and refuses output it cannot\nprove came from the same execution: BUILD_RUN_ID is required rather than\ndefaulted, since a per-process fallback would match only itself. Verified to\nfail closed on a missing marker, a marker from another run, and no id at all.\nPromotion resolves the artifact from entry.artifact, so two feature keys can\nshare one artifact, and rejects a feature the artifact does not serve.\n\nReplacing shareAll() with an explicit list surfaced a real cost: a shared\nbundle''s own static imports must resolve through the import map, and pruning\nis by usage in app code, which is the wrong question. platform-browser\nimports @angular/common/http and core imports rxjs/operators in paths this\napp never runs. Both are now listed; a build gate for this follows.\n\nVerified in the browser: all four pages render, each pricing page downloads\nonly its own chunk plus the shared data-access chunk, and every Angular\npackage is fetched once from the shell path, never from a provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d2065fa493562b09c4c9faea0aa633d4c90f055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/9d2065fa493562b09c4c9faea0aa633d4c90f055"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDg5YTc0NmYzNTZhOWUxYWIyZjQ0Yzc4MTUwMWNkODRlNzFjMDFiYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df","sha":"6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df"}],"sha":"89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/89a746f356a9e1ab2f44c781501cd84e71c01ba2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:04:19Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T21:04:19Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Restructure into thin provider apps and feature libraries\n\nPages become libraries; apps become deployment units. Four feature libs\n(pricing-search, pricing-details, feature-two, feature-three) across three\nprovider apps, with the pricing provider serving two pages — so page count\nno longer drives app count.\n\nEach provider holds only a federation config, a page registry of dynamic\nimports, and a register adapter. Feature libraries export exactly one\nPageDefinition and never their component class.\n\ncreateFederatedFeature lives in shared-core so all providers register\nidentically. It enforces: an in-flight promise map for concurrent calls,\neviction on rejection so a transient failure is retryable, ownership\ntracked in a Set recorded the instant define() returns, no rejection\npossible after that commit point, and injector teardown only on the\npre-commit path.\n\nSharing is an explicit allowlist in tools/federation-sharing.mjs consumed\nby all four federation configs, replacing shareAll(). Verified: without\nsharedMappings all four workspace libs become strict-version singletons;\nwith it, only shared-core. The shell owns @angular/elements.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c1fe2ccbcf85c8e463b4e88624ca1ce51854b50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/5c1fe2ccbcf85c8e463b4e88624ca1ce51854b50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDZjMTVhOGNkYTIzYjY5NGI1MDY4Y2Y3NGNlMDI1ZDJhYzRiOGIwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260","sha":"0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260"}],"sha":"6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/6c15a8cda23b694b5068cf74ce025d2ac4b8b0df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:53:11Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:53:11Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Remove backend/legacy scope and merge contract into shared-core\n\nDeletes apps/bff and legacy-host, narrowing the POC to Angular only.\nBoth are preserved at tag poc-with-bff-and-aspx-host (commit 0d86bca)\nalong with the XML-mapping tests and the ASPX host integration findings.\n\nlibs/platform/contract becomes libs/shared/core (@company/shared-core),\nthe single workspace library shared as a federation singleton. Adds\nPageDefinition, and an optional `artifact` field on the manifest entry so\none provider artifact can serve several feature keys.\n\nRegisteredFeature loses `dispose`: custom-element definitions cannot be\nunregistered, so destroying a page injector while its tag stays defined\nwould leave later instantiations resolving against a dead injector.\n\nDrops express, fast-xml-parser, @types/express, @angular/platform-server\nand @angular/ssr, plus HttpClient from the shell — features use in-memory\ndata, so HTTP would put a shared package in the graph nothing needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18dfd80ee0dc7de9af8886b31c6392bfb685ab5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/18dfd80ee0dc7de9af8886b31c6392bfb685ab5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDBkMDE5ZDJmMDRhNGY1MDMzZDAzNTAxZTlhYTQ3YjRiMjU4ZWUyNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c","sha":"0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c"}],"sha":"0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d019d2f04a4f5033d03501e9aa47b4b258ee260"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T19:18:27Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T19:18:27Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"Add Angular shell + federated feature build POC\n\nImplements the foundation release and pilot page from the \"Angular Shell +\nFederated Feature Builds\" plan: a thin Angular shell loaded by a legacy host\npage, dynamically loading a domain feature build that registers the page as a\ncustom element, with feature versions routed by a runtime manifest.\n\nUses Native Federation (esbuild) rather than the webpack-based Nx Module\nFederation named in the document. The architecture is unchanged; the\ndifferences are remoteEntry.json metadata, shareAll configuration, and the\nes-module-shims setup the host page needs. Documented in the README.\n\nThe four claims the architecture depends on are verified end to end:\n  - Angular is fetched once, from the shell; the remote adds no second runtime\n  - A feature releases without rebuilding the shell or the host page\n  - Rollback is a manifest pointer change\n  - An incompatible contract is rejected before the remote is contacted\n\nAlso included: a mock BFF that exercises real XML-to-JSON mapping over a\nsimulated COM Bridge and normalizes failures onto the stable error contract,\na bundle-inspection build gate, and publish/promote tooling enforcing\nimmutable artifacts, checksum and compatibility validation, and atomic\nmanifest promotion.\n\nThe .NET BFF and ASPX host are simulated (neither runs on macOS); the real\n.Master/.aspx/.aspx.cs artifacts are included as reference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b986bbdce3d4ead0f6826d9f5ec24d3a036f0d50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/b986bbdce3d4ead0f6826d9f5ec24d3a036f0d50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDBkODZiY2E3Y2I3ZTdjNzIwMTc4YTVlMzY0ZTA3MWM4MmNmZmNiMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6","sha":"1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6"}],"sha":"0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/0d86bca7cb7e7c720178a5e364e071c82cffcb1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:42:56Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:42:56Z","email":"srimac@Sris-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Sri Kanth"},"message":"first commit","tree":{"sha":"5ecd0da104e81fa27f8d5ba3eb6f56ebc5222609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/trees/5ecd0da104e81fa27f8d5ba3eb6f56ebc5222609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/git/commits/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commit/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6","node_id":"C_kwDOTt32FNoAKDFjMmNhNzdjNDMyNWQ4NzQxYTYwYTk1NjM2OWNhYTYxZTNlNmI1ZDY","parents":[],"sha":"1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits/1c2ca77c4325d8741a60a956369caa61e3e6b5d6"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/SrikanthP0548/angular-nx-federation-poc/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=ff275c0dc6689cc2fa6cdb53970b2cf55e14a4f0&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A19%3A35.077Z"}');
