2e944ff21936988001ce2a8bb27"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/40ab1a852154e7b550e75e16b7940d5136492e7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:39:14Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:39:14Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"message":"docs: complete 5000+ line README with 28-layer tech stack and full system design\n\n- All 52 sections fully detailed (Executive Summary through Conclusion)\n- 28-layer technology stack with individual justifications for every choice\n- Full threat model, security checklist, and BYOK key lifecycle\n- Complete PostgreSQL schema with all 6 tables + constraints\n- Full API reference: POST /v1/ingest, GET /incidents/:id, GET /stream (SSE)\n- Worked confidence score example with LaTeX formula\n- Blast radius algorithm description with concrete example\n- Evidence citation system with PR body template\n- Fault tolerance + graceful degradation table\n- Cost analysis per pipeline run\n- 7-minute live demo script with exact cURL commands\n- Feature comparison matrix vs Copilot/Sentry/Devin/SWE-agent\n- Full configuration reference (.env.example all 28 layers)\n- Contributing guide including how to add a new language\n- Project structure directory tree\n- Getting Started 6-step guide","tree":{"sha":"3ff88757750b239bf50fca308e8fe182632b2671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/trees/3ff88757750b239bf50fca308e8fe182632b2671"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/commits/40ab1a852154e7b550e75e16b7940d5136492e7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commit/40ab1a852154e7b550e75e16b7940d5136492e7e","node_id":"C_kwDOTt3669oAKDQwYWIxYTg1MjE1NGU3YjU1MGU3NWUxNmI3OTQwZDUxMzY0OTJlN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commit/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c","sha":"e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c"}],"sha":"40ab1a852154e7b550e75e16b7940d5136492e7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/40ab1a852154e7b550e75e16b7940d5136492e7e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:14:31Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:14:31Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"message":"feat: complete system — full README (52 sections) + Next.js dashboard\n\n## README\n- Full 52-section Complete System Design Document matching the spec exactly\n- All sections: Executive Summary through Conclusion with proper headings\n- FR/NFR tables, architecture ASCII diagrams, 19-layer stack table\n- Confidence formula with LaTeX notation\n- End-to-end workflow, agent architecture, API specs, project structure\n- Getting Started guide with cURL example\n\n## Frontend Dashboard (Next.js 14 + React Flow + Tailwind)\n- app/layout.tsx + app/globals.css: dark glassmorphism design system\n  JetBrains Mono + Inter fonts, agent-specific glow colors\n- app/page.tsx: hero landing / live dashboard toggle\n- components/Header.tsx: sticky nav with TDAR active indicator\n- components/HeroSection.tsx: headline, stats grid, 4-agent preview\n- components/IngestForm.tsx: stack trace form with example loader\n- components/PipelineGraph.tsx: React Flow 4-node graph, idle/running/done/halted\n- components/ConfidencePanel.tsx: animated SVG ring, signal breakdown bars\n- components/EvidencePanel.tsx: expandable evidence cards with citations\n- components/LogTerminal.tsx: auto-scroll monospace SSE terminal\n- components/PRStatusCard.tsx: PR link, confidence badge, 48h daemon notice\n- hooks/usePipelineSSE.ts: SSE client with 3s timeout + full demo simulation\n  (demo cycles through all 4 agents: 44% → 59% → 94% confidence)","tree":{"sha":"a4705cf492220a5a37aa7a46a47e677660212615","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/trees/a4705cf492220a5a37aa7a46a47e677660212615"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/commits/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commit/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c","node_id":"C_kwDOTt3669oAKGU5Yjc3OWFhZTRjMGE0M2JjM2Q1MmEwZDZhODZmZTI3YTc3NGE5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commit/ffdc7965206652c76730b2f996a7b7ac579d1f3e","sha":"ffdc7965206652c76730b2f996a7b7ac579d1f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/ffdc7965206652c76730b2f996a7b7ac579d1f3e"}],"sha":"e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/e9b779aae4c0a43bc3d52a0d6a86fe27a774a93c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/commits/ffdc7965206652c76730b2f996a7b7ac579d1f3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:58:44Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:58:44Z","email":"jackson@epicenter.dev","name":"Jacksonfio"},"message":"feat: initial EpiCenter TDAR platform implementation\n\nEpiCenter - Find the Fault. Prove the Fix.\n\nImplements the complete 6-plane, 19-layer architecture for\nTest-Driven Autonomous Repair (TDAR) with an Evidence Layer.\n\n## What''s included\n\n### Ingestion Plane (Go + Fiber)\n- POST /v1/ingest with schema validation and fingerprint deduplication\n- 12-pattern PII/secret redaction engine (JWTs, API keys, emails, IPs, DB URLs)\n- SHA-256 error fingerprinting for incident deduplication\n- Unit tests for all scrubber patterns\n\n### Orchestration Plane (Node.js + LangGraph)\n- LangGraph state machine with conditional routing between 4 agents\n- Investigator Agent: Tree-sitter AST + CodeQL + Qdrant RAG synthesis\n- Test Writer Agent: regression test generation + E2B sandbox verification\n- Surgeon Agent: blast-radius-bounded minimal patch generation\n- Judge Agent: multi-signal confidence scoring + GitHub PR gating\n\n### Evidence & Confidence Layer\n- Append-only Evidence records: AST, CodeQL, Qdrant, sandbox logs, diffs\n- Confidence Engine: weighted formula (35% test + 30% CodeQL + 15% blast + 20% LLM)\n- 75% threshold gate before PR creation\n\n### Execution Plane (E2B)\n- Isolated sandbox wrapper with zero-egress network enforcement\n- Local simulation fallback for development without E2B credentials\n\n### Durable Workflows (Trigger.dev)\n- incidentPipeline: retryable TDAR orchestration task\n- observationDaemon: 48h post-merge fingerprint watchdog with auto-revert\n\n### Persistence Plane (PostgreSQL)\n- Schema: projects, incidents, evidence, confidence_scores, patch_citations, watchlist\n- Append-only evidence table design for full audit trail\n\n### GitHub Integration\n- Cited PR descriptions with confidence breakdown table\n- Evidence chain citations linked to specific file:line ranges\n- Feature branch only - never pushes to main\n\n### CI/CD\n- GitHub Actions: Go build+test, TypeScript typecheck, Next.js build\n- Docker Compose: PostgreSQL + Qdrant + MinIO + Ingestion Service\n\nCo-authored-by: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba9b7703493466b760d71813ff0ed7f27369b8d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/trees/ba9b7703493466b760d71813ff0ed7f27369b8d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacksonfio/EpiCenter/git/commits/ffdc7965206652c76730b2f996a7b7ac579d1f3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":nul