ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/bac46850811398e75226956b8cface8c070d7ff2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:14:55Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:14:55Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-05): rule-based field matching with explicit unmapped-field accounting\n\nbuildFieldMapping runs an exact pass then a case-insensitive pass\n(plain toLowerCase, no normalization, no trimming, no fuzzy matching)\nover two JSON-schema property sets, consuming each source once and\nresolving case collisions by source declaration order.\n\nReturns { mapping, unmappedSource, unmappedTarget } rather than a bare\narray: the two unmapped lists are the data the shape-adapter inspector\nmust disclose, not diagnostics. Degenerate schemas (empty, unparseable,\nno properties key) yield an empty mapping and never throw.\n\n25 tests cover every behavior-block case: the fixture relevance-filter\n-> trim-clip pair (2 case-insensitive matches, score + DurationSec\ndisclosed), exact-beats-case-insensitive, collision determinism,\nUnicode composition non-match, and a no-fuzzy-dependency guard.","tree":{"sha":"b2c3edec6e189ef0fb89508e0f18b147217b66e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/b2c3edec6e189ef0fb89508e0f18b147217b66e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/bac46850811398e75226956b8cface8c070d7ff2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co