U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/e1f37578c99caac8e2f9c0e97ff7177ef4db1565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:40:02Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:40:02Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-04): wire the resolver into the connect gesture with the anchored blocked message\n\nTask 3 of Plan 02-04, closes the plan. graphStore.onConnect runs\nresolveCompatibility once and switches exhaustively on the result: direct\nappends an edge via addEdge (refusing an exact-duplicate source/handle/target/\nhandle quad), blocked sets blockedMessage anchored at the target socket and\nadds no edge, and the two not-yet-built kinds throw explicitly so 02-05/02-07\ncan''t silently regress. dismissBlockedMessage clears it; Canvas clears it on a\nnew connection gesture and on a pane click.\n\nBlockedConnectionMessage renders in a ViewportPortal floating above the target\nnode — the UI-SPEC''s white surface + destructive border, both content types in\nmono, an explicit close, no timer. PipelineNode''s socket dots now preview\nvalid/invalid during a drag by running the same pure resolver on the pending\npair via useConnection.\n\ngraphStore.test.ts gains the onConnect cases (one edge, no duplicate, blocked\nsets the message, a second block replaces rather than stacks, dismiss clears).\n29 frontend tests green.","tree":{"sha":"a34d3f707781ea60cd64ab0ce62309543079899e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/a34d3f707781ea60cd64ab0ce62309543079899e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/e1f37578c99caac8e2f9c0e97ff7177ef4db1565","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commit/e1f37578c99caac8e2f9c0e97ff7177ef4db1565","node_id":"C_kwDOTuAmnNoAKGUxZjM3NTc4Yzk5Y2FhYzhlMmY5YzBlOTdmZjcxNzdlZjRkYjE1NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commit/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7","sha":"32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7"}],"sha":"e1f37578c99caac8e2f9c0e97ff7177ef4db1565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/e1f37578c99caac8e2f9c0e97ff7177ef4db1565"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:56:48Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:56:48Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-04): compatibility resolver skeleton — exact match and blocked\n\nTask 2 of Plan 02-04. compatibility/types.ts declares the Resolution\ndiscriminated union with all four kinds (direct | shapeAdapter | converterPath\n| blocked); only direct and blocked are constructed this plan, 02-05 and 02-07\ninsert the middle two ahead of the blocked fallback.\n\nresolveSocket digs a placed node''s handle down to a concrete\n{ contentType, schemaJson }, returning null (never throwing) on any missing\nlookup, and swaps the converter wildcard token for the node''s hop type.\n\nresolveCompatibility is pure and synchronous — resolve both ends, then: equal\ncontent type + a blob (empty schema) on either side, or equal type + matching\nproperty shapes, wires direct; everything else is blocked carrying both types\nand a reason. schema_json is only ever JSON.parsed inside a guard, never\nevaluated. The compatibility module has no import from the store or React.\n\nresolve.test.ts covers the fixture pairs: exact-match (structured + blob),\nblocked (no path, incompatible schema, unknown handle, null handle),\nmalformed-schema-does-not-throw, and a purity check. 26 frontend tests green.","tree":{"sha":"dc755f2b0e6c9412cc35ed31321707369ca82254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/dc755f2b0e6c9412cc35ed31321707369ca82254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commit/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7","node_id":"C_kwDOTuAmnNoAKDMyZTdlYzgwMDQ0NjY0NTM4NTkyZDZkMDA4MGFmNDE2NDYyM2EzZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commit/9528807bf89a2e7096486b4979c5168e21af282d","sha":"9528807bf89a2e7096486b4979c5168e21af282d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/9528807bf89a2e7096486b4979c5168e21af282d"}],"sha":"32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/32e7ec80044664538592d6d0080af4164623a3f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/9528807bf89a2e7096486b4979c5168e21af282d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:00:02Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:00:02Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-04): canvas surface — drop-to-add, move, select, delete\n\nTask 1 of Plan 02-04. graphStore gains the graph slice (nodes, edges,\nselectedNodeId, onNodesChange/onEdgesChange, addNodeFromManifest, deleteNode,\nsetSelectedNodeId); deleteNode drops incident edges and clears a stale\nselection, and is a no-op on an unknown id.\n\nPipelineNode is the 220px manifest-driven card: category stripe + icon,\ntruncating title with tooltip, a 44px-hit-target delete control on\nhover/selection, and one Handle per socket with id === SocketDef.name (the\nstring the resolver will look up). Canvas wraps React Flow fed entirely from\nthe store — drop-to-add via screenToFlowPosition, own keydown handler for\nDelete/Backspace so every removal routes through deleteNode, minimap, and the\nUI-SPEC empty state.\n\nCategory color/icon maps extracted to lib/categoryStyle.ts, shared with the\npalette. 18 frontend tests green.","tree":{"sha":"0453cb8ace2763b97f5e1cb8127125c039ec6f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/0453cb8ace2763b97f5e1cb8127125c039ec6f28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/9528807bf89a2e7096486b4979c5168e21af282d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url