,"email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:34:59Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-03): four-category node palette driven by the live manifest registry\n\nTask 3 of Plan 02-03, closes the plan. Palette renders four states off the\ngraphStore registry slice — loading (skeletons), error (UI-SPEC failure copy\n+ working Retry), empty, and populated (Sources/Processing/Convert/Sinks in\nfixed order, category-tinted, one draggable 40px row per node). displayName\nderives a readable label from the manifest id until NodeManifest carries one.\nRows write the manifest id under PALETTE_DRAG_TYPE for 02-04''s canvas to read\non drop. App.tsx mounts the palette into the left column.\n\nsetup.ts stubs ResizeObserver and scrollIntoView so Radix-backed shadcn\ncomponents render under jsdom.","tree":{"sha":"77f3a7c2cbbd9933ca75721bb55dd1f82d17562f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/77f3a7c2cbbd9933ca75721bb55dd1f82d17562f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/af84cc91f1353c32ee7de963bdf1365acefb94fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us