anchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/ddb099db5ae612817d624e4d396719f8bada3e12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:36:59Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:36:59Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-03): wire generated Connect-RPC client into Zustand registry store\n\nTask 2 of Plan 02-03. orchestratorClient builds a typed client over the\ngenerated Orchestrator descriptor against the /rpc same-origin proxy.\ngraphStore''s registry slice (manifestRegistry / registryStatus /\nregistryError / fetchRegistry) is the app''s single source of graph truth;\nfetchRegistry guards against concurrent calls and is safe to re-invoke\nafter failure (the Retry path). Tests mock at the client module boundary.","tree":{"sha":"6018dc850af691d53b9291d40db1833acccbb182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/6018dc850af691d53b9291d40db1833acccbb182"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/ddb099db5ae612817d624e4d396719f8bada3e12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a