om/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/d4c5681d0d85a619c231eb25f66815179a651d4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:52:31Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:52:50Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-03): scaffold pnpm/Turborepo workspace and frontend app shell\n\npnpm-workspace.yaml (frontend, gen/ts), turbo.json (dev/build/test/\ntypecheck), and a root package.json delegating to turbo. Removed the\nstray npm artifacts (package-lock.json, node_modules) that Phase 1''s\nnpm-based typecheck left in gen/ts/, so pnpm is the only package\nmanager touching the repo.\n\nfrontend/ is Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + shadcn\n(radix-nova preset, Radix primitives per UI-SPEC — the CLI has moved\nto a named-preset system since the original research, no more direct\n--base-color flag). All ten UI-SPEC primitives added (input, select,\ncheckbox, button, dialog, badge, tooltip, label, popover, scroll-area).\nindex.css carries the UI-SPEC''s exact neutral/category/font tokens\n(Inter for UI text, the declared monospace stack for content-type/\nschema strings, four category colors, the status-configured dot) on\ntop of shadcn''s generated CSS variables.\n\nvite.config.ts''s server.proxy forwards /rpc to the Go manifest server\nat 127.0.0.1:8080, stripping the prefix — keeps every RPC call\nsame-origin in dev, no CORS headers needed on the Go side.\n\nTwo version flags the plan called out in advance, resolved:\n- typescript pinned to ^5.9.3 (not latest 7.0.2, the new native/Go\n  compiler rewrite) — matches gen/ts''s existing ^5.6.0 line\n- vite ^8.2.2 confirmed compatible via @vitejs/plugin-react@^5.2.0\n  (not latest 6.1.0, which requires oxc/rolldown/react-compiler peers\n  this project doesn''t need) — @tailwindcss/vite and vitest both\n  support the vite 8 line already\n\nAll resolved versions and repository URLs verified via npm view\nbefore install; every repo matched its expected org.\n\nApp.tsx is a placeholder three-column shell (240px/flex/320px) —\nPlans 02-04 and 02-06 fill the canvas and config columns.","tree":{"sha":"a529336ffaef3850e1f40e784c17f11a91871b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/a529336ffaef3850e1f40e784c17f11a91871b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/d4c5681d0d85a619c231eb25f66815179a651d4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commit/d4c5681d0d85a619c231eb25f66815179a651d4c","node_id":"C_kwDOTuAmnNoAKGQ0YzU2ODFkMGQ4NWE2MTljMjMxZWIyNWY2NjgxNTE3OWE2NTFkNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanch