 server), no CORS middleware (frontend reaches it via a same-origin\n  dev-server proxy in Plan 02-03)\n- scripts/manifests.sh builds and starts the server, waits for the\n  port, POSTs an empty Connect-JSON body to ListNodeManifests, and\n  asserts 6 manifests across 4 categories -- verified the assertion\n  actually fails when a fixture is removed, then restored it\n- Builds the binary directly rather than backgrounding `go run` --\n  go run forks a child process for the compiled binary and does not\n  forward the kill signal to it, which orphaned a listener during\n  testing","tree":{"sha":"08df967c4b719f758379b5c48fc471f3536b3ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/08df967c4b719f758379b5c48fc471f3536b3ed7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/657455eec024f6644eba91e5ee5b263e36dd47d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"pub