r -> relevance-filter: identical content_type + schema\n  (exact-match branch, structured JSON)\n- relevance-filter -> trim-clip: same content_type, renamed/dropped fields\n  (videoid/sourceurl match VideoId/SourceUrl case-insensitively, score has\n  no target, DurationSec has no source) -- shape-adapter branch\n- trim-clip -> caption-generator: identical content_type + empty schema\n  (exact-match branch, blob socket)\n- trim-clip -> format-converter -> upload-post: video/quicktime ->\n  video/mp4 -> video/webm, a 2-hop converter-registry path\n- caption-generator''s captions output has no path to upload-post''s\n  video/webm input -- the blocked branch\n- Config fields collectively cover all four ConfigFieldValueType cases\n  (string/number/boolean/enum) and use only auth_type api_key or none (D-05)","tree":{"sha":"d2f99ed8c71b51c69d91df31c3ce90ace859e24f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/d2f99ed8c71b51c69d91df31c3ce90ace859e24f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/10cf79d72948814ab3eb7a223f8ebcf4277dfd78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap