22845d6ecf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:16:47Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:16:47Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat(02-01): add ConfigFieldValueType and retire connect-es v1 codegen\n\n- ConfigFieldDef gains value_type (field 4, ConfigFieldValueType enum) and\n  enum_values (field 5, repeated string); existing fields 1-3 unchanged\n- ConfigFieldValueType is a top-level, buf-lint-prefixed enum with\n  UNSPECIFIED=0 treated as STRING for backward compatibility\n- Removed the connectrpc/es plugin from buf.gen.yaml and deleted its\n  connect-es v1 output (orchestrator_connect.*, runner_connect.*) — those\n  imported MethodKind from @bufbuild/protobuf, incompatible with the\n  @bufbuild/protobuf@2.x runtime pinned in gen/ts; the GenService\n  descriptors from protoc-gen-es v2 are what the frontend actually needs\n- Regenerated gen/go, gen/ts, gen/python; buf lint/breaking, go build,\n  tsc --noEmit, and python import all pass","tree":{"sha":"237f8ae81570be65922dde45f888da3495fd6222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/237f8ae81570be65922dde45f888da3495fd6222"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/5eb5c21ec845045dbeff872640e2122845d6ecf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id