sers/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/6bccd46a8326d1c548d6c3ab5056c46f8242afd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:16:27Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:16:27Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"ci: buf lint/breaking + generated-code staleness gates (Phase 1, Plan 03)\n\n.github/workflows/proto.yml — two jobs, both intended as required status\nchecks (branch protection is a GitHub dashboard action, not done here):\n\n- buf-lint-breaking: full-history checkout, buf lint, and\n  `buf breaking --against \".git#branch=main\"` — fails a PR that would\n  break an already-generated client\n- gen-not-stale: re-runs `buf generate` from a clean checkout and fails\n  if the result differs from the committed gen/ tree — catches both\n  hand-edited generated files and forgotten regeneration\n\nbuf pinned to 1.72.0 in CI (not the plan''s original 1.71.x guess) to\nmatch the toolchain actually verified locally in Plan 01.\n\nBoth gates proven locally in both directions, including a deliberate\nhand-edit to gen/go/mcpstudio/v1/nodeio.pb.go to confirm the staleness\ncheck actually catches drift (then reverted).\n\nAlso adds README.md documenting the proto/ -> buf generate -> gen/\ncontract layout, the CI gates, and the round-trip proof.\n\nPhase 1 (Proto Contracts & Foundations) is now 3/3 plans complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f9267b15ac5f97171bdbbfef13f0fc9e2127c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/8f9267b15ac5f97171bdbbfef13f0fc9e2127c3d"},"url"