aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/commits/e7c021d9aaaff2bb4a9fe1ea1985437ea5d60c19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:13:00Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:13:00Z","email":"133811904+aaryanmanchanda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"aaryanmanchanda"},"message":"feat: proto contracts + cross-language round-trip proof (Phase 1, Plans 01-02)\n\nPlan 01 — buf workspace and proto contract:\n- buf.yaml (v2 workspace, STANDARD lint, documented except for\n  RPC_RESPONSE_STANDARD_NAME/SERVICE_SUFFIX to keep Runner/Orchestrator/\n  NodeEvent/RunEvent names) and buf.gen.yaml (managed mode, 7 plugins)\n- Four proto files: nodeio.proto (BlobRef, NodeIO oneof), manifest.proto\n  (SocketDef, ConfigFieldDef, ConverterPair, NodeManifest), runner.proto\n  (ExecuteNode unary+streaming, Runner service), orchestrator.proto\n  (Pipeline, RunEvent, Orchestrator service)\n- Generated Go/TS/Python stubs under gen/, each verified to compile/\n  typecheck/import in isolation\n\nPlan 02 — cross-language round-trip proof:\n- runners/python/server.py: throwaway RunnerServicer implementing\n  ExecuteNode as a one-shot generator yielding STATUS_SUCCEEDED\n- orchestrator/cmd/roundtrip/main.go: Go client exercising the generated\n  contract against the Python server over gRPC\n- scripts/roundtrip.sh: starts server, polls port, runs client,\n  propagates exit code, trap-based cleanup\n- Verified both positive (exit 0) and negative (handler broken -> exit 1)\n  paths, no orphaned processes after either run\n\nAlso: PROJECT.md updated to reflect no-ownership/sandbox model\n(local_sessions replaces users/owner_id; sharing is export/import of a\nfile, not a hosted feature). .gitignore added (.venv/, __pycache__/,\nnode_modules/, .DS_Store).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38b2927cd5e76cc5ccb4c899e1ae374be5eeea5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/trees/38b2927cd5e76cc5ccb4c899e1ae374be5eeea5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaryanmanchanda/mcp-studio/git/commits/e7c021d9aaaff2bb4a9fe1ea1985437ea5d60c19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133811904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaryanmanchanda","id":133811904,"login":"aaryanmanchanda","node_id":"U_kgDOB_nOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaryanmanchanda/repos","