with the id as muted monospace beneath it.\n\nWhen the name lookup fails the id takes the h1 slot rather than being\nprinted twice.","tree":{"sha":"b6477da7ae6c23f7c10b649fd61be505900f4fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/b6477da7ae6c23f7c10b649fd61be505900f4fab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/3b3dde550a02d1cc5981842339ed27b6cdbd38d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/3b3dde550a02d1cc5981842339ed27b6cdbd38d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTuL8q9oAKDNiM2RkZTU1MGEwMmQxY2M1OTgxODQyMzM5ZWQyN2I2Y2RiZDM4ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40","sha":"2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40"}],"sha":"3b3dde550a02d1cc5981842339ed27b6cdbd38d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/3b3dde550a02d1cc5981842339ed27b6cdbd38d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:00:53Z","email":"syed.sajjad@A006-01462.local","name":"Syed Sajjad  Hussain Shah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:00:53Z","email":"syed.sajjad@A006-01462.local","name":"Syed Sajjad  Hussain Shah"},"message":"fix: unclip report tooltip, show course name, paginate report tables\n\nThree fixes on the Course reports page:\n\n- The info tooltip in the \"Generate report\" dropdown was cut off at the\n  right edge of the viewport. react-bootstrap turns Popper''s `flip` off\n  unless the placement string contains \"auto\", so `placement=\"right\"`\n  could only shift along the cross axis and ran off screen when the menu\n  sat at the right edge of the card. Place it left and enable `flip`.\n\n- The header showed only the raw course id. There is no single-course\n  endpoint, so look the display name up through the existing course list\n  endpoint (the same approach CourseIdField already uses) and render it\n  above the id. The lookup is best-effort: a failure leaves the name\n  blank rather than raising the page-level error alert.\n\n- Downloads and Certificates rendered every row in one table. Both\n  endpoints return the full list in one response, so paginate client\n  side at 10 rows per page. `autoResetPage: false` keeps the 10s\n  downloads poll from bouncing the user back to page 1 each tick.\n\nAlso drops the em dashes from the RolesPage test fixtures to match the\nrole descriptions now served by the backend.","tree":{"sha":"ab154f9be8adfa0680e6a716808d687d39bc3a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/ab154f9be8adfa0680e6a716808d687d39bc3a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40","node_id":"C_kwDOTuL8q9oAKDJiNTc1NDcwNmVhOGE1ZWI4YjJkOWMzZDZiZWQ5YTczYWUyNmZlNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/b91971c54b9c634c8c1417c6af82cc2863101d88","sha":"b91971c54b9c634c8c1417c6af82cc2863101d88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/b91971c54b9c634c8c1417c6af82cc2863101d88"}],"sha":"2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/2b5754706ea8a5eb8b2d9c3d6bed9a73ae26fe40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avata