ir"},"message":"feat: prominent enroll/unenroll result banner + auto-scroll\n\nThe only success feedback was a results table below a tall form, so a\nsuccessful enroll gave no obvious confirmation without scrolling. Add a\ncolored success/warning banner (\"Enrollment complete — N enrolled\nsuccessfully\") at the top of the results and auto-scroll it into view on\ncompletion. scrollIntoView is optional-chained (absent in jsdom/older browsers).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"030ec2bd72cce52488bd8ee3f3ae38268715094d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/030ec2bd72cce52488bd8ee3f3ae38268715094d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/c8e05a1264bc5f4dd48bd945bf58d4dd232de647","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/c8e05a1264bc5f4dd48bd945bf58d4dd232de647","node_id":"C_kwDOTuL8q9oAKGM4ZTA1YTEyNjRiYzVmNGRkNDhiZDk0NWJmNThkNGRkMjMyZGU2NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e","sha":"ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e"}],"sha":"c8e05a1264bc5f4dd48bd945bf58d4dd232de647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/c8e05a1264bc5f4dd48bd945bf58d4dd232de647"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:49:07Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T23:49:07Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"fix: hide the portal from non-admins + render at slash-less path\n\nTwo fixes to how the MFE gates and mounts:\n\n1. Gate fails CLOSED. Previously any non-403 error from /me/ (a 404 path\n   mismatch, 401, CORS/network blip) fell through to ''ok'' and rendered the\n   full portal shell; the data calls then 403''d into inline banners. So a\n   non-admin saw the Users/Enrollment/Staff pages and learned the portal\n   exists. Now getMe() success is the ONLY path to ''ok''; every error ->\n   ''blocked''. Blocked users get a neutral 404 (no nav, no \"admin portal\"\n   wording, no edl_admin group hint) and a neutral tab title, so the portal\n   is not discoverable. The API remains the real boundary (all endpoints are\n   IsEdlAdmin-gated); this is the matching client posture. Removes the old\n   portal-branded AccessDenied page.\n\n2. Router basename is trailing-slash-trimmed so React Router v6 matches both\n   /admin-portal and /admin-portal/ (frontend-platform''s default basename\n   keeps PUBLIC_PATH''s trailing slash and blanked the bare path).\n\nAlso fixes a stale \"EDL Panel\" brand fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3fe5185d64fec10e7e8062768108cbab7c736b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/c3fe5185d64fec10e7e8062768108cbab7c736b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e","node_id":"C_kwDOTuL8q9oAKGVhMTNlMTJkMGU4NzQ4N2UzZTc2MmVkNjQwNjJiZGIwODIxMWRmOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/c481934804f33c3770e5a944e18a8b557bc56def","sha":"c481934804f33c3770e5a944e18a8b557bc56def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/c481934804f33c3770e5a944e18a8b557bc56def"}],"sha":"ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/ea13e12d0e87487e3e762ed64062bdb08211df9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/c481934804f33c3770e5a944e18a8b557bc56def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T17:59:35Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T17:59:35Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"refactor: rename edl-panel -> admin-portal\n\nAPP_ID/PUBLIC_PATH -> admin-portal, API base -> /admin-portal/api/v1\n(matches the renamed backend URL), package name -> @edl/frontend-app-admin-portal.\nDir renamed to frontend-app-admin-portal so tutor-mfe maps it natively to the\nadmin-portal app. Build, lint and 19 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"164ffb5a550af4cca80c05e7d987ecaca6a89080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/164ffb5a550af4cca80c05e7d987ecaca6a89080"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/c481934804f33c3770e5a944e18a8b557bc56def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr