me":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T17:20:21Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"revert: back to /edl-panel rendering baseline\n\nRevert the admin-portal URL rename and the same-origin brand-theme import\nthat accompanied it, back to the last state that rendered:\n- APP_ID/PUBLIC_PATH -> edl-panel (router basename matches the /edl-panel route)\n- index.jsx -> default paragon core+light imports\nKeeps the feature screens, tests, plugin-framework dep, and the ''Admin Portal''\ntab title. admin-portal branding to be re-approached separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87690218d80d11a20bea6a2d4257d85cdb78d3fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/87690218d80d11a20bea6a2d4257d85cdb78d3fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/a66e10c7716f68904276b39abf3aee89044320bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use