","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"fix: align APP_ID/PUBLIC_PATH to admin-portal (blank page after rename)\n\nPUBLIC_PATH is the React Router basename. It still said /edl-panel/ while\nthe MFE is served at /admin-portal/, so no route matched and the app\nrendered blank. Set APP_ID=admin-portal, PUBLIC_PATH=/admin-portal/,\nSITE_NAME=''Admin Portal'' in .env and .env.development.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5ef0575a23a9fd1795243c9dc1752328126584b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/e5ef0575a23a9fd1795243c9dc1752328126584b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/912b7c420781e6cdce271a7437cbbbc0361565ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emraan004","id":6085342,"login":"emraan004","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODUzNDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commit/912b7c420781e6cdce271a7437cbbbc0361565ae","node_id":"C_kwDOTuL8q9oAKDkxMmI3YzQyMDc4MWU2Y2RjZTI3MWE3NDM3Y2JiYmMwMzYxNTY1