emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/3aa2358dd30c32403057e0a89c7235c3dcdee28c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:21:56Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T00:21:56Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"feat: EDL-12..18 MFE screens (users, create, enroll, roles, 403 shell)\n\n- App shell: nav (Users / Enrollment / Staff), 403 access-denied gate via\n  getMe (EDL-12), user dropdown.\n- Users page (EDL-13/15): search + status filter + pagination; row\n  deactivate/reactivate with confirmation modal and toast.\n- Create user (EDL-14): inline field errors (409 dup / 400), success shows\n  set-password-link or one-time copyable password.\n- Enrollment (EDL-16/17): enroll/unenroll one-or-many by email/username,\n  notification-email + auto-enroll toggles, per-identifier results, unenroll\n  confirmation.\n- Staff & roles (EDL-18): grantable-role catalog + grant/revoke; staff\n  created via the same create form.\n- Full API client (data/api.js); DataTable cells extracted to module scope.\n\nLint clean, build compiles, tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a92eb9936b4cdceb515fdd044f7f1a308170c975","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/a92eb9936b4cdceb515fdd044f7f1a308170c975"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/3aa2358dd30c32403057e0a89c7235c3dcdee28c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/foll