github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/7dd24c85bf76a9cffa5bc2e1593d857910e8f383/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:40:37Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:40:37Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"fix: align MFE deps to Ulmo (release/ulmo.3) and get it building\n\n- Correct package scopes: frontend-platform is @edx/*, while paragon /\n  frontend-build / brand-openedx are @openedx/*. Pin to Ulmo versions\n  (frontend-platform ^8.3.7, paragon ^23.4.5, brand-openedx ^1.2.2,\n  frontend-build ^14.6.2, react-router 6.15.0).\n- Fix imports across src to @edx/frontend-platform.\n- Paragon 23 ships compiled CSS (no scss partials): import core/light CSS\n  in index.jsx instead of the old @edx/brand/paragon/* scss imports.\n- Add @edx/browserslist-config + browserslist field (required by\n  frontend-build''s postcss).\n- Commit package-lock.json.\n\nValidated: npm install, npm run build (bundle + theme CSS emitted), and\nnpm test all pass locally on Node 18.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44c69a02d8e36893d229ffaca3d82fd66a61f696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/44c69a02d8e36893d229ffaca3d82fd66a61f696"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/7dd24c85bf76a9cffa5bc2e1593d857910e8f383","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com