scriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emraan004","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/commits/8315b1ffaf25fdce7822c72db4706976768b5f76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T14:19:08Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T14:19:08Z","email":"imran.bashir@arbisoft.com","name":"imran.bashir"},"message":"feat: EDL-11 scaffold edl-panel Admin MFE\n\nStandard Open edX micro-frontend (frontend-platform + Paragon + @edx/brand)\nfor user & course enrollment management, consuming the edl-panel LMS\nplugin API at /edl-panel/api/v1/.\n\n- App bootstrap (index.jsx) with requireAuthenticatedUser; AppProvider.\n- Paragon-based branded header (shared Header/Footer can be swapped in).\n- Users screen: search + status filter backed by the list API, Paragon\n  DataTable with status badges, loading/empty/error states, 403 handling.\n- data/api.js client (getMe, getUsers) via getAuthenticatedHttpClient.\n- .env/.env.development, eslint/jest via frontend-build, i18n scaffold,\n  a data-layer test, and README (incl. tutor-mfe registration + how it\n  shares the platform MFE server).\n\nNot yet npm-installed/built; dep majors pinned to a recent release and\nmust be aligned to the target Open edX version before first build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae0cb5cbd3e169ac95b1f971967da1620288f4f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/trees/ae0cb5cbd3e169ac95b1f971967da1620288f4f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-admin-portal/git/commits/8315b1ffaf25fdce7822c72db4706976768b5f76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6085342?v